	quest.000390A9EC30E123.quest_desc: ["The Fire Upgrade Orb is an upgrade material in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. Applied at the Arcane Anvil, it gives +5% Fire Spell Power." "Craft it from 1 Empty Upgrade Orb and 8 Fire Runes. An applicable item can normally receive up to 3 upgrades."]
	quest.000390A9EC30E123.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fire Upgrade Orb"
	quest.0005C3D91F8DD316.quest_desc: ["The Teleporter Portal is a multi-block structure that allows the player to teleport between Teleporters on the same frequency."]
	quest.0005C3D91F8DD316.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Teleporter and 9x Teleporter Frame"
	quest.0008532839A6DBC3.quest_desc: ["Neptune's Bounty comes from Aquaculture 2. It is a rare fishing loot item that holds ocean-themed rewards, and you can find it while fishing."]
	quest.0008532839A6DBC3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Neptunes Bounty"
	quest.000D896537822FF3.quest_desc: ["The Fluidic Plenisher lets you fill empty spaces with any fluid you provide. Feed it a fluid and it will replace open spaces beneath it, allowing you to create entire lakes, reservoirs, or even seas of virtually any fluid. Connect it to your Mechanical Pipe network and let it do the work for you. Perfect for large-scale fluid projects - or simply making an absolutely massive pool of something that probably shouldn't be swimming in."]
	quest.000D896537822FF3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fluidic Plenisher"
	quest.000D896537822FF3.title: "Fluidic Plenisher"
	quest.001240F3EF282471.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Music Disc Far. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.001240F3EF282471.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Music Disc Far"
	quest.0017A61AF0AB3F9E.quest_desc: ["The Headless Ratman steals the heads of mobs killed near it. It, then, provides you with a damage bonus against that mob type."]
	quest.0017A61AF0AB3F9E.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Familiar Headless"
	quest.001CED1FF4A8E30D.quest_desc: ["Find the Ancient Factory from Cataclysm, a forgotten structure deep underground." "It holds dangerous machinery, valuable treasure and powerful enemies, so prepare before exploring."]
	quest.001CED1FF4A8E30D.title: "Ancient Factory"
	quest.002DBF2D8ACD2762.quest_desc: ["Make the Resonarium Hoe in a Mechanical Crafter using a Diamond Hoe, Sturdy Sheets, a Resonarium Plate and a Resonarium Upgrade Template." "The template can be found in Ancient Cities, Trial Chambers and Strongholds."]
	quest.002DBF2D8ACD2762.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Resonarium Hoe"
	quest.00329231C5A44EB8.quest_desc: ["The Plagued Coat is the chestpiece of the Plagued Armor set in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. It gives +8 Armor, +125 Max Mana, +10% Nature Spell Power and +5% Spell Power, and can hold 1 imbued spell." "Craft it from 8 Arcane Cloth and 1 Nature Rune, or combine Wizard Robes, a Nature Rune and Arcane Essence."]
	quest.00329231C5A44EB8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Plagued Chestplate"
	quest.004DACCD4C920845.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Hv Diesel Generator. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.004DACCD4C920845.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Hv Diesel Generator"
	quest.004DACCD4C920845.title: "Fast and Furious 2: Revenge"
	quest.0051D432EBB727E4.quest_desc: ["Smithing templates in Eternal Starlight are used at the smithing table to upgrade Malarite-tier weapons." "You can find them as structure loot in the dimension."]
	quest.0051D432EBB727E4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pungency Fruit Upgrade Smithing Template"
	quest.0051D432EBB727E4.title: "Malarite Smithing Template"
	quest.0060AB9E6885BAC9.quest_desc: ["Hydra meat is overpowered, so save it for when you are hungry."]
	quest.0060AB9E6885BAC9.quest_subtitle: "Eat Hydra meat on an empty food bar"
	quest.0062DB7D59ABA882.quest_desc: ["Black Steel Ingots from Cataclysm are used to craft strong weapons, armor and equipment." "You can find them in loot from Cataclysm structures and from defeated enemies."]
	quest.0062DB7D59ABA882.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Black Steel Ingot"
	quest.0062DB7D59ABA882.title: "Black Steel Ingot"
	quest.0064749A347982CC.quest_desc: ["The Priest Mask is the headpiece of the Priest Armor set in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. It gives +3 Armor, +125 Max Mana, +10% Holy Spell Power and +5% Spell Power." "Make it with the upgrade recipe using 1 Holy Rune, 1 Wizard Helmet and 1 Arcane Essence."]
	quest.0064749A347982CC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Priest Helmet"
	quest.006A684E67B965F5.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Tuna. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.006A684E67B965F5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Tuna"
	quest.0071D679CDB2BD57.quest_desc: ["This unit provides radiation shielding to any type of MekaSuit Armor that it is added to."]
	quest.0071D679CDB2BD57.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Module Radiation Shielding Unit"
	quest.007BAD376131FFB9.quest_desc: ["Fluix Glass Cable carries channels and power between ME devices. Make it from Quartz Fiber and Fluix, then use it to connect your network."]
	quest.007BAD376131FFB9.title: "Connect with Fluix Glass Cable"
	quest.0084C7098005FAA9.quest_desc: ["Made with Redstone and Diesel, used for the Speed Upgrade."]
	quest.0084C7098005FAA9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Lubricant Bucket"
	quest.0084C7098005FAA9.title: "Lubricant"
	quest.0085099CD93A5E68.quest_desc: ["Once you have a stockpile of this Super Powered Coal, you can start diverting away from you bronze machines. They're slow and such a bright orange; blinding to the eyes. Making Coal Coke is just heating Coal with the absence of oxygen. It doesn't allow it to burn and thus puts it through a destructive distillation process. Once you have it though, you'll be able to start working on Steel and steel machines speeding up processing times at the cost of more steam being used. You'll be aiming for the creation of a Quarry soon so that it can dig for you. Imagine never needing to go mining for ores ever again!"]
	quest.0085099CD93A5E68.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Coke Dust and Coke"
	quest.0085099CD93A5E68.title: "Coke"
	quest.0098FA2F00CE1EF7.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Configurable Honeycomb. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.0098FA2F00CE1EF7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.009DA7C16D6DDDF3.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Electric Quarry. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.009DA7C16D6DDDF3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Electric Quarry"
	quest.009DA7C16D6DDDF3.title: "Resource Goes BRRR!!!"
	quest.00AFF61D1187C309.quest_desc: ["The Anvil Upgrade adds full anvil functions to your backpack. You can repair, rename and combine items without placing an anvil." "It is handy for quick repairs on the road."]
	quest.00AFF61D1187C309.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Anvil Upgrade"
	quest.00C0D036F47A20A3.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Turbine Blade. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.00C0D036F47A20A3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Turbine Blade"
	quest.00C57AB8BDBF52E5.quest_desc: ["Some quests reward a T2 Codex (Lost Codex Entry). T2 Codexes do not spawn naturally."]
	quest.00C57AB8BDBF52E5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Aoe, Glyph Accelerate, Glyph Dampen and 25 more items"
	quest.00C57AB8BDBF52E5.title: "Tier 2 Glyphs"
	quest.00CFCAE410123AA1.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Papaya Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.00CFCAE410123AA1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Papaya Sapling"
	quest.00D7D74B97BC4DD9.quest_desc: ["Bring Thermo Generator Hardened into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.00D7D74B97BC4DD9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thermo Generator Hardened"
	quest.00DCC771ACBC2D58.quest_desc: ["Bring Toasts into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.00DCC771ACBC2D58.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Toasts"
	quest.00DE07E191E60A98.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Configurable Honeycomb. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.00DE07E191E60A98.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.00DED7DF03993708.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Red Banana Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.00DED7DF03993708.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Red Banana Sapling"
	quest.00E86A9C26ABA360.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Cod Roll. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.00E86A9C26ABA360.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cod Roll"
	quest.00ECBBFDDF81560E.quest_desc: ["Find the Necklace of the Desert inside Cataclysm's Cursed Pyramid." "You need it to awaken the Ancient Remnant, the guardian buried deep beneath the sands."]
	quest.00ECBBFDDF81560E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Necklace of the Desert"
	quest.00ECBBFDDF81560E.title: "Necklace Of The Desert"
	quest.00F8D168196F446D.quest_desc: ["The Cooldown Upgrade Orb is an upgrade material in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. Applied at the Arcane Anvil, it gives +5% Cooldown Reduction, up to 3 times on compatible equipment." "Craft it from 1 Empty Upgrade Orb and 8 Cooldown Runes."]
	quest.00F8D168196F446D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cooldown Upgrade Orb"
	quest.010841FCF11E807B.quest_desc: ["Bring Supremium Essence into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.010841FCF11E807B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Supremium Essence"
	quest.0126B80792E5B621.quest_desc: ["Load it with cages and it catches any bee that flies over it. Put a flower or feeding slab on top to attract bees."]
	quest.0126B80792E5B621.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Catcher"
	quest.013F2C38CB78D203.quest_desc: ["A powered-up version of the basic spawner rune, required for some of the strongest spawner upgrades."]
	quest.013F2C38CB78D203.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Infused Spawner Rune"
	quest.013F2C38CB78D203.title: "Infused Spawner Rune"
	quest.0159ABE3AFFFEC33.quest_desc: ["Mobs spawned by the spawner are set on fire."]
	quest.0159ABE3AFFFEC33.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Burning Spawner Rune"
	quest.0159ABE3AFFFEC33.title: "Burning Spawner Rune"
	quest.01600A67092DAC0D.quest_desc: ["Obtain a Package Filter from Create. Introduced in Create 6.0, it sorts Cardboard Packages by matching addresses or using Create's simplified pattern system to control routing." "It is crafted from 2 Zinc Nuggets and 1 Wool."]
	quest.01600A67092DAC0D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Package Filter"
	quest.016B64D15DB848A4.quest_desc: ["Bottles honey and other fluids. Pipe honey into the side, or place it next to a centrifuge to fill automatically. With a piston, it can also bottle bees."]
	quest.016B64D15DB848A4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bottler"
	quest.0174310DDAFEE123.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for 2x Capacitor Blazing. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.0174310DDAFEE123.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 2x Capacitor Blazing"
	quest.0174310DDAFEE123.title: "Blazing Capacitor"
	quest.017668074C954596.quest_desc: ["Find a Bastion that generates underground."]
	quest.017668074C954596.quest_subtitle: "Enter an underground Bastion"
	quest.0179FF90C0CFCB28.quest_desc: ["Bring Shepherds Pie Block into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.0179FF90C0CFCB28.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Shepherds Pie Block"
	quest.017DEB45BBF95EF7.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: Experiment 115 115."]
	quest.017DEB45BBF95EF7.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Experiment 115 115"
	quest.017F85DF6DA4CBFA.quest_desc: ["Bring Water Wonder Sapling into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.017F85DF6DA4CBFA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Water Wonder Sapling"
	quest.017FFAD4A08AE858.quest_desc: ["Has a chance to strike attackers with lightning."]
	quest.017FFAD4A08AE858.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Shock Pendant"
	quest.01815C80D8764A47.quest_desc: ["Craft the Ignitium Leggings from Cataclysm using Ignitium." "They give great protection and are needed to complete the Ignitium Armor Set."]
	quest.01815C80D8764A47.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ignitium Leggings"
	quest.0185011AC000CAEE.quest_desc: ["The Flowglaze Bow is a ranged weapon from Eternal Starlight in the Flowglaze tier." "In newer versions, crafting it requires smithing templates."]
	quest.0185011AC000CAEE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Flowglaze Bow"
	quest.01936EF64C8E165E.quest_desc: ["The Metallurgic Infuser is the first step in the Mekanism tech tree. It's a machine used in the production of Steel Ingots, Bronze Ingot, Enriched Alloy, and Obsidian Ingots."]
	quest.01936EF64C8E165E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Metallurgic Infuser"
	quest.019FE14F7C0A53C5.quest_desc: ["The first piece of the Awakened Supremium armor set. Get the boots to unlock the chestplate and leggings."]
	quest.01B1EAA9A1F29B47.quest_desc: ["Compacts items into their compressed variants. 2x2 and 3x3 recipes."]
	quest.01B1EAA9A1F29B47.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Compacting Upgrade"
	quest.01BD8DF9B938ECA4.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.01BD8DF9B938ECA4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Phantom Block"
	quest.01CE35D4A147F2A0.quest_desc: ["Bring White Ipe Sapling into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.01CE35D4A147F2A0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain White Ipe Sapling"
	quest.01D320AE46439965.quest_desc: ["Priest Leggings are part of the Priest Armor set in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. They give +6 Armor, +125 Max Mana, +10% Holy Spell Power and +5% Spell Power." "Craft them from 7 Arcane Cloth and 1 Holy Rune, or upgrade Wizard Leggings with 1 Holy Rune and 1 Arcane Essence at a Smithing Table."]
	quest.01D320AE46439965.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Priest Leggings"
	quest.01D4383E529DE476.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Ferricore Helmet. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.01D4383E529DE476.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ferricore Helmet"
	quest.01DCFB1AEDFDED3A.quest_desc: ["Craft it from Polished Andesite and books." "It gives -7.5 Arcana and -3 Eterna. It helps fine-tune your stats when an Infusion needs an exact range."]
	quest.01DCFB1AEDFDED3A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Stoneshelf"
	quest.01E03C6ADEAAE17C.quest_desc: ["You may want to automate its production."]
