	quest.06BA5A44D6F83E79.quest_desc: ["The Spud Sentry is a potato-powered defensive contraption from Create: Dreams n' Desires, an unusual way to deal with unwanted visitors. It was added in version 2.3a-BETA for Minecraft 1.21.1."]
