	quest.08092F782620EAC0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.0809BCE3D2AB5D67.quest_desc: ["Give this scroll to a starbuncle, and it will help keep you further organized."]
	quest.0809BCE3D2AB5D67.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Allow Scroll"
	quest.080F6B0890632E1A.quest_desc: ["The Aeternium Hammer is a heavy tool and weapon forged from Aeternium, Better End's strongest material." "You need an Aeternium Anvil and a Netherite or Aeternium Smith Hammer to make it."]
	quest.080F6B0890632E1A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Aeternium Hammer"
	quest.08117AF342EE6F73.quest_desc: ["Defeat a Stalker, among the most dangerous hunters in the Otherside." "It drops Soul Crystals."]
	quest.08117AF342EE6F73.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Stalker"
	quest.08117AF342EE6F73.title: "Stalker"
	quest.0812F7EC36AC22C1.quest_desc: ["Bring Disk Drive 256k into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.0812F7EC36AC22C1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Disk Drive 256k"
	quest.081455DC4E76C402.quest_desc: ["Ah, the Windmill Bearing. Good for self-powered small contraptions (often for farming). The common step between Water Wheels and Steam Engines, in the Create-or's quest for MOAR POWAH."]
	quest.081455DC4E76C402.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Windmill Bearing and White Sail"
	quest.08209E06C4B63BB9.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Vegetable Noodles. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.08209E06C4B63BB9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Vegetable Noodles"
	quest.08366828C21BF8E2.quest_desc: ["It ejects.. this, that, cows, creepers, sheep, or even players."]
	quest.08366828C21BF8E2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Weighted Ejector"
	quest.0837DA117207DBF1.quest_desc: ["Make the Warden Chestplate in a Mechanical Crafter using a Netherite Chestplate, Echo Ingots, Warden Carapace, a Reinforced Echo Shard and a Warden Upgrade Template. The Heart of the Deep is needed too." "Enchantments on the netherite piece are not kept, so enchant the result afterwards."]
	quest.0837DA117207DBF1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Warden Chestplate"
	quest.083DAFDC37FAFA90.quest_desc: ["Contraption Controls let you enable or disable specific Contraption Actors while a contraption is assembled. Right-click them to toggle actors such as Mechanical Drills, Saws, Deployers, Harvesters, Rollers, Funnels, Portable Storage Interfaces and Redstone Contacts." "You can apply a Filter while the block is stationary to affect only one actor type. If the Controls receive a Redstone signal before and during assembly, the selected actors start disabled."]
	quest.083DAFDC37FAFA90.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Contraption Controls"
	quest.08464DBA29C215D1.quest_desc: ["Lowers the trading prices of Villagers."]
	quest.08464DBA29C215D1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Villager Hat"
	quest.08491BDBC4418A41.quest_desc: ["It is found in Aurora Palaces and cannot be crafted. It inflicts Frosted III for 10 seconds. Its damage is slightly above a diamond sword, but its durability is low."]
	quest.08491BDBC4418A41.quest_subtitle: "Find the Ice Sword"
	quest.08491BDBC4418A41.title: "The Ice Sword"
	quest.08499F9D4B1D1554.quest_desc: ["These are the highest level spellbooks an experienced mage can Obtain."]
	quest.08499F9D4B1D1554.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.08499F9D4B1D1554.title: "Magelike Spellbooks"
	quest.08509EC82C282FBC.quest_desc: ["Use this tablet to summon familiars."]
	quest.08509EC82C282FBC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ritual Binding"
	quest.08532DB1F9710D23.quest_desc: ["The Blaze Jet Wand has Lava Repair, like other Tier 2 equipment, and Air Burst, which blasts you into the air. Just Dire Things wand abilities are built in, and holding one in your hand prevents fall damage."]
	quest.08532DB1F9710D23.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blazejet Wand"
	quest.0854F496E96C0268.quest_desc: ["Bring Blazegold Helmet into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.0854F496E96C0268.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blazegold Helmet"
	quest.08561D0E65A2A072.quest_desc: ["Bring Energy Discharger Hardened into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.08561D0E65A2A072.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Discharger Hardened"
	quest.0859DD1482ADD6A8.quest_desc: ["Grants a temporary Haste effect after eating."]
	quest.0859DD1482ADD6A8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Onion Ring"
	quest.085D807883DA768C.quest_desc: ["Upgrades an Iron tier or below to Gold tier."]
