	quest.0910DDDD5C55F0B3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Beeshelf"
	quest.0914A0697C92659E.quest_desc: ["A Beech tree can mutate into a Copper Beech when growing."]
	quest.0914A0697C92659E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Copper Beech Sapling"
	quest.0918ED0F9DD8A282.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Thermo Generator Nitro. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.0918ED0F9DD8A282.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thermo Generator Nitro"
	quest.091D5EC66A61F451.quest_desc: ["Each Preheater needs at least 32 FE/t to run."]
	quest.091D5EC66A61F451.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 2x Blastfurnace Preheater"
	quest.091D5EC66A61F451.title: "Blast Furnace Preheaters"
	quest.091F769995DFC257.quest_desc: ["The Graybeard Staff helps you regenerate mana and boosts your scroll power. It is one of the easier staffs to craft."]
	quest.091F769995DFC257.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Graybeard Staff"
	quest.092E3543805AC6E8.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Glitchy Mantle. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.092E3543805AC6E8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glitchy Mantle"
	quest.093A8504FB43DC72.quest_desc: ["Some say, the best looking fluid pipes in the game, they even sport windows to show fluid flowing within them."]
	quest.093A8504FB43DC72.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fluid Pipe"
	quest.0945C7B89329C657.quest_desc: ["Gems have different levels of Purity: Cracked, Chipped, Flawed, Normal, Flawless and Perfect. The Gem Cutting Table can raise a Gem's Purity. Create a Flawless Gem."]
	quest.0945C7B89329C657.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.0945C7B89329C657.title: "Flawless"
	quest.09520D3AE7761258.quest_desc: ["Adds some speed control to Chain Drives."]
	quest.09520D3AE7761258.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Adjustable Chain Gearshift"
	quest.09710B73E2544DB9.quest_desc: ["Make the Resonarium Sword in a Mechanical Crafter using a Diamond Sword, Sturdy Sheets, a Resonarium Plate and a Resonarium Upgrade Template." "The template can be found in Ancient Cities, Trial Chambers and Strongholds."]
	quest.09710B73E2544DB9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Resonarium Sword"
	quest.097404D1662B6D1F.quest_desc: ["Automatically smelts mined ores."]
	quest.097404D1662B6D1F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pickaxe Heater"
	quest.0979C3068C40FCF3.quest_desc: ["The Blaze Enchanter from Create: Enchantment Industry uses Blaze power to enchant automatically." "Set the enchantment with its filter, supply the required Liquid Experience, and it enchants compatible items for you. It is a core machine for automated enchanting."]
	quest.0979C3068C40FCF3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blaze Enchanter"
	quest.0991A158078981DA.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Firecracker Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.0991A158078981DA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Firecracker Sapling"
	quest.0993EFBA59B7CE81.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Hornbeam Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.0993EFBA59B7CE81.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Hornbeam Sapling"
	quest.09A029581978900D.quest_desc: ["Bring Bronze Seeds into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.09A029581978900D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bronze Seeds"
	quest.09A787FE6D3DD7D6.quest_desc: ["Liner Chasis and Rotational Chassis help build contraptions without superglue."]
	quest.09A787FE6D3DD7D6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Linear Chassis"
	quest.09AA5E135B3F3B24.quest_desc: ["This Machine is an autoclicker it does what it says clicks on stuff, Can be configured."]
	quest.09AA5E135B3F3B24.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Clickert1"
	quest.09B6FCE53B301FD5.quest_desc: ["Obtain a Radial Chassis, Linear Chassis and Secondary Linear Chassis from Create. They are essential for building moving contraptions." "The Radial Chassis connects blocks within a radius and the Linear Chassis connects them along a line. The Secondary Linear Chassis does not connect to regular Linear Chassis, so separate sections can move independently."]
	quest.09B6FCE53B301FD5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Linear Chassis, Secondary Linear Chassis and Radial Chassis"
	quest.09B6FCE53B301FD5.title: "All Chassis"
	quest.09B93532C67F6F93.title: "Alpha Yeti"
	quest.09D1591109655EDE.quest_desc: ["Make a Chocolate Milkshake and fill a bucket with it. It is a sweet addition from Create: Dreams n' Desires for your factory."]
	quest.09D1591109655EDE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chocolate Milkshake Bucket"
	quest.09D690F4DD1D4EF9.quest_desc: ["Take a little nether quartz, combine with redstone, then sand it all nicely, and bam!.."]
	quest.09D690F4DD1D4EF9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Polished Rose Quartz"
	quest.09DB1F5FAE8A6BEA.quest_desc: ["The Waste Barrel is the only way to safely store nuclear waste. The top and bottom of the barrel are the only locations you can input and output from. You can NOT move the barrel by ANY means. If you do, the barrel will dump the waste into the area, and much like a meltdown, blanket a large radius in radiation. Waste barrels delete their contents by 1 mb/20 ticks. So, it is a good idea to have several of these. You can, however, use nuclear waste for late Mekanism things."]
	quest.09DB1F5FAE8A6BEA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Radioactive Waste Barrel"
	quest.09DCEDB89818C313.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Sweet Crabapple Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.09DCEDB89818C313.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sweet Crabapple Sapling"
	quest.09DDEF1CDDC09939.quest_desc: ["Andesite Tunnels are pretty basic, providing cover for Belts and introduce basic item apportioning of items transported on them. You'll want to see the Brass Tunnels for some useful expansions of tunnel's capabilities."]
	quest.09DDEF1CDDC09939.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Andesite Tunnel"
	quest.09E26B54D7355DE0.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Greater Healing Potion. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.09E26B54D7355DE0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Greater Healing Potion"
	quest.09E4F80176CD315B.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Electrolyzer. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.09E4F80176CD315B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Electrolyzer"
	quest.09E4F80176CD315B.title: "It's Got What Plants Crave"
	quest.09EDB43447A28FA4.quest_desc: ["Bring Cacao Sapling into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.09EDB43447A28FA4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cacao Sapling"
	quest.09EE008BC420EF8A.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Harden Insulating Resin. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.09EE008BC420EF8A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Harden Insulating Resin"
	quest.09F2BDF757E5CE6C.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Configurable Honeycomb. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.09F2BDF757E5CE6C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.0A02669DEC32DB3B.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.0A02669DEC32DB3B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Light"
	quest.0A03E0AF2483DC7F.quest_desc: ["The Aethersent Boots is crafted from Aethersent Ingots in Eternal Starlight." "It is part of the Aethersent armor set, tied to meteors and celestial materials found in the dimension."]
	quest.0A03E0AF2483DC7F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Aethersent Boots"
	quest.0A047C9350F91338.quest_desc: ["Filters the items going in and out of the backpack through pipes."]
	quest.0A047C9350F91338.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Filter Upgrade"
	quest.0A229A0E21A22447.quest_desc: ["Bring Limited Diamond Barrel 1 into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.0A229A0E21A22447.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Limited Diamond Barrel 1"
	quest.0A2948B16FA2D8C8.quest_desc: ["Bring Battery Niotic into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.0A2948B16FA2D8C8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Battery Niotic"
	quest.0A2B06A778D64612.quest_desc: ["Sculk Snappers and Sculk Leeches drop Soul Dust. You can also get it by milling Soul Crystals." "It is required for the Soul Elytra."]
	quest.0A2B06A778D64612.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Soul Dust"
	quest.0A40A667BCA84840.quest_desc: ["The Bat allows you to see in the dark."]
	quest.0A40A667BCA84840.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Familiar Bat"
	quest.0A4600B1656C8E50.quest_desc: ["Bring Inferium Sword, Inferium Pickaxe, Inferium Shovel and 2 more items into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.0A4600B1656C8E50.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Inferium Sword, Inferium Pickaxe, Inferium Shovel and 2 more items"
	quest.0A4600B1656C8E50.title: "Inferium Tools and Weaponry"
	quest.0A533AED133E1E5F.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.0A533AED133E1E5F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Elite Sawing Factory"
	quest.0A5A6C7955C9062F.quest_desc: ["Bring Salmon Roll into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.0A5A6C7955C9062F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Salmon Roll"
	quest.0A5D9A846FAFF859.quest_desc: ["Combine Charged Certus Quartz with Nether Quartz and Redstone using AE2 crystal transformation. Fluix is used throughout the network."]
	quest.0A5D9A846FAFF859.title: "Create Fluix Crystals"
	quest.0A75CF2C7F7DB327.quest_desc: ["Occasionally causes nearby animals to breed."]
	quest.0A75CF2C7F7DB327.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ritual Fertility"
	quest.0A7BB5598B89599C.quest_desc: ["Scarlet Trees in Eternal Starlight are known for their deep red color." "Harvest enough Scarlet Logs for crafting and building to widen your material options."]
	quest.0A7BB5598B89599C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 10x Scarlet Log"
	quest.0A7BB5598B89599C.title: "Scarlet Wood"
	quest.0A8134FBEF8971F1.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Bluegill. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.0A8134FBEF8971F1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bluegill"
	quest.0A992EB0FFAB38A8.quest_desc: ["The Scarecrow Hat is part of the Scarecrow Armor set in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. It gives +3 Armor and +75 Max Mana." "Craft it from a Leather Cap and a Carved Pumpkin."]
	quest.0A992EB0FFAB38A8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pumpkin Helmet"
	quest.0A9D18EBE7871834.quest_desc: ["Divine Soulshard is a rare crafting material tied to the Holy school in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. It is used in advanced recipes for Holy equipment and magical items." "Look for it from powerful holy enemies and in magical structures."]
	quest.0A9D18EBE7871834.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Divine Soulshard"
	quest.0AA333DE81E04FF9.quest_desc: ["Obtain a Pulse Timer from Create. It works as a compact Redstone clock that repeatedly emits short pulses at an interval you set, from 2 ticks to 60 minutes." "It suits machines, farms, doors and other timed contraptions, and can be inverted to stay powered and emit short off-pulses."]
	quest.0AA333DE81E04FF9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pulse Timer"
	quest.0AA4F6566BC66B8A.quest_desc: ["When installed, bees that can teleport will no longer teleport when living in the hive with the upgrade."]
	quest.0AA4F6566BC66B8A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Upgrade Anti Teleport"
	quest.0AB9F427B4CBC993.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Configurable Honeycomb. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.0AB9F427B4CBC993.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.0ABA1FAC1F4EE209.quest_desc: ["Tier 3 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.0ABA1FAC1F4EE209.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Split"
	quest.0AC2A7AA731943B6.quest_desc: ["Conveyor Belts are used to move items around within your machines. They use Motors to turn and Rubber Sheets as a platform to move. You should automate these."]
	quest.0AC2A7AA731943B6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Conveyor"
	quest.0AC2A7AA731943B6.title: "Conveyor Belts"
	quest.0AC7A53B0608B805.quest_desc: ["Archevoker Leggings are part of the Archevoker Armor set in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. They give +6 Armor, +125 Max Mana, +10% Evocation Spell Power and +5% Spell Power." "Craft them from 7 Arcane Cloth and 1 Evocation Rune, or upgrade Wizard Leggings with 1 Evocation Rune at a Smithing Table."]
	quest.0AC7A53B0608B805.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Archevoker Leggings"
	quest.0AC98ACE5483FE90.quest_desc: ["Mine iron ore underground to get Raw Iron. Iron is one of the most important materials in Minecraft, used for durable tools, armor and many other items."]
	quest.0AC98ACE5483FE90.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 16x Raw Iron"
	quest.0AC98ACE5483FE90.title: "&#A9A9A9Raw &#E7E7E7Iron"
	quest.0ACFCA35DE306525.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Blobfish Bucket. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.0ACFCA35DE306525.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blobfish Bucket"
	quest.0AE44306585B936A.quest_desc: ["With these Goggles over your eyes, you will see as if you had the Third Eye. You'll still be unable to harvest blocks though, without a specialized tool...."]
	quest.0AE44306585B936A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Otherworld Goggles"
	quest.0AE5A5160961B9CE.quest_desc: ["The most robust type of Pressure Tube. These Tubes can be camouflaged and have the capability to accommodate Tube Modules, allowing for additional functionality."]
	quest.0AE5A5160961B9CE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Pressure Tube"
	quest.0AFCF2AFDB70B423.quest_desc: ["Bring Enderman Seeds into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.0AFCF2AFDB70B423.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Enderman Seeds"
	quest.0B29B0FDBBFAB408.quest_desc: ["The ME Extended Pattern Access Terminal provides 2 extra features: First of all it adds a search bar and will highlight whatever is being searched in the Pattern Terminal. Secondly it will provide an In-World Highlight of which Pattern Provider is stuck when doing large crafting jobs."]
	quest.0B29B0FDBBFAB408.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ex Pattern Access Part and Wireless Ex Pat"
	quest.0B38D94672907F38.quest_desc: ["Amber bees can be found in the suspicious sand and gravel of Cold Ocean Ruins."]
	quest.0B38D94672907F38.quest_subtitle: "Get an Amber Bee spawn egg"
	quest.0B38D94672907F38.title: "Amber Bee"
	quest.0B49557F1950E99C.quest_desc: ["Baits attract fish that only live in certain biomes."]
	quest.0B49557F1950E99C.quest_subtitle: "Use baits for biome-specific fish"
	quest.0B49557F1950E99C.title: "Baits"
	quest.0B4BB6E8738DD48A.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Eclipsealloy Hoe. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.0B4BB6E8738DD48A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Eclipsealloy Hoe"
	quest.0B4D39DF4C83CF3B.quest_desc: ["Generates source from nearby potion jars."]
	quest.0B4D39DF4C83CF3B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Alchemical Sourcelink"
	quest.0B504F45157D612C.quest_desc: ["Obtain a Threshold Switch from Create. It monitors how full an inventory or fluid container is and emits a Redstone signal at configurable thresholds." "It also supports filtering to track specific items, which is useful for stopping or starting machines when storage hits a chosen level."]
	quest.0B504F45157D612C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Stockpile Switch"
	quest.0B56104ADC34D802.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Configurable Honeycomb. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.0B56104ADC34D802.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.0B56489F768493CB.quest_desc: ["The Flowglaze Shield is a defensive item from Eternal Starlight in the Flowglaze tier." "It blocks incoming damage and fits mid-to-late game."]
	quest.0B56489F768493CB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Flowglaze Shield"
	quest.0B60A0D49278215F.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Fiery Sword and Fiery Pickaxe. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.0B60A0D49278215F.quest_subtitle: "Craft Fiery tools"
	quest.0B60A0D49278215F.title: "Fiery Tools"
	quest.0B68D00CDAA58D3E.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Bow Eclipsealloy. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.0B68D00CDAA58D3E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bow Eclipsealloy"
	quest.0B76E8E2FCABF11A.quest_desc: ["Bring Sky Stone Seeds into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.0B76E8E2FCABF11A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sky Stone Seeds"
