	quest.0BFFD8BB50CDF55F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Soulstealer"
	quest.0C115D3DCD720CAE.quest_desc: ["Nullscape reworks End terrain and adds new landscapes beyond the central island. Explore the outer End to find its changed generation."]
	quest.0C115D3DCD720CAE.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.0C1CE44B24A01F1E.quest_desc: ["Awarded for defeating the Silver Dungeon."]
	quest.0C1CE44B24A01F1E.quest_subtitle: "Earn the Valkyrie Hoe advancement"
	quest.0C268FA69D61657D.quest_desc: ["Bloody Vellum is a crafting ingredient in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. It is made from Hogskin and Blood in the Alchemist Cauldron." "It is used in recipes for strong Blood equipment, including the Vampiric Spell Book."]
	quest.0C268FA69D61657D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bloody Vellum"
	quest.0C2A5D0BBAF40738.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Upgrade Copper. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.0C2A5D0BBAF40738.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Upgrade Copper"
	quest.0C30CBCAA3AD594A.quest_desc: ["The first piece of the Fiery armor set. Get the boots to unlock the chestplate and leggings."]
	quest.0C32521273868A44.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Pig Seeds. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.0C32521273868A44.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pig Seeds"
	quest.0C351818B8A849B9.quest_desc: ["Make the Aeternium Forged Plate from an Aeternium Ingot at an Anvil with a Smith Hammer." "At a Smithing Table, combine it with a piece of Terminite armor and the Aeternium Upgrade Template to get Aeternium armor."]
	quest.0C351818B8A849B9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Aeternium Forged Plate"
	quest.0C45D9FE812612A1.quest_desc: ["Voids items selected in its filter."]
	quest.0C45D9FE812612A1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Void Upgrade"
	quest.0C491B59A9A1DB63.quest_desc: ["Place a Jar under a Cow, then drop an anvil onto it so the anvil falls on the Cow and the Jar."]
	quest.0C491B59A9A1DB63.quest_subtitle: "Catch a cow in a jar"
	quest.0C5DBFFFB2F59CB1.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Star Anise Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.0C5DBFFFB2F59CB1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Star Anise Sapling"
	quest.0C69305B569FFD74.quest_desc: ["Changes the area around the spawner where mobs can appear."]
	quest.0C69305B569FFD74.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Spawn Range Spawner Rune"
	quest.0C69305B569FFD74.title: "Spawn Range Spawner Rune"
	quest.0C6DFBDDBF8E3E7F.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Asai Palm Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.0C6DFBDDBF8E3E7F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Asai Palm Sapling"
	quest.0C71C0B3BBA32AE1.quest_desc: ["The Thermal Springstone Scythe is crafted from Thermal Springstone Ingots in Eternal Starlight." "It is a hybrid tool for wide melee attacks and efficient harvesting, and it also sets enemies on fire."]
	quest.0C71C0B3BBA32AE1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thermal Springstone Scythe"
	quest.0C723CB0ABBD7F44.quest_desc: ["This tool can be attuned (by sneak right-clicking) to certain blocks, to find their counterparts in the Other Place. Such blocks must be harvested while under the Third Eye. The available blocks you can search for are listed: Andesite searches for Otherstone. Oak Log searches for Otherworld Wood. Netherrack searches for Iesnium Ore."]
	quest.0C723CB0ABBD7F44.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Divination Rod"
	quest.0C7BA37AA45384F3.quest_desc: ["Prevents collisions and controls the flow of scheduled trains."]
	quest.0C7BA37AA45384F3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Track Signal"
	quest.0C7F75FA3DD3A2CD.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: Explore Aether."]
	quest.0C7F75FA3DD3A2CD.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Explore Aether"
	quest.0C818F3CE5252447.quest_desc: ["The Flowglaze Hoe is a farming tool from Eternal Starlight in the Flowglaze tier." "It creates farmland and fits mid-to-late game."]
	quest.0C818F3CE5252447.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Flowglaze Hoe"
	quest.0C8FEAF343FC9CF5.quest_desc: ["The Pressurized Reaction Chamber (PRC) is used primarily to create Substrate (to create HDPE Pellets), HDPE Pellets (to create HDPE Sheets), and Ethylene (an efficient source of fuel used in the Gas-Burning Generator). It has a variable speed and energy usage dependent on the materials/gasses it is creating."]
	quest.0C8FEAF343FC9CF5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pressurized Reaction Chamber"
	quest.0C99C6407AC3FA74.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Plastic. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.0C99C6407AC3FA74.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Plastic"
	quest.0CA153DAC3A0965F.quest_desc: ["Blocks of primogel goo will also transform blocks of coal into raw primal coal. 3 to 4 Primal coal will drop from that raw primal coal. Has enough energy to burn 3x more items than normal coal."]
	quest.0CA153DAC3A0965F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 7x Coal T1"
	quest.0CB9B52AAB455175.quest_desc: ["The Highest Tiered Storage Cell in normal AE2, which can contain 262,144 bytes of storage. 262,144 bytes of storage can hold 32,512 Stacks of a single item. or 16,640 Stacks, while holding 63 Different items."]
	quest.0CB9B52AAB455175.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Item Storage Cell 256k"
	quest.0CBFCABF985FA535.quest_desc: ["Used to levitate a moderate distance above the ground."]
	quest.0CBFCABF985FA535.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Belt of Levitation"
	quest.0CC20E08F04D3DD8.quest_desc: ["Obtain Powdered Obsidian from Create. It is a special material used in more advanced Create crafting and processing."]
	quest.0CC20E08F04D3DD8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Powdered Obsidian"
	quest.0CD9A1DD8A01F57A.quest_desc: ["Used in the creation of some glyphs."]
	quest.0CD9A1DD8A01F57A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Abjuration Essence"
	quest.0CECCE39F937B483.quest_desc: ["Bring 36x Reactor Nitro into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.0CECCE39F937B483.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 36x Reactor Nitro"
	quest.0CF12313811922D0.quest_desc: ["Use the Aeternium Upgrade Smithing Template at a Smithing Table to upgrade a full piece of Terminite armor into Aeternium." "Aeternium is the strongest material in Better End, better than Netherite."]
	quest.0CF12313811922D0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Aeternium Upgrade Smithing Template"
	quest.0CF1A4AE069898A3.quest_desc: ["Warp Scrolls teleport you or create a portal. Use the scroll in your main hand to teleport yourself, or cast a spell with the Blink glyph while holding it in your offhand to teleport a mob." "A Warp Scroll is single use and cannot cross dimensions. A Stable Warp Scroll opens a temporary portal, can be used unlimited times and works across dimensions." "Right-click a blank scroll to set its location, and craft it shapeless to reset it."]
	quest.0CF1A4AE069898A3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Warp Scroll and Stable Warp Scroll"
	quest.0CF1A4AE069898A3.title: "Warp Scrolls"
	quest.0D002CB70EC6DA83.quest_desc: ["Bring Pulsating Alloy Seeds into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.0D002CB70EC6DA83.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pulsating Alloy Seeds"
	quest.0D0B8C907AD9D56F.quest_desc: ["Doggy Talents Next lets you train and customize a companion dog. Explore its talents and care features to build a companion suited to your adventures."]
	quest.0D0B8C907AD9D56F.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.0D1428F25BFDCB7E.quest_desc: ["The Bucket of Experience holds Liquid Experience from Create: Enchantment Industry, so you can store and carry experience as a fluid." "It can feed machines such as the Blaze Forger and other experience-processing equipment, and the mod supports using it with automation."]
	quest.0D1428F25BFDCB7E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Xp Bucket"
	quest.0D15454A97D2AF9B.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Magmator Blazing. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.0D15454A97D2AF9B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Magmator Blazing"
	quest.0D16D625FDD4AF58.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Soul Tree Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.0D16D625FDD4AF58.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Soul Tree Sapling"
	quest.0D1B5D1B966FD627.quest_desc: ["Bring Inferium Watering Can into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.0D1B5D1B966FD627.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Inferium Watering Can"
	quest.0D24246C9B7E4ED7.quest_desc: ["Bring Smart Filter into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.0D24246C9B7E4ED7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.0D2A68A5814A38DA.quest_desc: ["Pumps experience between the tank upgrade and the player."]
	quest.0D2A68A5814A38DA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Xp Pump Upgrade"
	quest.0D2F98AF749809D6.quest_desc: ["Enriched Redstone is used in the Metallurgic Infuser. Enriched Redstone yields 80 units of redstone in the Metallurgic Infuser, the same as 8 redstone."]
	quest.0D2F98AF749809D6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Enriched Redstone"
	quest.0D30EF2224604075.quest_desc: ["Bring Thread Repairing into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.0D30EF2224604075.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thread Repairing"
	quest.0D3542F369F1981A.quest_desc: ["Bring Iron Seeds into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.0D3542F369F1981A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Iron Seeds"
	quest.0D46DC992A7CDB10.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Magmator Hardened. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.0D46DC992A7CDB10.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Magmator Hardened"
	quest.0D48055EA367859C.quest_desc: ["Induction Provides make up the transfer rate of the battery, both input and output. Transfer Rate: 52.42 MFE/t."]
	quest.0D48055EA367859C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ultimate Induction Provider"
	quest.0D7977925697B42D.quest_desc: ["Your reactor can produce an incredible amount of steam, but there's no point making all that steam if you can't put it to work. The Industrial Turbine converts steam into FE by spinning its internal rotor and generating power. Build the central turbine components and surround them with the required multiblock structure. Connect the turbine to your reactor's steam output and watch the power roll in. Larger turbines can process more steam and generate more FE, making them an essential part of a serious power-generation setup."]
	quest.0D7977925697B42D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 8x Turbine Blade, 4x Turbine Rotor, 64x Turbine Casing and 5 more items"
	quest.0D7977925697B42D.title: "Turbine Time"
	quest.0D810AA42ADD0560.quest_desc: ["Place it in a furnace's fuel slot. It works with Iron tier furnaces and above."]
	quest.0D810AA42ADD0560.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Item Heater"
	quest.0D81F9CC548BA96F.quest_desc: ["This Vat allows you to convert your Alchemical Niter from one tier to another."]
	quest.0D81F9CC548BA96F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Digestion Vat"
	quest.0D881960DADD1D33.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Stone Pickaxe, Stone Sword and Stone Axe. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.0D881960DADD1D33.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Stone Pickaxe, Stone Sword and Stone Axe"
	quest.0D920853F0AE1284.quest_desc: ["Bring 4x Magebloom Fiber into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.0D920853F0AE1284.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 4x Magebloom Fiber"
	quest.0D92EC868F35B232.quest_desc: ["Bring Highly Advanced Upgrade into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.0D92EC868F35B232.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Highly Advanced Upgrade"
	quest.0D92EC868F35B232.title: "I'm Speed"
	quest.0D948089E0519A10.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Disk Drive 16k. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.0D948089E0519A10.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Disk Drive 16k"
	quest.0D9B278A76570549.quest_desc: ["Slay the Carminite Ghastlings around the trap, then activate it to pull the Ur-Ghast from the sky."]
	quest.0D9B278A76570549.quest_subtitle: "Defeat the Ur-Ghast with a Ghast Trap"
	quest.0DB11BF6A99F7F6C.quest_desc: ["The Smart Hopper from Create: Dreams n' Desires is an advanced logistics block that gives you finer control over how items move through your factory." "It arrived in the 2.2a-BETA update and later got fixes for item voiding and filter updates."]
	quest.0DB11BF6A99F7F6C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Hopper"
	quest.0DB7157867C16591.quest_desc: ["Like the Andesite Tunnel, but with filtering and distribution modes."]
	quest.0DB7157867C16591.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Brass Tunnel"
	quest.0DBE8182B0394DE1.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Nuke. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.0DBE8182B0394DE1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Nuke"
	quest.0DBE8182B0394DE1.title: "I've become Death, Destroyer of Worlds"
	quest.0DD09AA0EA35850D.quest_desc: ["Bring Player Aerial Pearl into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.0DD09AA0EA35850D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Player Aerial Pearl"
	quest.0DDDDA3A335E2EC2.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Cut Glass Boot. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.0DDDDA3A335E2EC2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cut Glass Boot"
	quest.0DDF09DAE9244925.quest_desc: ["The first piece of the Supremium armor set. Get the boots to unlock the chestplate and leggings."]
	quest.0DEBDE44543FAEFB.quest_desc: ["Bring Necronomicon Spell Book and Blood Staff into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.0DEBDE44543FAEFB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Necronomicon Spell Book and Blood Staff"
	quest.0DF9E4FC7641D7EC.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Bee. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.0DF9E4FC7641D7EC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bee"
	quest.0DFDCA0075F07205.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Energy Hopper Basic. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.0DFDCA0075F07205.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Hopper Basic"
	quest.0E0119E5EC6E3B42.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for 36x Reactor Niotic. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.0E0119E5EC6E3B42.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 36x Reactor Niotic"
	quest.0E016264AC71BD8C.quest_desc: ["Bring Ipe Sapling into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.0E016264AC71BD8C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ipe Sapling"
	quest.0E06644FC1B0D341.quest_desc: ["Used to create ME Storage Cells."]
	quest.0E06644FC1B0D341.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cell Component 256k"
	quest.0E19F5FF76E6BE19.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Ginkgo Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.0E19F5FF76E6BE19.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ginkgo Sapling"
	quest.0E1C4F238B67F07D.quest_desc: ["Bring Sinner Crown into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.0E1C4F238B67F07D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sinner Crown"
	quest.0E1CF52CD717F600.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Supremium Farmland. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.0E1CF52CD717F600.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Supremium Farmland"
	quest.0E1DE23AB140B7D4.quest_desc: ["Used to create ME Storage Cells."]
	quest.0E1DE23AB140B7D4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cell Component 4k"
	quest.0E1E6E585850C224.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Metallurgic Infuser and Gauge Dropper. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.0E1E6E585850C224.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Metallurgic Infuser and Gauge Dropper"
	quest.0E1E7687D2B4C6BD.quest_desc: ["A Sentry Turret is an autonomous defensive weapon that fires at any living entity within a 16-block range when equipped with Gun Ammo. The range can be extended with Range Upgrades. You can specify which entities to attack by setting filters in the ‘Target Filter’ field. Additionally, if the Sentry Turret is covered by a Security Station, players permitted by the Security Station will not be targeted."]
	quest.0E1E7687D2B4C6BD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sentry Turret"
	quest.0E23272AB9E52EDA.quest_desc: ["The Petal Scythe is a melee weapon from Eternal Starlight, linked to plant-based materials and mid-to-advanced progression."]
	quest.0E23272AB9E52EDA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Petal Scythe"
	quest.0E23272AB9E52EDA.title: "Petal Scythe"
	quest.0E31782692E3D3F0.quest_desc: ["Destroys nearby monsters providing you with twice as much experience."]
	quest.0E31782692E3D3F0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ritual Disintegration"
	quest.0E36306ACCB3D643.quest_desc: ["Variants to find: Badlands, End, Flower Forest, Giant Tree Taiga, Icy, Jungle, Mushroom, Nether, Ocean, Snowy and Dark Forest."]
	quest.0E36306ACCB3D643.quest_subtitle: "Find all 11 Pyramid variants"
	quest.0E41832F0A0A4027.quest_desc: ["Breaks blocks, 'nuff said."]
	quest.0E41832F0A0A4027.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mechanical Drill"
	quest.0E47CFE857CBE5E4.quest_desc: ["Seekers hunt anything that moves in Eternal Starlight." "They are fast and relentless, and escaping is hard once they spot you, so learn to fight them before going deeper."]
	quest.0E47CFE857CBE5E4.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Seeker"
	quest.0E47CFE857CBE5E4.title: "Seeker"
	quest.0E58B2B9F248760E.quest_desc: ["Knightmetal is a rare alloy found in the Goblin Stronghold. It is very durable and sharp, which makes it great for weapons, armor and tools." "Getting it gives you access to stronger equipment."]
	quest.0E58B2B9F248760E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Knightmetal Ingot"
	quest.0E5FC8E3D917C59E.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Altar. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.0E5FC8E3D917C59E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Altar"
	quest.0E5FC8E3D917C59E.title: "Do You Believe in Magic?"
	quest.0E681418CD88F42B.quest_desc: ["Logistical Transporters are Mekanism's way of transporting items. They are smarter compared to other item pipes and can be highly configured with the Configurator. Transfer Rate: 32 items/2 m/s."]
	quest.0E681418CD88F42B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Logistical Transporter"
	quest.0E68A729E03D8D38.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.0E68A729E03D8D38.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Smelting Factory"
	quest.0E6A77563BFCDAB3.quest_desc: ["The Sal Ammoniac Tank must be placed below the Sal Ammoniac Accumulator. In tandem, these two devices will create Sal Ammoniac solvent from Water. If you wish for solvent faster, you can provide the Accumulator with Sal Ammoniac crystals to greatly expedite the process."]
	quest.0E6A77563BFCDAB3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sal Ammoniac Accumulator and Sal Ammoniac Tank"
	quest.0E6A77563BFCDAB3.title: "Sal Ammoniac Accumulator"
	quest.0E6D711132E6E3F2.quest_desc: ["The Terminite Pickaxe is a mining tool forged from Terminite Ingots and is stronger than the Thallasium one." "Terminite connects Thallasium to the much stronger Aeternium and Crystalite tiers."]
	quest.0E6D711132E6E3F2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Terminite Pickaxe"
	quest.0E792CA135B5492F.quest_desc: ["BetterNether expands the Nether with new biomes, plants, structures, and materials. Venture out prepared and explore the changed environment."]
	quest.0E792CA135B5492F.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.0E80099434B1617C.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Emberlash. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.0E80099434B1617C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Emberlash"
	quest.0E87A8D0950F27A7.quest_desc: ["Gantrys: movement and power transmission: noice! Do check out the cascaded gantries, explained in the ponder."]
	quest.0E87A8D0950F27A7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gantry Carriage and Gantry Shaft"
	quest.0E88C241E6006C36.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: Bronze Dungeon."]
	quest.0E88C241E6006C36.quest_subtitle: "Defeat the Bronze Dungeon boss"
	quest.0E8EB18C341F2601.quest_desc: ["Portable, stored power for some Create stuff."]
	quest.0E8EB18C341F2601.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Copper Backtank"
	quest.0E95B07D274A75B3.quest_desc: ["Electromancer Leggings are part of the Electromancer Armor set in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. They give +6 Armor, +125 Max Mana, +10% Lightning Spell Power and +5% Spell Power." "Craft them from 7 Arcane Cloth and 1 Lightning Rune, or upgrade Wizard Leggings with 1 Lightning Rune and 1 Arcane Essence."]
	quest.0E95B07D274A75B3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Electromancer Leggings"
	quest.0E99C24B57F91B69.quest_desc: ["Lets the wearer stand on lava while sneaking and protects against hot floor damage."]
	quest.0E99C24B57F91B69.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Strider Shoes"
	quest.0E9FABC6EDE15FF1.quest_desc: ["Your inventory has a trash slot. An item stays in it until you place another one, so you can still take it back if you made a mistake."]
	quest.0E9FABC6EDE15FF1.quest_subtitle: "Safe item disposal."
	quest.0E9FABC6EDE15FF1.title: "Trash Slot"
	quest.0EAC8217FD7CD143.quest_desc: ["Holds plenty of up to eight different things, color-able, and all nearby Toolboxes can be accessed with one keybind, handy for keeping your eyes on your work, not your tools."]
	quest.0EAC8217FD7CD143.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.0EAD40117889E884.quest_desc: ["The Malarite Sickle is an early-game harvesting tool in Eternal Starlight, crafted from Malarite found in swamp biomes." "It gathers plants and vegetation more efficiently."]
	quest.0EAD40117889E884.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Malarite Sickle"
	quest.0EB6EBD41654B7E0.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Mana Ring. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.0EB6EBD41654B7E0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mana Ring"
	quest.0EB84C6DFB1A060C.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Slices of Bread. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.0EB84C6DFB1A060C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Slices of Bread"
	quest.0EBA3BA55AC3A5C9.quest_desc: ["A new machine, the little sibling to the Packer! This one can only be made in steel; it really needs that extra strength. The unpacker can perform simple crafts for you, such as converting dusts into tiny dusts. Check your EMI for more recipes."]
	quest.0EBA3BA55AC3A5C9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Steel Unpacker"
	quest.0EBA3BA55AC3A5C9.title: "Steel Unpacker"
	quest.0EC8A5814C7616EB.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Limited Diamond Barrel 2. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.0EC8A5814C7616EB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Limited Diamond Barrel 2"
	quest.0ED9396AE64CDA50.quest_desc: ["Activate the Ancient City portal with the Heart of the Deep to enter the Otherside." "Mobs here track you by sound, so walk slowly, stay away from sculk sensors and keep a route back."]
	quest.0ED9396AE64CDA50.quest_subtitle: "Travel to Otherside"
	quest.0ED9396AE64CDA50.title: "Otherside"
	quest.0EDA00447F4598FD.quest_desc: ["The Wicked Bone Ring gives +1 Spell Projectile Ricochet, so compatible spell projectiles can bounce one more time between targets." "It is a rare reward from the Ominous Dead King."]
	quest.0EDA00447F4598FD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wicked Bone Ring"
	quest.0EEA93644B17C281.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Bleeding Tartar. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.0EEA93644B17C281.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bleeding Tartar"
	quest.0EFD61E82206E78E.quest_desc: ["The gold charm keeps your entire inventory on death."]
	quest.0EFD61E82206E78E.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Charm of Keeping III"
	quest.0EFEB33A89BBD57D.quest_desc: ["Used to craft ME Energy Storage Components and other accessories."]
	quest.0EFEB33A89BBD57D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Processor"
	quest.0F04D1DAEC2B69E7.quest_desc: ["Like the Pickup Upgrade, with more filtering options."]
	quest.0F04D1DAEC2B69E7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Pickup Upgrade"
	quest.0F0C3A0B887FA889.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Chemical Reactor. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.0F0C3A0B887FA889.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chemical Reactor"
	quest.0F0C3A0B887FA889.title: "Walter White Approves"
	quest.0F12698FA391FDAE.quest_desc: ["Gold Wire from Create Crafts and Additions is made by running a Gold Sheet through the Rolling Mill, which gives 2 wires. It is used in parts like the Gold Spool and can replace Electrum Wire in some recipes."]
	quest.0F12698FA391FDAE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gold Wire"
	quest.0F176FA615AEAE23.quest_desc: ["Craft a crafting table. It lets you combine resources into new items and tools, and it is the base for most of your early progress."]
	quest.0F176FA615AEAE23.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.0F176FA615AEAE23.title: "&#A56701Crafting Table"
	quest.0F181CD4B23375D1.quest_desc: ["The Augmenting Table lets you upgrade or reroll a single Affix with Sigils of Enhancement, without replacing the whole set like reforging does."]
	quest.0F181CD4B23375D1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Augmenting Table and Sigil of Enhancement"
	quest.0F181CD4B23375D1.title: "Perfect the Affix"
	quest.0F18F1AD892DFBD5.quest_desc: ["The Starfire Axe is a weapon from Eternal Starlight in the Starfire equipment tier." "It is crafted from Starfire materials found in late-game content."]
	quest.0F18F1AD892DFBD5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Starfire Axe"
	quest.0F1F1B7AD0337C08.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Oakskin Elixir. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.0F1F1B7AD0337C08.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Oakskin Elixir"
	quest.0F222D07634017A9.quest_desc: ["The Wireless Crafting Terminal combines wireless item access with a crafting grid. Keep it charged and stay within range of a linked Wireless Access Point."]
	quest.0F222D07634017A9.title: "Craft Wirelessly"
	quest.0F2C5FAFE4FFD8E0.quest_desc: ["The Backpack gives you extra storage to carry around. You can wear it, open it from your inventory, or place it in the world as a regular container." "Upgrading it raises its capacity and unlocks more upgrades."]
	quest.0F2C5FAFE4FFD8E0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Backpack"
	quest.0F48B06DB4108F29.quest_desc: ["Defeat Dead King."]
	quest.0F48B06DB4108F29.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Dead King"
	quest.0F49506A405F7E56.quest_desc: ["A dynamic tank is a multiblock structure that can hold a large amount of fluids, including gases. It is a rather simple structure, and it is cheap, compared to other Mekanism multiblocks."]
	quest.0F49506A405F7E56.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dynamic Tank"
	quest.0F4F8377906C86C4.quest_desc: ["The Capacity Card increases the amount of filter slots in Buses."]
	quest.0F4F8377906C86C4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Capacity Card, Redstone Card, Void Card and Crafting Card"
	quest.0F4F8377906C86C4.title: "Basic Upgrades"
	quest.0F58E19440A090F0.quest_desc: ["Did you have fun with Nuclear Fission? Well, it's time for Nuclear Fusion! Instead of splitting a heavy, unstable nucleus into two lighter nuclei, fusion will combine together two light nuclei which in turn releases vast amounts of energy. This energy can be contained and used to produce Helium Plasma, an extremely energy dense fluid that can be used as the best power source in the world. You can combine gaseous fuels such as Deuterium, Tritium and/or Helium-3 to produce various combinations of Helium Plasma, Tritium, Deuterium, and Hydrogen. Keep in mind, this fusion takes a lot of energy to start going, but can produce much more as a result."]
	quest.0F58E19440A090F0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fusion Reactor, 203x Highly Advanced Machine Hull and 40x Fusion Chamber"
	quest.0F58E19440A090F0.title: "Fusion Reactor"
	quest.0F7140102C7C27EC.quest_desc: ["The Starfire Shovel is a late-game digging tool from Eternal Starlight in the Starfire tier." "It handles excavation and terrain clearing better than lower-tier tools."]
	quest.0F7140102C7C27EC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Starfire Shovel"
