	quest.103FDB77D19D1F46.quest_desc: ["The Aeternium Anvil, together with a Netherite or Aeternium Smith Hammer, is required to work Aeternium Ingots into plates and tool heads." "It is the last crafting station you need for Better End's strongest equipment."]
