	quest.10D1A7179FA77CB0.quest_desc: ["Make the Warden Mage Boots in a Mechanical Crafter using a Netherite Mage Boots from Iron's Spells, Echo Ingots, Warden Carapace, a Reinforced Echo Shard and a Warden Upgrade Template." "Spell power and upgrades from the netherite piece are not kept."]
