	quest.1143A0D8D52E0C64.title: "Vacuum Freezer"
	quest.1144838E22D53228.quest_desc: ["The Glacite Pickaxe is crafted from Glacite Ingots in Eternal Starlight." "It is a mid-tier mining tool for cold biomes, more efficient than Deepsilver and Amaramber tools."]
