	quest.1242AB88EE5C2CA8.quest_desc: ["Cryomancer Leggings are part of the Cryomancer Armor set in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. They give +6 Armor, +125 Max Mana, +10% Ice Spell Power and +5% Spell Power." "Craft them from 7 Arcane Cloth and 1 Ice Rune, or upgrade Wizard Leggings with 1 Ice Rune and 1 Arcane Essence."]
