	quest.132D9EA0F036CD02.quest_desc: ["The Electrum Spool from Create Crafts and Additions links compatible Connectors and carries electrical energy between them. It is crafted from 4 Electrum Wires and 1 Empty Spool, and can transfer up to 5 kFE/t once connected." "Breaking a connected connector returns 4 Electrum Wires."]
