	quest.13554DB4AF4713F8.quest_desc: ["The Enchantment Library stores enchantments. Insert an enchanted book to deposit its enchantments." "Left-click a stored enchantment to take one level as a book, or Shift-click for the highest level available. Matching books add up, so you can extract higher levels than you put in, up to the library's limit." "Craft it from an Enchanting Table, Ender Chests and infused shelves."]
	quest.13554DB4AF4713F8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Library"
	quest.135FD4B995F664FF.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: Silver Dungeon."]
	quest.135FD4B995F664FF.quest_subtitle: "Defeat the Silver Dungeon boss"
	quest.13632B63C4745494.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.13632B63C4745494.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Smelting Factory"
	quest.136DEEEFAB0C08D2.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Breakfast Sampler. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.136DEEEFAB0C08D2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Breakfast Sampler"
	quest.13760E36E4F2DCA8.quest_desc: ["Bring Strider With Grilled Fungus into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.13760E36E4F2DCA8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Strider With Grilled Fungus"
	quest.137B9F57460145F2.quest_desc: ["Crusher spirits... crush things. Their main use is to crush Ore, which will be doubled (or more, depending on the spirit's tier). However, Crushers also have several more unique recipes, necessary for gaining the Chalks required to contact stronger spirits."]
	quest.137B9F57460145F2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Book of Binding Bound Foliot, Smart Filter, Smart Filter and 2 more items"
	quest.137B9F57460145F2.title: "Ritual: Summon Foliot Crusher"
	quest.13958E6550C66ED7.quest_desc: ["The Fuel Canister stores any kind of fuel and converts it into Fuel Amount. Put it in a furnace's fuel slot to smelt with that instead of coal, which lets you smelt more than one stack at a time."]
	quest.13958E6550C66ED7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fuel Canister"
	quest.13987F757E6B4B2C.quest_desc: ["Crushed fluorite is the first process in late game Mekanism."]
	quest.13987F757E6B4B2C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dust Fluorite"
	quest.139F56D548244906.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for List Filter. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.139F56D548244906.quest_subtitle: "Obtain List Filter"
	quest.13A90265419D9D26.quest_desc: ["Obtain a List Filter and a Nozzle from Create. The List Filter lets you build a custom list of items that a filtered component should allow or deny." "The Nozzle works with Create's item transport to direct item movement, and both help with precise factory logistics."]
	quest.13A90265419D9D26.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Filter and Nozzle"
	quest.13A90265419D9D26.title: "List Filter and Nozzle"
	quest.13C8A8DB6D074BA0.quest_desc: ["Upgrade an Infused Seashelf with Prismarine Crystals." "It gives +5 Eterna (up to 60), +3 Quanta and +5 Arcana."]
	quest.13C8A8DB6D074BA0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Crystal Seashelf"
	quest.13C985C0873385E5.quest_desc: ["Crystallized Moths drift through Eternal Starlight and attack in groups when disturbed." "Their bodies hold starlight crystals, which makes them dangerous but also a source of rare materials."]
	quest.13C985C0873385E5.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Crystallized Moth"
	quest.13C985C0873385E5.title: "Crystallized Moth"
	quest.13DF5B6A31ADB780.quest_desc: ["The Storage Bus allows you to use a chest or other storage box a network for your ME System to connect to rather than a Storage Drive."]
	quest.13DF5B6A31ADB780.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Storage Bus, Tag Storage Bus, Mod Storage Bus and Precise Storage Bus"
	quest.13E05AEB3936EE36.quest_desc: ["As stated before, you can upgrade your bronze machines into steel machines. Create the Steel Upgrade and install it onto any bronze machine using a smithing table or packer."]
	quest.13E05AEB3936EE36.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 2x Steel Upgrade"
	quest.13E05AEB3936EE36.title: "Faster Machines?"
	quest.13E7A2741C00B1FA.quest_desc: ["The Starlit Diamond Hoe is a late-game farming tool crafted from Starlit Diamond materials." "It prepares farmland in advanced biomes and is the top farming tier before celestial endgame materials."]
	quest.13E7A2741C00B1FA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Starlit Diamond Hoe"
	quest.13F51A40B2CADBBF.quest_desc: ["Smelts 96 items."]
	quest.13F51A40B2CADBBF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Imperium Coal"
	quest.13F76A0774D92858.quest_desc: ["Bring Speed Upgrade into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.13F76A0774D92858.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Speed Upgrade"
	quest.13F949F9A2E8F6E0.quest_desc: ["Reduces cost of mana for a spell."]
	quest.13F949F9A2E8F6E0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ring of Lesser Discount"
	quest.14030A18523919B2.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Dragonfly. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.14030A18523919B2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dragonfly"
	quest.1411DEB6C8440EBD.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Enchanter. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.1411DEB6C8440EBD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Enchanter"
	quest.141FBD9B9BC67566.quest_desc: ["Upgrade an Endshelf with a Dragon Head and Ender Pearls." "It gives a large +20 Eterna and is the only shelf that reaches up to 100. You need these for the highest enchanting levels."]
	quest.141FBD9B9BC67566.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Draconic Endshelf"
	quest.145017C20C780244.quest_desc: ["Craft a Black Steel Shovel from Cataclysm. It offers high durability and digging efficiency, and belongs to the Black Steel set."]
	quest.145017C20C780244.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Black Steel Shovel"
	quest.1450406D9E9A04A7.quest_desc: ["Aquaculture 2 adds the Lockbox, a rare container you can catch while fishing. Open it to get the valuable rewards inside."]
	quest.1450406D9E9A04A7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Lockbox"
	quest.1454B24C3A787D2E.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Enchanted Golden Egg. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.1454B24C3A787D2E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Enchanted Golden Egg"
	quest.14550A7149BBD5F7.quest_desc: ["This metal can be found in the Nether, disguised as Netherrack. Seeing through the Third Eye reveals its true form. You might want to bring a Divination Rod."]
	quest.14550A7149BBD5F7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Iesnium Ingot"
	quest.145B79B6509C0830.quest_desc: ["Bring Fire Clay Bricks into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.145B79B6509C0830.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fire Clay Bricks"
	quest.145B79B6509C0830.title: "Almost Steam?"
	quest.1466163B3F15C7F5.quest_desc: ["Bring Cardiac Trap into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.1466163B3F15C7F5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cardiac Trap"
	quest.147B67253D4538B8.quest_desc: ["A Sculk Transmitter can be found in the secret chest of an Ancient Temple." "Link it to a container to open that container from far away, even from another dimension."]
	quest.147B67253D4538B8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sculk Transmitter"
	quest.147E628709281002.quest_desc: ["Replaces part of the backpack inventory with fluid storage."]
	quest.147E628709281002.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Tank Upgrade"
	quest.147F4F7F3D7B769C.quest_desc: ["Simple version: senses the facing target, with a selectable target category, target filter, block state filter and optional redstone emission. Advanced version: adds filtering and offset AOE, and needs power."]
	quest.147F4F7F3D7B769C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.14865238E12275FD.quest_desc: ["Collect 5 diamonds by exploring the deep layers of the world. They are very rare and are needed for the best tools, weapons and equipment."]
	quest.14865238E12275FD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 5x Diamond"
	quest.14865238E12275FD.title: "Diamonds!"
	quest.149AB1571D50D9C8.quest_desc: ["The first piece of the Tertium armor set. Get the boots to unlock the chestplate and leggings."]
	quest.149B5F0D54E66454.quest_desc: ["Used in the creation of some glyphs."]
	quest.149B5F0D54E66454.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Manipulation Essence"
	quest.149D94556CE25DE2.quest_desc: ["Bring Rock Soup into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.149D94556CE25DE2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rock Soup"
	quest.14A87EFA130E4688.quest_desc: ["The Aethersent Hood is crafted from Aethersent Ingots in Eternal Starlight." "It is part of the Aethersent armor set, tied to meteors and celestial materials found in the dimension."]
	quest.14A87EFA130E4688.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Aethersent Hood"
	quest.14AB1B53308ADADD.quest_desc: ["The Basket from Farmer's Delight stores and carries food and cooking ingredients. It is a convenient addition to any farm or kitchen."]
	quest.14AB1B53308ADADD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bamboo Basket"
	quest.14B9D1356F52B2BF.quest_desc: ["Defeat 5 Cindaria from Cataclysm."]
	quest.14B9D1356F52B2BF.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Cindaria"
	quest.14B9D1356F52B2BF.title: "Cindaria"
	quest.14C86C69BBC5FAB6.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Ash Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.14C86C69BBC5FAB6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ash Sapling"
	quest.14E0CD2112C11AE9.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: Brass Dungeon."]
	quest.14E0CD2112C11AE9.quest_subtitle: "Defeat the Brass Dungeon boss"
	quest.14ED7BC08D07EE4D.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Nitro Crystal Seeds. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.14ED7BC08D07EE4D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Nitro Crystal Seeds"
	quest.14F16D8D569EECD3.quest_desc: ["Has a chance to catch two things at once."]
	quest.14F16D8D569EECD3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Double Hook"
	quest.14F2303C727E7DC8.quest_desc: ["The Scepter of Life Draining is dropped by the Twilight Lich. It drains health from enemies and restores your own." "It is aggressive and risky, but a strong option in long fights."]
	quest.14F2303C727E7DC8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Lifedrain Scepter"
	quest.1514C0B9D5222E13.quest_desc: ["Bring Thermo Generator Blazing into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.1514C0B9D5222E13.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thermo Generator Blazing"
	quest.15229AA4CC996D9B.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Awakened Supremium Ingot. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.15229AA4CC996D9B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Awakened Supremium Ingot"
	quest.152EEC97AF91E1BE.quest_desc: ["Magically turn day into night."]
	quest.152EEC97AF91E1BE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ritual Moonfall"
	quest.15360B319F422436.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Prudentium Helmet, Prudentium Chestplate, Prudentium Leggings and Prudentium Boots. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.15360B319F422436.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Prudentium Helmet, Prudentium Chestplate, Prudentium Leggings and Prudentium Boots"
	quest.15360B319F422436.title: "Prudentium Armor"
	quest.15370113B5193049.quest_desc: ["Black Chalk is the stablest of all. Its power keeps even the strongest spirits in check."]
	quest.15370113B5193049.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chalk Black Impure"
	quest.153D240870FB2BA3.quest_desc: ["The Cryomancer Hood is the headpiece of the Cryomancer Armor set in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. It gives +3 Armor, +125 Max Mana, +10% Ice Spell Power and +5% Spell Power." "Craft it from 5 Arcane Cloth and 1 Ice Rune."]
	quest.153D240870FB2BA3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cryomancer Helmet"
	quest.153D9130D79E2515.quest_desc: ["Bring Kanthal Coil into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.153D9130D79E2515.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Kanthal Coil"
	quest.153D9130D79E2515.title: "Electric Better Furnace"
	quest.154BD7201A093AD0.quest_desc: ["The Basic Bin is a storage block which can hold 4096 of a single item. It will retain its inventory when broken."]
	quest.154BD7201A093AD0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Bin"
	quest.154C8033DEBECA8B.quest_desc: ["Greatly reduces the duration of negative effects."]
	quest.154C8033DEBECA8B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Antidote Vessel"
	quest.154D78C1C61DDB21.quest_desc: ["By setting up two Quantum Rings, you can connect your ME System to anywhere in the world. Connect the first one to your ME System and the second one where you wish to have your ME System linked. You'll need 2 Entangled Singularities, place one of them in each Quantum Ring, after which they'll be linked together."]
	quest.154D78C1C61DDB21.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 8x Quantum Ring and Quantum Link"
	quest.154D78C1C61DDB21.title: "Quantum Ring"
	quest.155C4E8D84DF774A.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Silicon Seeds. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.155C4E8D84DF774A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Silicon Seeds"
	quest.156A2A1758D28D5C.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Configurable Honeycomb. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.156A2A1758D28D5C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.15788ADD723D2974.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.15788ADD723D2974.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Elite Compressing Factory"
	quest.157A7E16F2188BB9.quest_desc: ["Mechanical Belts are cheap, essential for early contraptions, still useful for high-speed ones, and can be dyed. The Transportation items move and store items, enable more kinds of motion and even generate renewable power from the atmosphere."]
	quest.157A7E16F2188BB9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Belt Connector"
	quest.158350D5C89C3B61.quest_desc: ["The leggings of the Leather armor set. Together with the chestplate, they unlock the helmet."]
	quest.15972082612D297D.quest_desc: ["Raises the maximum stack size to about 2.1 billion. You only need one per backpack."]
	quest.15972082612D297D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Stack Upgrade Omega Tier"
	quest.15975A8CA81B044B.quest_desc: ["Energized Core is a crafting ingredient in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks, used to make the Rod o' Lightning. It is crafted from 1 Block of Copper and 8 Bottles o' Lightning." "During a thunderstorm, use it on a placed Lightning Rod. A lightning strike hits and the rod becomes the Rod o' Lightning."]
	quest.15975A8CA81B044B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energized Core"
	quest.159DEF36B99DDB83.quest_desc: ["Bring Copper Backpack into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.159DEF36B99DDB83.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Copper Backpack"
	quest.15A266FD3813B256.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Music Disc 11. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.15A266FD3813B256.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Music Disc 11"
	quest.15A29F9AD8AF4CB3.quest_desc: ["The Sludge drops Resonarium." "Craft 4 Resonarium with 4 scutes to make a Resonarium Plate, which is used to upgrade diamond gear."]
	quest.15A29F9AD8AF4CB3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Resonarium and Resonarium Plate"
	quest.15A593F96530A08A.quest_desc: ["Flux Storage keeps excess energy and only fills once every Flux Point has received enough. Stored energy can only leave through a Flux Point. This tier has a transfer limit of 120,000. Networks do not need storage to work."]
	quest.15A593F96530A08A.quest_subtitle: "A bigger energy buffer for your network"
	quest.15AE2E07125474FA.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Gold Fishing Rod. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.15AE2E07125474FA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gold Fishing Rod"
	quest.15B4F5548C454816.quest_desc: ["The Cooking Pot is an essential Farmer's Delight tool. It combines different ingredients into a wide range of meals and is central to your food production."]
	quest.15B4F5548C454816.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cooking Pot"
	quest.15BC56B43507E7A2.quest_desc: ["The chestplate of the Ironwood armor set. Together with the leggings, it unlocks the helmet."]
	quest.15BEF31B2D998B67.quest_desc: ["The Blacksmith can upgrade other occult familiars. It can also repair your equipment as you mine stone."]
	quest.15BEF31B2D998B67.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Familiar Blacksmith"
	quest.15C77383F356A0DD.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Ghasta. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.15C77383F356A0DD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ghasta"
	quest.15C8DBDF264F87AE.quest_desc: ["The Blaze Forger from Create: Enchantment Industry is an automated anvil powered by Blaze. It can apply, combine, split and remove enchantments." "It also supports Super Enchanting, which goes beyond the normal enchantment level limits when configured for it."]
	quest.15C8DBDF264F87AE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blaze Forger"
	quest.15D1EBC09A6C236F.quest_desc: ["The Skoglin Trophy is a decorative block from My Nether's Delight. It adds a Nether-themed accent to your base."]
	quest.15D1EBC09A6C236F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Skoglin Trophy"
	quest.15D71004975A0E99.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: Blue Aercloud."]
	quest.15D71004975A0E99.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Blue Aercloud"
	quest.15E211D921345353.quest_desc: ["Bring Cooked Loin into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.15E211D921345353.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cooked Loin"
	quest.15E59453FDD9EED0.quest_desc: ["The Starfire Hoe is a farming tool from Eternal Starlight in the Starfire equipment tier." "It tills soil and belongs to the late-game Starfire tool set."]
	quest.15E59453FDD9EED0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Starfire Hoe"
	quest.15F664DBB06A9898.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Item Storage Cell 16m. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.15F664DBB06A9898.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Item Storage Cell 16m"
	quest.160186A0309E3792.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Item Storage Cell 4m. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.160186A0309E3792.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Item Storage Cell 4m"
	quest.160CDC75E020FC5B.quest_desc: ["Pyrium Ingot is a rare crafting material in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks, found in Citadel Vaults. It is used for the Pyrium Staff and to upgrade the Decrepit Scythe into the Hellrazor and the Decrepit Flamberge into the Legionnaire Flamberge." "Blasting a Pyrium Ingot also yields 5 Ancient Debris, which makes it valuable in the late game."]
	quest.160CDC75E020FC5B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pyrium Ingot"
	quest.162289747D9A3F7A.title: "Snow Queen"
	quest.162767740FEA093A.quest_desc: ["The Terminite Shovel is a digging tool forged from Terminite Ingots, with better durability than the Thallasium version." "Use it for excavation while you work toward higher-tier gear."]
	quest.162767740FEA093A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Terminite Shovel"
	quest.16364894BEBAF285.quest_desc: ["The Ultimate Fluid Tank is an upgraded version of the Elite Fluid Tank that can hold 112000 mB of liquid. You can toggle its Bucket Mode on and off by shift-right clicking while holding it. When Bucket Mode is on it can collect water and lava like a bucket. When Bucket Mode is off it can be placed like a block so you can attach Mechanical Pipe to it."]
	quest.16364894BEBAF285.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ultimate Fluid Tank"
	quest.164235783BF2AC9C.quest_desc: ["Generates power from coal at 20 FE/t."]
	quest.164235783BF2AC9C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Furnator Starter"
	quest.166215EEE5EF74C8.quest_desc: ["The first piece of the Prudentium armor set. Get the boots to unlock the chestplate and leggings."]
	quest.166477C6DB0639A5.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Wrench. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.166477C6DB0639A5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wrench"
	quest.1666AFB812FCCE59.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.1666AFB812FCCE59.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Break"
	quest.166A7343ACB26F03.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Flowering Crabapple Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.166A7343ACB26F03.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Flowering Crabapple Sapling"
	quest.166BA3DD2557B883.quest_desc: ["The Nature Upgrade Orb is an upgrade material in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. Applied at the Arcane Anvil, it gives +5% Nature Spell Power." "Craft it from 1 Empty Upgrade Orb and 8 Nature Runes."]
	quest.166BA3DD2557B883.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Nature Upgrade Orb"
	quest.1696E45280550FA6.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Sweet Berry Cheesecake. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.1696E45280550FA6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sweet Berry Cheesecake"
	quest.1698658107DDD33D.quest_desc: ["Used to create magical trinkets (you may need to make a couple)."]
	quest.1698658107DDD33D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dull Trinket"
	quest.16A30377B0DB77A3.quest_desc: ["Bring Gravitite Helmet, Gravitite Chestplate, Gravitite Leggings and 2 more items into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.16A30377B0DB77A3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gravitite Helmet, Gravitite Chestplate, Gravitite Leggings and 2 more items"
	quest.16A30377B0DB77A3.title: "Defying Gravity"
	quest.16B29FD743B12BBD.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Electronic Circuit. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.16B29FD743B12BBD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Electronic Circuit"
	quest.16B29FD743B12BBD.title: "The Power of Silicon"
	quest.16B81DBB1E02C13D.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Ferricore Chestplate. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.16B81DBB1E02C13D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ferricore Chestplate"
	quest.16B949AA9C525115.quest_desc: ["Amethyst Resonance Charm - when worn this charm will grant you a 15% mana regen boost."]
	quest.16B949AA9C525115.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Amethyst Resonance Charm"
	quest.16C4BD183D4ACD12.quest_desc: ["Multiplies the number of items that fit in each slot by 8."]
	quest.16C4BD183D4ACD12.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Stack Upgrade Tier 3"
	quest.16C750A43D5E3FFB.quest_desc: ["Craft wooden tools: an axe, a pickaxe and a shovel. They let you gather resources and mine, and they are your first step toward better crafting."]
	quest.16C750A43D5E3FFB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wooden Pickaxe, Wooden Sword and Wooden Axe"
	quest.16C750A43D5E3FFB.title: "&#6A3B1DWooden &#A56701Tools"
	quest.16CE7A1C699FE62A.quest_desc: ["Tier 2 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.16CE7A1C699FE62A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Aoe"
	quest.16CE82DED0F5AA55.quest_desc: ["They are crafted by causing a reaction between Ender Pearl or Ender Dust and a Singularity. Any explosive force should be enough to trigger the reaction. Nearly any explosion - even creepers - will work. They are always produced in matching pairs, to create a connection place 1 of the pairs of Quantum Entangled Singularity into the ME Quantum Link Chamber of the bridge on each side. It might be a good idea to label these with names when you create them using the vanilla Anvil."]
	quest.16CE82DED0F5AA55.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Singularity"
	quest.16CE82DED0F5AA55.title: "Singularities"
	quest.16E1B07466047CD3.quest_desc: ["Bring Bayad into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.16E1B07466047CD3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bayad"
	quest.16EE891F075D0DF3.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Energy Cell Nitro. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.16EE891F075D0DF3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Cell Nitro"
	quest.16F033001A7702A3.quest_desc: ["Defeat a Shattered, a sculk-covered husk roaming the Otherside." "It drops Sculk Bones."]
	quest.16F033001A7702A3.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Shattered"
	quest.16F033001A7702A3.title: "Shattered"
	quest.16F6409BD4C95F1E.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Cooked Rice. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
