	quest.18EF44843CA54DFF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wayward Compass"
	quest.18F9D32BC3F5888F.quest_desc: ["Get hold of 2x Steel Energized. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.18F9D32BC3F5888F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 2x Steel Energized"
	quest.18F9D32BC3F5888F.title: "Energized Steel"
	quest.19098ED47E0DD410.quest_desc: ["Blue Chalk allows summoning and binding Marid."]
	quest.19098ED47E0DD410.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chalk Blue Impure"
	quest.190A42FC30DD7F7B.quest_desc: ["Phantoms drop Phantom Membranes." "Besides repairing an Elytra, they are the base ingredient for Better End's Enchanted Membrane in an Infusion Ritual."]
	quest.190A42FC30DD7F7B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Phantom Membrane"
	quest.190BFD00F21888A9.quest_desc: ["The leggings of the Fiery armor set. Together with the chestplate, they unlock the helmet."]
	quest.19107B35E9BE5AC1.quest_desc: ["Steel Dust is produced by infusing an iron ingot with 10 units of carbon (producing Enriched Iron) and then infusing that with a further 10 units of Carbon. (Carbon = Coal, Charcoal or Refined Carbon)."]
	quest.19107B35E9BE5AC1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dust Steel"
	quest.19107B35E9BE5AC1.title: "Steel Dust"
	quest.19161579CDA9D76C.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Upgrade Orb. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.19161579CDA9D76C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Upgrade Orb"
	quest.1917D159436BC120.quest_desc: ["Tier Installers are used to upgrade various machines into their Factory equivalent. Right-click on the machine with the Tier Installer and it will upgrade that machine. its level (Basic, Advanced, or Elite) depending on the level of the Tier Installer used."]
	quest.1917D159436BC120.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ultimate Tier Installer"
	quest.191BBDD0FAF5BA85.quest_desc: ["The Wandering Magician Hood is part of the early-game Wandering Magician Armor set in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. It gives +2 Armor and +25 Max Mana." "Craft it by combining a Leather Cap with Arcane Essence."]
	quest.191BBDD0FAF5BA85.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wandering Magician Helmet"
	quest.191F435488BD2758.quest_desc: ["Scrolls are found around the world while exploring. A scroll you find only has one use if you cast it directly."]
	quest.191F435488BD2758.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.191F435488BD2758.title: "Scroll"
	quest.1922CB9E65C10165.quest_desc: ["The Portal Gun opens paired portals with left and right clicks. The Advanced Portal Gun opens portals to saved locations and uses power and Portal Fluid."]
	quest.1922CB9E65C10165.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.1924CB640D98A934.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Ring of Blades. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.1924CB640D98A934.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ring of Blades"
	quest.1931EC7F74EC86E4.quest_desc: ["The Khopesh is a curved ancient sword from Cataclysm carried by the Koboletons in the Desert Site." "Defeat them for a chance to get one."]
	quest.1931EC7F74EC86E4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Khopesh"
	quest.193B63300EBF4ADE.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Nether Burger. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.193B63300EBF4ADE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Nether Burger"
	quest.194B527D9EF162D9.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Plate of Stuffed Hoglin Snout. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.194B527D9EF162D9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Plate of Stuffed Hoglin Snout"
	quest.19568986E4E3F5A0.quest_desc: ["By putting a Filter Upgrade in a pump over some water, the pump will produce Heavy Water. Heavy Water is also known as H3O. H3O is needed for making D-T Fuel for the Fusion Reactor. To make Deuterium, you need to put the Heavy Water into an Electrolytic Separator."]
	quest.19568986E4E3F5A0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Upgrade Filter"
	quest.19616C156D7ED3CB.quest_desc: ["Combine an Echo Shard, 2 Warden Carapace, 2 Phantom Membranes and 100 mB of Molten Echo in a heated Mechanical Mixer." "Every piece of Warden gear requires one."]
	quest.19616C156D7ED3CB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Reinforced Echo Shard"
	quest.196B7B1A7E90AE07.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Disk Drive 64k. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.196B7B1A7E90AE07.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Disk Drive 64k"
	quest.1971A73786AFF363.quest_desc: ["The Deer enhances your jumping ability."]
	quest.1971A73786AFF363.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Familiar Deer"
	quest.1973AECBD83C5D88.quest_desc: ["The Abyssal Egg is a mysterious Cataclysm relic from the domain of The Leviathan." "It is one of the rarest treasures from the deepest parts of the ocean."]
	quest.1973AECBD83C5D88.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Abyssal Egg"
	quest.198969864EE843A8.quest_desc: ["The Wrath of the Desert from Cataclysm is a legendary bow tied to the ancient desert civilization." "It lets you attack from range with the force of the sandstorm."]
	quest.198969864EE843A8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wrath of the Desert"
	quest.198969864EE843A8.title: "Wrath Of The Desert"
	quest.199CF90DC707CDB6.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.199CF90DC707CDB6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Injecting Factory"
	quest.199D7BE7630280A7.quest_desc: ["it's all there right in its name."]
	quest.199D7BE7630280A7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Display Board"
	quest.19A0BEAFC9E256F4.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.19A0BEAFC9E256F4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ultimate Combining Factory"
	quest.19AF09853BA99EF2.quest_desc: ["Look in caves or mountains for a shiny amethyst shard. These crystals can be used to craft powerful items."]
	quest.19AF09853BA99EF2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 8x Amethyst Shard"
	quest.19AF09853BA99EF2.title: "Amethyst Shard"
	quest.19B89E5B0B9742AE.quest_desc: ["This is the Bronze Drill. This will give you the main ores that you'll need to expand further. Check the outputs in EMI and make sure you know that the drill has a chance of breaking, so don't just make 1."]
	quest.19B89E5B0B9742AE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bronze Drill"
	quest.19B89E5B0B9742AE.title: "Bronze Drill"
	quest.19C30AA67FE4CF1C.quest_desc: ["The Cog Crank from Create: Dreams n' Desires is a simple hand-powered part. Use it to supply rotational force manually and start your Create machinery when you have no other power source."]
	quest.19C30AA67FE4CF1C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cog Crank"
	quest.19E197A8960E062B.quest_desc: ["Kill the Ender Dragon, the End's original boss, which guards the central island." "Once it is dead, End Gateways appear and lead to the outer islands, where Better End's biomes and resources start."]
	quest.19E197A8960E062B.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Ender Dragon"
	quest.19E197A8960E062B.title: "Ender Dragon"
	quest.19E76733C5413B31.quest_desc: ["Bring Analog Circuit into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.19E76733C5413B31.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Analog Circuit"
	quest.19E8B2CABE3FAFF0.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Configurable Honeycomb. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.19E8B2CABE3FAFF0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.19F1A867A86B382C.quest_desc: ["Smelts faster and burns fuel more efficiently than the vanilla Furnace."]
	quest.19F1A867A86B382C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Iron Furnace"
	quest.1A4E815F549DB19E.quest_desc: ["The Amaramber Axe was added in version 0.4.2 as part of the Amaramber set in Eternal Starlight." "It is a basic tool for gathering wood from Torreya trees."]
	quest.1A4E815F549DB19E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Amaramber Axe"
	quest.1A535BEC9B5AEED7.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Bronze Furnace. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.1A535BEC9B5AEED7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bronze Furnace"
	quest.1A535BEC9B5AEED7.title: "Ten Times More Fuel Efficient"
	quest.1A5EF42D42A67CD2.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Thread Kindling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.1A5EF42D42A67CD2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thread Kindling"
	quest.1A611B8D50109E92.quest_desc: ["The Coke Oven is a large structure, larger than only a single block. This multiblock structure is used to take Coal or Coal Dust and heat it in a location with the absence of air and producing Coal Coke and occasionally some Creosote Oil. You can use Creosote Oil for the production of Lubricant and Coal Coke for Steel Ingots or just a powerful fuel lasting 4x as long! The Coke Oven block here is the role of the central controller. You will place other blocks surrounding it in a pattern that will eventually construct the full multiblock. Every multiblock is managed by a controller, but you usually cannot interact with the controller directly but instead through input and output hatches that you place in certain spots of the multiblock. You'll need a Fluid Input Hatch to handle an input of Steam to power the Coke Oven, an Item Input Hatch as a way to input the Coal and an Item Output Hatch to output the Coke. A Fluid Output Hatch is not required and will allow the multiblock to run without it, but with it you can extract the Creosote Oil from the Coal. Normally if you don't have enough of the correct hatches required, the multiblock will not function. If you hold a Wrench, a projection of the blocks needed for the rest of the multiblock will show after you've placed down the controller block. The specific holographic block will disappear if the correct block is placed, or will turn red if the block in that location is incorrect. If you hold a hatch in your hand, there will be green highlighted location where the hatches can go. If you placed the hatch outside of those highlighted locations, the multiblock will not recognize the hatch. One the Coke Oven controller states that it's shape is valid, you can insert Steam though the Fluid Input Hatch. Puting Coal or Coal Dust into the Item Input Hatch will allow the Coke Oven to fire up and start producing. If it doesn't work, retrace your steps and find out what went wrong."]
	quest.1A611B8D50109E92.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bronze Item Output Hatch, Bronze Fluid Input Hatch, Bronze Fluid Output Hatch and 3 more items"
	quest.1A611B8D50109E92.title: "Coke Oven"
	quest.1A690C193864B04B.quest_desc: ["Thermal Springstone can be refined into ingots infused with geothermal energy in Eternal Starlight." "They are used in advanced crafting, but the unstable heat makes the material hard to obtain."]
