	quest.1A9D03B5FA7A31B2.quest_desc: ["The chestplate of the Steeleaf armor set. Together with the leggings, it unlocks the helmet."]
	quest.1AA5AEC43512737E.quest_desc: ["Cultist Armor is the chestpiece of the Cultist Armor set in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. It gives +8 Armor, +125 Max Mana, +10% Blood Spell Power and +5% Spell Power." "The full set is Cultist Hood, Cultist Armor, Cultist Leggings and Cultist Boots. Craft the chestpiece from 8 Arcane Cloth and 1 Blood Rune, or upgrade Wizard Robes with a Blood Rune at a Smithing Table on newer versions."]
	quest.1AA5AEC43512737E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cultist Chestplate"
	quest.1AA9C58A302CF6F0.quest_desc: ["Craft the Starcatcher Hook and attach it to your rod. It helps you catch fish more effectively and reel in rare finds."]
	quest.1AA9C58A302CF6F0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.1AA9C58A302CF6F0.title: "Starcatcher Hook"
	quest.1AC1508C74720853.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Purpleheart Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.1AC1508C74720853.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Purpleheart Sapling"
	quest.1AC26146E6B66060.quest_desc: ["Unlike the Glass Divination Rod, this rod is already attuned to the type of block of the Sulfur used to make it. It otherwise works the same. This one finds an Abundant material."]
	quest.1AC26146E6B66060.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sulfur Attuned Divination Rod Abundant"
	quest.1ACFC934783F0741.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Pneumatic Cylinder. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.1ACFC934783F0741.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pneumatic Cylinder"
	quest.1AD1ACCFF766FC79.quest_desc: ["The Amaramber Hoe was added in version 0.4.2 as part of the Amaramber set in Eternal Starlight." "It prepares farmland and fits early progression."]
	quest.1AD1ACCFF766FC79.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Amaramber Hoe"
	quest.1AD2134BF5DA9515.quest_desc: ["The Interface acts like a chest, you can set an item or fluid inside the Interface and it will pull that item from the network to keep stock."]
