	quest.1AFA3699C28EB37D.quest_desc: ["The Hellshelf is a good start for stronger enchanting. Craft it from Nether Bricks, a Blaze Rod, a potion and a bookshelf." "It gives +3 Eterna (up to 45) and +3 Quanta."]
