	quest.1BFBBAAD6B587649.quest_desc: ["The Spatial IO Port is the core of the Spatial Digitizing system. It's placed at the vertex where all 3 pylon edges meet. It's where you place the Spatial Drive and allow it to capture a build or release it. This is also the block to power when charging the system. You can also interact with the Spatial IO Port with hoppers or other piping methods to automate the process if you so desire. A redstone signal is all the Spatial IO Port needs to activate. Be careful!"]
	quest.1BFBBAAD6B587649.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Spatial Io Port"
	quest.1BFBBAAD6B587649.title: "Spatial IO Port"
	quest.1C009CF9C42CA222.quest_desc: ["The redstone makes the block replenish itself."]
	quest.1C009CF9C42CA222.quest_subtitle: "Place a full block of Experiment 115 with Redstone"
	quest.1C215B42BE451EAD.quest_desc: ["The Berserker Soul Amulet is a rare Cataclysm accessory found in chests inside the Abandoned Spire structure." "When equipped, it grants +15% Attack Damage, which suits melee-focused players."]
	quest.1C215B42BE451EAD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Berserker Soul Amulet"
	quest.1C215B42BE451EAD.title: "Berserker Soul Amulet"
