	quest.1CAE6CEB81632ECF.title: "Prudentium Tools and Weaponry"
	quest.1CB7870C4167A8BF.quest_desc: ["Wondering about automatic Water pumping are you? Good thing you can do nearly anything you want! A Water Pump will automatically collect Water and transfer it to adjacent blocks. Make sure to place water sources surrounding the pump horizontally, give it Steam, and it will start producing Water for 1 EU/t. The Bronze Water Pump will produce 125mb of Water for every adjacent water source every 5 seconds, allowing for a maximum output of 1000mb every 5 seconds."]
	quest.1CB7870C4167A8BF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bronze Water Pump"
	quest.1CB7870C4167A8BF.title: "Bronze Water Pump"
	quest.1CB78DEDF28FFEBD.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Spider Seeds. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.1CB78DEDF28FFEBD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Spider Seeds"
	quest.1CE9C0DAE7FC637E.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Music Disc Otherside. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
