	quest.1CFC95E7F862D959.quest_desc: ["The Seashelf is the ocean counterpart of the Hellshelf. Craft it from Prismarine Bricks, a Pufferfish, a potion and a bookshelf." "It gives +3 Eterna (up to 45) and +3 Arcana, which leans toward rarer enchantments."]
	quest.1CFC95E7F862D959.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Seashelf"
