	quest.1DFD2E515F4BCE51.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Thread Feather. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.1DFD2E515F4BCE51.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thread Feather"
	quest.1DFF153A2738BFE1.quest_desc: ["Found in Hollow Hill treasure chests. Point it at the ground or a wall, charge it up and release. It pulls about 24 blocks of ore up to the surface."]
	quest.1DFF153A2738BFE1.quest_subtitle: "Find an Ore Magnet"
	quest.1E047CA7374468C8.quest_desc: ["Legendary Ink is the highest tier of magical ink in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. It is found very rarely in magic structures or obtained from powerful magical creatures." "Use it in the Scroll Forge to make Legendary Scrolls."]
	quest.1E047CA7374468C8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Legendary Ink"
	quest.1E047CA7374468C8.title: "Legendary Ink"
	quest.1E0F421B41CDBB46.quest_desc: ["The Thermoelectric Boiler is a multiblock structure that is used to make steam. Heat can be transfered into from outside."]
	quest.1E0F421B41CDBB46.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Boiler Casing"
	quest.1E11E931FC1C2087.quest_desc: ["Bring Spawn Egg Configurable Bee into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.1E11E931FC1C2087.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Spawn Egg Configurable Bee"
	quest.1E1B7C72826AE953.quest_desc: ["Arcane Rune is a crafting ingredient in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. It is the rune of the Arcane school and is used in magical crafting." "Runestones are made by infusing a Blank Runestone with 8 Focuses of the chosen school."]
	quest.1E1B7C72826AE953.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Arcane Rune"
	quest.1E2168776C2D6561.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Illusionists Mantle. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.1E2168776C2D6561.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Illusionists Mantle"
	quest.1E2896C1D8BCAD87.quest_desc: ["The leggings of the Arctic armor set. Together with the chestplate, they unlock the helmet."]
