	quest.409C564B6F632D0E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Void Upgrade"
	quest.40A5DE9150D0B86A.quest_desc: ["Evocation Rune is a crafting ingredient in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks, used for advanced Evocation crafting such as Evocation Upgrade Orbs." "Combine a Blank Runestone with 8 Emeralds to make one. Emeralds are the Focus of the Evocation school."]
	quest.40A5DE9150D0B86A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Evocation Rune"
	quest.40B37C654D4967C7.quest_desc: ["Upgrade Terminite Boots with an Aeternium Forged Plate at a Smithing Table to craft Aeternium Boots." "They finish the Aeternium armor set, Better End's strongest protective gear."]
