	quest.40E5FC2377896450.quest_desc: ["The Frostbranded Book is a top-tier Ice spellbook in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. It offers 12 spell slots, +10% Ice Spell Power and +200 Max Mana, a great pick for frost mages."]
