	quest.42162C6248690A73.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Scroll"
	quest.42181284A31A5165.quest_desc: ["Tier Installers are used to upgrade various machines into their Factory equivalent. Right-click on the machine with the Tier Installer and it will upgrade that machine. its level (Basic, Advanced, or Elite) depending on the level of the Tier Installer used."]
	quest.42181284A31A5165.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Elite Tier Installer"
	quest.421A6CCE09FF7F0C.quest_desc: ["Use this to record your glyphs."]
	quest.421A6CCE09FF7F0C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Annotated Codex"
	quest.421AFA4CE29C4436.quest_desc: ["The Guide is your collection log for everything fishing, from rare fish to shiny trophies."]
	quest.421AFA4CE29C4436.quest_subtitle: "Get the Starcatcher's Guide"
	quest.421AFA4CE29C4436.title: "Starcatcher's Guide"
	quest.421F14535BF99CEF.quest_desc: ["Bring Stratus Helmet, Stratus Chestplate, Stratus Leggings and 2 more items into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.421F14535BF99CEF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Stratus Helmet, Stratus Chestplate, Stratus Leggings and 2 more items"
	quest.421F14535BF99CEF.title: "Cover Me in Sunshine"
	quest.421F73A5E2956E4E.quest_desc: ["While bearing some similarity to the Fluix ME Covered Cable in appearance, they provide diagnostic function by visualizing the channel usage on the cables, the channels appear as lit colored lines that run along the black stripe on the cables giving you an understanding of how your channels are being used on your network. The first four channels show as lines matching the color of the cable, the next four show as white lines."]
	quest.421F73A5E2956E4E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fluix Smart Cable"
	quest.421F73A5E2956E4E.title: "Fluix Smart Cable"
	quest.422038A57A98E578.quest_desc: ["Creepers avoid the wearer."]
	quest.422038A57A98E578.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Kitty Slippers"
	quest.4223BF97E3C79811.quest_desc: ["Craft the Ignitium Elytra Chestplate from Cataclysm." "It combines an Ignitium Chestplate's protection with the flight of an Elytra, and is one of the strongest pieces made from Ignis' metal."]
	quest.4223BF97E3C79811.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ignitium Chestplate and Ignitium Elytra Chestplate"
	quest.423B9402EE6E71DD.quest_desc: ["Remember this: Large Cogwheel drives small = higher rpm. Small drives big = lower rpm. Large and Small sharing a shaft = no rpm change."]
	quest.423B9402EE6E71DD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cogwheel and Large Cogwheel"
