	quest.4460877D3B63EC51.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Used Steel Upgrade"
	quest.446D191A2628E5BB.quest_desc: ["The Handheld Saw from Create: Dreams n' Desires is a portable tool for quick material processing. Keep it nearby to handle cutting jobs without a stationary machine."]
	quest.446D191A2628E5BB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Handheld Saw"
	quest.4486D8B84EE7D81E.quest_desc: ["Bring Celestigem Sword into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.4486D8B84EE7D81E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Celestigem Sword"
	quest.448B91713475C5C3.quest_desc: ["The Questing Ram only appears in the Quest Grove, which is a rare spawn. Give it one wool of each of the 16 colors, either by right-clicking it or by dropping the wool in front of it."]
	quest.448B91713475C5C3.quest_subtitle: "Give the Questing Ram what it is missing"
	quest.4496F13DC6E772FC.quest_desc: ["Obtain a Gearbox and a Vertical Gearbox from Create. Gearboxes redirect rotational power between axes." "The standard Gearbox handles horizontal directions, while the Vertical Gearbox links horizontal and vertical axes."]
	quest.4496F13DC6E772FC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gearbox and Vertical Gearbox"
	quest.449AC4149447C26B.quest_desc: ["Has a chance to set attackers on fire."]
	quest.449AC4149447C26B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Flame Pendant"
	quest.44ADE9005757637C.quest_desc: ["The Cooking for Blockheads II book lets you craft food using the ingredients in your inventory."]
	quest.44ADE9005757637C.quest_subtitle: "Cook straight from your inventory"
	quest.44CC46E4EFDC509F.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Eclipsealloy Shovel. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.44CC46E4EFDC509F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Eclipsealloy Shovel"
	quest.44CFB3403E8D0BF6.quest_desc: ["The Meteorite Compass points toward the nearest meteorite. Meteorites contain Sky Stone and other useful materials."]
	quest.44CFB3403E8D0BF6.title: "Compass and Meteorite"
	quest.44D2D8EC560D8297.quest_desc: ["Press M to open the full-screen map. From there you can claim chunks to protect your base."]
	quest.44D2D8EC560D8297.quest_subtitle: "Protect your base."
	quest.44D2D8EC560D8297.title: "Claim Your Land"
	quest.44D4F624126DA371.quest_desc: ["Bring Soul Extractor into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.44D4F624126DA371.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Soul Extractor"
	quest.44DB40AE52CB1D95.quest_desc: ["Enriched Diamond is used in the Metallurgic Infuser. Enriched Diamond yields 80 units of diamond in the Metallurgic Infuser, the same as 8 diamonds."]
	quest.44DB40AE52CB1D95.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Enriched Diamond"
	quest.44E3CE67401E0238.quest_desc: ["Electromancer Boots are part of the Electromancer Armor set in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. They give +3 Armor, +125 Max Mana, +10% Lightning Spell Power and +5% Spell Power." "Craft them from 4 Arcane Cloth and 1 Lightning Rune, or upgrade Wizard Boots with 1 Lightning Rune and 1 Arcane Essence."]
	quest.44E3CE67401E0238.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Electromancer Boots"
	quest.44F0EF0D7B03A5E2.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Sealed Rapier. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.44F0EF0D7B03A5E2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sealed Rapier"
	quest.45051BB3EEA08C1A.quest_desc: ["NetherEx expands Nether exploration with additional environments and content. Discover its features while traveling through the Nether."]
	quest.45051BB3EEA08C1A.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.452EDABF74564FCF.quest_desc: ["The Amaramber Sickle was added in version 0.4.2 as part of the Amaramber set in Eternal Starlight." "It gathers plants and vegetation efficiently."]
	quest.452EDABF74564FCF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Amaramber Sickle"
	quest.4533FE25145D8E82.quest_desc: ["Your second multi-block: The Steam Blast Furnace! This one is nearly the same, with the only difference being it's one taller and uses Fire Clay Bricks instead of regular Bricks. Use the same trick with the Wrench to show you the block placements and don't forget you'll need only 3 hatches this time. They're the same as the Coke Oven, without the fluid output hatch, not yet anyway! You will use this Steam Blast Furnace to make your first Steel!"]
	quest.4533FE25145D8E82.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bronze Item Input Hatch, Bronze Fluid Input Hatch, Bronze Item Output Hatch and 2 more items"
	quest.4533FE25145D8E82.title: "Steam Blast Furnace"
	quest.45410E3C4A9DF1C4.quest_desc: ["Gray Chalk stabilizes pentacles even more than its predecessor."]
	quest.45410E3C4A9DF1C4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chalk Gray Impure"
	quest.45412ABD582FF8D7.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Upgrade Obsidian. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.45412ABD582FF8D7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Upgrade Obsidian"
	quest.454578CEB0618DFA.quest_desc: ["The Beaver increases the speed at which you harvest wood. It will also try to chop down trees."]
	quest.454578CEB0618DFA.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Familiar Beaver"
	quest.4549D908277481DB.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Configurable Honeycomb. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.4549D908277481DB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.454F456F34978425.quest_desc: ["This spirit will mine random Ores. It is also a little faster."]
	quest.454F456F34978425.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Miner Djinni Ores"
	quest.456654B12D46BD13.quest_desc: ["Notable rituals: Awakening creates helpers like amethyst golems, bookwyrms for storage lecterns and weald walkers, which are not very strong. Conjure Island: Plains converts the area around it into another biome. Water and air blocks get replaced, and source is only needed while it runs."]
	quest.456654B12D46BD13.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ritual Burrowing, Ritual Awakening, Ritual Conjure Island Plains and 6 more items"
	quest.456654B12D46BD13.title: "Green Tablets"
	quest.456DB9B6BF60ADA3.quest_desc: ["Tier Installers are used to upgrade various machines into their Factory equivalent. Right-click on the machine with the Tier Installer and it will upgrade that machine. its level (Basic, Advanced, or Elite) depending on the level of the Tier Installer used."]
	quest.456DB9B6BF60ADA3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Tier Installer"
	quest.457F623DAAA55AD9.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Steak and Potatoes. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.457F623DAAA55AD9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Steak and Potatoes"
	quest.4581119D3965F503.quest_desc: ["Assemble this multiblock with the Engineer's Hammer. It crushes ores and other materials into dust."]
	quest.4581119D3965F503.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 10x Steel Scaffolding Standard, 10x Light Engineering, 9x Hopper and 2 more items"
	quest.4581119D3965F503.title: "Crusher Multiblock"
	quest.458A3FAB0F83652D.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Crab. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.458A3FAB0F83652D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Crab"
	quest.458A44D96BD7C86A.quest_desc: ["The sword breaks after use, so make the hit count."]
	quest.458A44D96BD7C86A.quest_subtitle: "Attack something with the Glass Sword"
	quest.458B3F19C9BBA511.quest_desc: ["This Module vents high-pressure air when the tube pressure reaches 4.9 bar (19.9 for Advanced Pressure Tubes). While it helps prevent explosions, it results in energy loss and wasted fuel. With a Module Expansion Card, you can precisely adjust the pressure threshold through the GUI."]
	quest.458B3F19C9BBA511.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Safety Tube Module"
	quest.4590F5422A848829.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.4590F5422A848829.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Gust"
	quest.45922831D24638C0.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Twisted Ghasta. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.45922831D24638C0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Twisted Ghasta"
	quest.4594A8C1E81F7D37.quest_desc: ["The Eldritch Manuscript is made with Eight Knowledge Fragments and one Echo Shard. These are both found while looting Ancient Cities. Upon use it will give you the power of one Eldritch Scroll that you choose. You may unlock more but, a new Manuscript is needed per scroll."]
	quest.4594A8C1E81F7D37.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Eldritch Manuscript"
	quest.45A9CD4D5ADD0A3E.quest_desc: ["Defeat 3 Prowlers from Cataclysm, one of the more dangerous enemies the mod adds." "Track them down."]
	quest.45A9CD4D5ADD0A3E.quest_subtitle: "Defeat The Prowler"
	quest.45A9CD4D5ADD0A3E.title: "The Prowler"
	quest.45C0DCC447288A06.quest_desc: ["An Armored Version of the Jetpack."]
	quest.45C0DCC447288A06.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Jetpack Armored"
	quest.45C24C7004A8F701.quest_desc: ["The Zombie Scepter drops from the Twilight Lich. It lets you summon or control zombie minions during a fight." "It can be unpredictable, so it works best in controlled situations such as groups of enemies or dungeons."]
	quest.45C24C7004A8F701.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Zombie Scepter"
	quest.45C56FC46B501F99.quest_desc: ["The Second Highest Tiered Storage Cell in normal AE2, which can contain 65,536 bytes of storage. 65,536 bytes of storage can hold 8,128 Stacks of a single item. or 4,160 Stacks,while holding 63 Different items."]
	quest.45C56FC46B501F99.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Item Storage Cell 64k"
	quest.45D60F041613F241.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Buddhas Hand Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.45D60F041613F241.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Buddhas Hand Sapling"
	quest.45E5BA0514FCA493.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Midnight Mantle. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.45E5BA0514FCA493.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Midnight Mantle"
	quest.45E8EC554D3F1E25.quest_desc: ["The Laser Matrix System is the only way for the Fusion Reactor to start. It requires millions of RF to run, so make sure you have ample power to run these lasers. The Laser Amplifier takes in lasers and stores the energy. You can use a redstone signal to tell it to output the energy. This one should be directed at the reactor's laser focus matrix. The Tractor Beam takes in lasers and outputs them in a different direction. This is a way to add more lasers to your system to store more power faster. They can, also, be used to mine blocks. The laser is, well, the laser. The laser will mine blocks, so make sure to know where it's pointing."]
	quest.45E8EC554D3F1E25.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Laser Amplifier, Laser Tractor Beam and Laser"
	quest.45EE0F13462F75B7.quest_desc: ["Let your favorite mob drive your trains!"]
	quest.45EE0F13462F75B7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Schedule"
	quest.45F47E7CE8CF1E27.quest_desc: ["Defeat a Sculk Leech to get Soul Dust. They can also be hiding inside Crystallized Amber."]
	quest.45F47E7CE8CF1E27.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Sculk Leech"
	quest.45F47E7CE8CF1E27.title: "Sculk Leech"
	quest.45F61C0596335D0F.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Music Disc Cat. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.45F61C0596335D0F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Music Disc Cat"
	quest.45F7B6D8B7FB411A.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Tertium Sword, Tertium Pickaxe, Tertium Shovel and 2 more items. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.45F7B6D8B7FB411A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Tertium Sword, Tertium Pickaxe, Tertium Shovel and 2 more items"
	quest.45F7B6D8B7FB411A.title: "Tertium Tools and Weaponry"
	quest.46053853A84567F9.quest_desc: ["The arcane core is to be placed beneath the enchanting apparatus to aid in magical endeavors."]
	quest.46053853A84567F9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Arcane Core"
	quest.460D439B9F4B56D2.quest_desc: ["Press R while your inventory or a container is open to sort its contents."]
	quest.460D439B9F4B56D2.quest_subtitle: "One key does it."
	quest.460D439B9F4B56D2.title: "Sort Your Inventory"
	quest.461FC236C6A942D3.quest_desc: ["This allows to and from transfer of source from many jars at once."]
	quest.461FC236C6A942D3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Relay Splitter"
	quest.462AB51D40A6902B.quest_desc: ["Flux Dust comes from redstone. Place obsidian above bedrock, drop redstone dust between them, then left-click the obsidian. You can use as much redstone as you like each time."]
	quest.462AB51D40A6902B.quest_subtitle: "Make Flux Dust from redstone"
	quest.4636111DB885DDB0.quest_desc: ["Brontes is a heavy hammer from Cataclysm, part of the same arsenal as Ceraunus." "It is one of the mod's powerful weapons."]
	quest.4636111DB885DDB0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Brontes"
	quest.4636111DB885DDB0.title: "Brontes"
	quest.463E9EA378DD2604.quest_desc: ["This Machine can place Fluids in the world, It's highly configurable."]
	quest.463E9EA378DD2604.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fluidplacert1"
	quest.46517FD86E76A766.quest_desc: ["Robit is Mekanism's mechanical companion. He can act as a crafting grid, a furnace, an anvil, a chest, or simply a cute little buddy."]
	quest.46517FD86E76A766.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Robit"
	quest.46535886413DEE2A.quest_desc: ["The lowest tier of the stack upgrades."]
	quest.46535886413DEE2A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Stack Upgrade Starter Tier"
	quest.46661D30758804B0.quest_desc: ["The Moonring Bow is a ranged weapon dropped by the Lunar Monstrosity in the Cursed Garden in Eternal Starlight." "It is guaranteed to drop when you defeat the boss."]
	quest.46661D30758804B0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Moonring Bow"
	quest.46661D30758804B0.title: "Moonring Bow"
	quest.4669C67518ADA658.quest_desc: ["Craft the Naga Scale Leggings from scales collected from the Naga. They balance agility and protection." "They are part of the Naga Scale armor set and help prepare you for the tougher enemies ahead."]
	quest.4669C67518ADA658.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Naga Leggings"
	quest.46753DE03E5ECFB9.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Hawthorn Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.46753DE03E5ECFB9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Hawthorn Sapling"
	quest.4681D2BA66A2EBE4.quest_desc: ["Induction Provides make up the transfer rate of the battery, both input and output. Transfer Rate: 6.55 MFE/t."]
	quest.4681D2BA66A2EBE4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Elite Induction Provider"
	quest.468CD002E147A5DD.quest_desc: ["Bring Rider Flute into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.468CD002E147A5DD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rider Flute"
	quest.468FA0F4EEF3ED46.quest_desc: ["The Extended Buses have increased upgrade slots, and are 8x faster."]
	quest.468FA0F4EEF3ED46.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ex Export Bus Part and Ex Import Bus Part"
	quest.468FA0F4EEF3ED46.title: "Extended Buses"
	quest.46931846DB13F776.quest_desc: ["Threads are upgrades for your Ars armor. Each armor piece has up to 3 slots, and a higher slot level gives a stronger effect. Some threads only work in a level 3 slot, and threads do not stack, only the highest level is active." "Notable threads: High Step adds step height per level, Wixie extends potion duration, and Undying acts as a Totem of Undying when you sleep." "Wixie's Enchanting Apparatus with AE2 makes this easier."]
	quest.46931846DB13F776.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thread Depths, Thread Heights, Thread Whirlisprig and 16 more items"
	quest.46931846DB13F776.title: "All The Threads"
	quest.46963B5745F0ECA6.quest_desc: ["Shadow-Walker Armor is the chestpiece of the Shadow-Walker Armor set in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. It gives +8 Armor, +125 Max Mana, +10% Ender Spell Power and +5% Spell Power, and can hold 1 imbued spell." "Craft it from 8 Arcane Cloth and 1 Ender Rune, or upgrade Wizard Robes with 1 Ender Rune and 1 Arcane Essence."]
	quest.46963B5745F0ECA6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Shadowwalker Chestplate"
	quest.46A2949DFA16CC6E.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Configurable Honeycomb. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.46A2949DFA16CC6E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.46A5B3D57084D1C4.quest_desc: ["The Alchemist Mask is a utility item from Eternal Starlight tied to alchemy progression." "Depending on the version, it enhances exploration or alchemy mechanics."]
	quest.46A5B3D57084D1C4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Alchemist Mask"
	quest.46BA34923525F3D8.quest_desc: ["Changes player-related spawning conditions, so the spawner cares less about players being nearby."]
	quest.46BA34923525F3D8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ignore Players Spawner Rune"
	quest.46BA34923525F3D8.title: "Ignore Players Spawner Rune"
	quest.46BB618D32E11D1A.quest_desc: ["Craft a Sleeping Bag to sleep safely without a bed. It lets you set your spawn point and rest almost anywhere."]
	quest.46BB618D32E11D1A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.46BB618D32E11D1A.title: "Sleeping Bag"
	quest.46BC1669476A046C.quest_desc: ["Bring Ghast Salad into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.46BC1669476A046C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ghast Salad"
	quest.46C76FD0C9D0F414.quest_desc: ["Makes the backpack pick up items that you walk over."]
	quest.46C76FD0C9D0F414.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pickup Upgrade"
	quest.46CA95E874EC90D1.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.46CA95E874EC90D1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Compressing Factory"
	quest.46E8C57260187BDB.quest_desc: ["Mine the glowing Aurora Crystal formations in the Crystal Mountains to get Crystal Shards." "They are among the most common ingredients in Better End's Infusion Rituals."]
	quest.46E8C57260187BDB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Crystal Shards"
	quest.46F11C259FC72F5D.quest_desc: ["An Export Bus pushes selected items from your network into an attached inventory. Use it to supply machines or keep blocks stocked."]
	quest.46FD132CE008A57A.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Smart Filter. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.46FD132CE008A57A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.46FE1E29B6F9B0DE.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Golden Egg. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.46FE1E29B6F9B0DE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Golden Egg"
	quest.470B9BBE473E4872.quest_desc: ["The \"Quartz in Netherrack\" block is an alternative recipe for the Quartz Nest. It is crafted with 1 Netherrack and 8 Nether Quartz."]
	quest.470B9BBE473E4872.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Nether Quartz Nest"
	quest.470C6BCB3EB14006.quest_desc: ["Will calcify and lose efficiency over time to a minimum of 33% efficiency when not using Distilled Water. Using an Axe on the Boiler will reset its calcification."]
	quest.470C6BCB3EB14006.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bronze Solar Boiler"
	quest.470D9FDD6617D4F6.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Shield of Retaliation. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.470D9FDD6617D4F6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Shield of Retaliation"
	quest.4725035EE888EDE4.quest_desc: ["The Redstone Control Module is meant to let you control your machines with redstone! Right Clicking the module in your hand will change its setting from the machine requiring a High Signal to Low Signal and vice versa. Then place it into the redstone module slot. What this means is: While the setting is on High Signal, the machine will only function if it is given a redstone signal. No redstone signal will turn it off. While the setting is on Low Signal, the machine will only function if it is not given a redstone signal. A redstone signal will turn it off."]
	quest.4725035EE888EDE4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Redstone Control Module"
	quest.472D846A7E655FAC.quest_desc: ["Gives you a longer window to reel in a fish."]
	quest.472D846A7E655FAC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Redstone Hook"
	quest.47515072B948EB9E.quest_desc: ["Shadowpulse Goo turns Netherite Blocks into Eclipse Alloy. It is fed with Sculk or Sculk Catalysts, and it can produce lower-tier resources faster. Celestigem and Eclipse Alloy tools, weapons and armor need power to work."]
	quest.47515072B948EB9E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 2x Raw Eclipsealloy, 2x Eclipsealloy Ingot and Gooblock Tier4"
	quest.47515072B948EB9E.title: "Making Eclipse Alloy"
	quest.475BFEF6EAA09FED.quest_desc: ["Make the Resonarium Axe in a Mechanical Crafter using a Diamond Axe, Sturdy Sheets, a Resonarium Plate and a Resonarium Upgrade Template." "The template can be found in Ancient Cities, Trial Chambers and Strongholds."]
	quest.475BFEF6EAA09FED.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Resonarium Axe"
	quest.476135F0C7C9EE87.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Gooblock Tier1. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.476135F0C7C9EE87.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gooblock Tier1"
	quest.4775A233A5C46004.quest_desc: ["Tier 2 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.4775A233A5C46004.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Firework"
	quest.4776A81A79761BC5.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Cashew Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.4776A81A79761BC5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cashew Sapling"
	quest.477AD8B1CEF350E7.quest_desc: ["Tier 2 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.477AD8B1CEF350E7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Duration Down"
	quest.47A13F2B2331B0CC.quest_desc: ["The Goblin Stronghold lies deep beneath the Twilight Forest. Its tomb holds the Knight Phantoms, spectral warriors who still guard their fallen king." "They fight as a coordinated group with constant attacks, which makes this one of the toughest fights in the dimension. You need to defeat every Phantom Knight to win."]
	quest.47A13F2B2331B0CC.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Knight Phantom"
	quest.47A13F2B2331B0CC.title: "Knight Phantom"
	quest.47A34AA5D80EC039.quest_desc: ["Bring Coffea Sapling into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.47A34AA5D80EC039.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Coffea Sapling"
	quest.47A8BDA63DB27FA9.quest_desc: ["Vacuum tube, thermionic valve, Electron Tube, by any name it’s a cool looking item and a key ingredient for Create components that have “smarts”."]
	quest.47A8BDA63DB27FA9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Electron Tube"
	quest.47A94E3465331798.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Thread Warding. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.47A94E3465331798.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thread Warding"
	quest.47B79E9F1154361E.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Core 4k. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.47B79E9F1154361E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Core 4k"
	quest.47BD4D89EE0EECEA.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Arcanethyst. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.47BD4D89EE0EECEA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Arcanethyst"
	quest.47CDF2F5E5F3BF4A.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: Steam Blast Furnace."]
	quest.47CDF2F5E5F3BF4A.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Steam Blast Furnace"
	quest.47CF20BA88F5854A.quest_desc: ["The Basic Control Circuit is a Crafting Component used in the creation of multiple lower-tier machines."]
	quest.47CF20BA88F5854A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Control Circuit"
	quest.47D5460052C9075E.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Arcane Anvil. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.47D5460052C9075E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Arcane Anvil"
	quest.47E3BE49B4A74BF0.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Clove Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.47E3BE49B4A74BF0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Clove Sapling"
	quest.47E472ECCFC6B98D.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Mjolnir. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.47E472ECCFC6B98D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mjolnir"
	quest.47F9ADAAF38A864D.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Spawn Egg Configurable Bee. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.47F9ADAAF38A864D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Spawn Egg Configurable Bee"
	quest.47FB3A48D3E0C1BF.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Sapphire Seeds. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.47FB3A48D3E0C1BF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sapphire Seeds"
	quest.47FD673F259F1C85.quest_desc: ["Variants to find: Badlands, Basalt, Birch, Crimson, Desert, End, Giant Tree Taiga, Icy, Jungle, Mangrove, Nether Brick, Oak, Ocean, Savanna, Soul, Snowy, Taiga and Warped."]
	quest.47FD673F259F1C85.quest_subtitle: "Find all 18 Pillager Outpost variants"
	quest.481148E497D80C70.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Sealed Claymore. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.481148E497D80C70.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sealed Claymore"
	quest.4817447020A18FF9.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Steeleaf Sword, Steeleaf Pickaxe, Steeleaf Shovel and Steeleaf Axe. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.4817447020A18FF9.quest_subtitle: "Craft a full set of Steeleaf Tools"
	quest.4817447020A18FF9.title: "Steeleaf Tools"
	quest.4820F100479FE39D.quest_desc: ["The Configurator is more than just a wrench - it's the essential tool for managing your Mekanism setup. Hold SHIFT and scroll to switch between its different modes. The currently selected mode is displayed in the bottom-left of your screen. * Configure. Change the input and output sides of machines without opening their GUI. * Empty. Hold SHIFT + RIGHT-CLICK to empty the contents of a machine or container. * Rotate. Rotate machines with RIGHT-CLICK or SHIFT + RIGHT-CLICK, depending on the desired orientation. You can also RIGHT-CLICK a machine's face to make it face the side you're clicking."]
	quest.4820F100479FE39D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurator"
	quest.4820F100479FE39D.title: "Configurator"
	quest.4855505E6625D540.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Jellyfish Necklace. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.4855505E6625D540.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Jellyfish Necklace"
	quest.48857E853D866C67.quest_desc: ["Sniffers can find Sussy Bee spawn eggs while sniffing the ground. A Sussy Bee turns nearby sand and gravel into suspicious sand and gravel, but only produces functional blocks in biomes where those naturally appear."]
	quest.48857E853D866C67.quest_subtitle: "Get a Sussy Bee spawn egg"
	quest.48857E853D866C67.title: "Sussy Bee"
	quest.489EB3838F3C864F.quest_desc: ["Installed in the ME Wireless Access Point, it provides a steadily increasing range of blocks at a cost of higher power consumption. Up to 64 Boosters may be inserted for a total range of 528 block radius and an energy cost of 4.1kAE/t."]
	quest.489EB3838F3C864F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wireless Booster"
	quest.48A955140CAE34CE.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Caelestis. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.48A955140CAE34CE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Caelestis"
	quest.48CAB78C5FCBA7E7.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Core 256k. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.48CAB78C5FCBA7E7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Core 256k"
	quest.48D5E5A84C84C94D.quest_desc: ["The Flamethrower is a ranged weapon which uses Hydrogen gas as its fuel. It is fairly effective against mobs as it deals damage when they are directly hit with the stream and sets them on fire."]
	quest.48D5E5A84C84C94D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Flamethrower"
	quest.48E2FD95A5DAB41E.quest_desc: ["This tablet occasionally bone meals nearby plants or causes baby animals to grow."]
	quest.48E2FD95A5DAB41E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ritual Overgrowth"
	quest.48F52EC19F0A2F07.quest_desc: ["Bring Sequoia Sapling into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.48F52EC19F0A2F07.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sequoia Sapling"
	quest.48F6C6EECCDC7986.quest_desc: ["Applies an extra level of Looting to killed entities."]
	quest.48F6C6EECCDC7986.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Superstitious Hat"
	quest.48F92C67E144BD68.quest_desc: ["Glue blocks into contraptions of any size, be they small or super."]
	quest.48F92C67E144BD68.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Super Glue"
	quest.48FEA69CE9039374.quest_desc: ["The Tool Assembly Smithing Template combines a Better End tool head with a handle into a finished tool at a Smithing Table." "It is used for Thallasium, Terminite and Aeternium tools and weapons."]
	quest.48FEA69CE9039374.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Tool Assembly Smithing Template"
	quest.491CC7839C223077.quest_desc: ["The Reforging Table replaces an Affix Item's Affixes with a new combination, using Rarity Materials and reforging resources. Use it when the item's rarity is worth keeping but its Affixes are not."]
	quest.491CC7839C223077.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Reforging Table"
	quest.491CC7839C223077.title: "Reforge Your Gear"
	quest.4930F1ACA3F96E7E.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Bloom Stone Chestplate and Bloom Stone Pauldrons from the Cataclysm: Spellbooks addon." "Collect both pieces of Bloom Stone equipment."]
	quest.4930F1ACA3F96E7E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bloom Stone Pauldrons"
	quest.4946175485D645F5.quest_desc: ["The Hellrazor is the upgraded Decrepit Scythe in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. It holds 1 imbued spell and comes with Raise Hell III. In the main hand it gives 13 Attack Damage and 1.4 Attack Speed." "Raise Hell III deals 15 Damage in an 8-block radius, casts 3 times, costs 180 Mana and has a 12.5-second cooldown." "Upgrade the Decrepit Scythe with 1 Timeless Slurry and 1 Pyrium Ingot."]
	quest.4946175485D645F5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Hellrazor"
	quest.494693F57B143380.quest_desc: ["The Plagued Mask is the headpiece of the Plagued Armor set in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. It gives +3 Armor, +125 Max Mana, +10% Nature Spell Power and +5% Spell Power." "Upgrade a Wizard Helmet with 1 Nature Rune and 1 Arcane Essence to make it."]
	quest.494693F57B143380.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Plagued Helmet"
	quest.49504FE5CAE306B6.quest_desc: ["The Hellshelf of Masterful Sight is the upgraded Sightshelf and adds +2 Clues." "Upgrade a Hellshelf of Sight with Emerald Blocks, Netherite Ingots and potions."]
	quest.49504FE5CAE306B6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sightshelf T2"
	quest.49517AE7EE79586C.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Configurable Honeycomb. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.49517AE7EE79586C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.495611D83A45B8B7.quest_desc: ["Frozen Bones are dropped from Strays and are used to craft Ice Scrolls."]
	quest.495611D83A45B8B7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Frozen Bone"
	quest.4960CD87DDFD204E.quest_desc: ["Used to bind circuits together in an inscriber."]
	quest.4960CD87DDFD204E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Printed Silicon"
	quest.49677C96B7800837.quest_desc: ["Pressurized Tubes are a way of transporting types of gas, such as steam, hydrogen, and oxygen. Transfer Rate: 64,000 mb/t."]
	quest.49677C96B7800837.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Elite Pressurized Tube"
	quest.4978AA38D8236D1E.quest_desc: ["The Decrepit Flamberge is a strong two-handed sword used by Ancient Knights in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks, and they can drop it." "In the main hand it gives 11 Attack Damage, 1.3 Attack Speed and +4 Armor. You can later upgrade it into the Legionnaire Flamberge with Timeless Slurry and a Pyrium Ingot."]
	quest.4978AA38D8236D1E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Keeper Flamberge"
	quest.4980BCED9BDBA721.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Flask of the Red Mist. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.4980BCED9BDBA721.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Flask of the Red Mist"
	quest.4998F33B8C4E6757.quest_desc: ["This machine uses energy to extract dusts out of certain blocks and ores, making it essential to producing different kinds of tools. Not to be mistaken with the Crusher, this machine is the pulverizer equivalent in other mods."]
	quest.4998F33B8C4E6757.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Enrichment Chamber"
	quest.499BFE8BA61C89CC.quest_desc: ["A pre-programmed Drone that defends a 31x31x31 area centered on the position it's deployed from. This Drone has two basic modes depending on how it is deployed: Deploying on the ground will tell the Drone to attack any mobs which enter its area using whatever it already has on-board. Deploying on top of an inventory containing a Weapon or Minigun Ammo (assuming the drone is carrying a minigun upgrade) will tell the Drone to arm itself using items inside the inventory before defending its area."]
	quest.499BFE8BA61C89CC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Guard Drone"
	quest.49A28053D89F5202.quest_desc: ["Keep away from bare wires. This coil handles up to 32768 FE/t."]
	quest.49A28053D89F5202.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wirecoil Steel"
	quest.49AD5BF5AA91F934.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for End Stone Nest. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.49AD5BF5AA91F934.quest_subtitle: "Obtain End Stone Nest"
	quest.49CD7119588EFBCE.quest_desc: ["This is used to generate source from nearby food."]
	quest.49CD7119588EFBCE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mycelial Sourcelink"
	quest.49D28B33799B36AB.quest_desc: ["Craft a Bank Link together with the Bank you want to link it to. The Bank is not consumed." "Put the linked Bank in a Bank Dock to reach the same contents from multiple places and stash items on the go."]
	quest.49D28B33799B36AB.quest_subtitle: "Access one Bank from several places"
	quest.49E05F1C90518BE5.quest_desc: ["Mine copper ore underground to get Raw Copper. It is one of the first metals you will find and is used for crafting and decoration." "This is a good way to learn how to mine and process metals."]
	quest.49E05F1C90518BE5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 32x Raw Copper"
	quest.49E05F1C90518BE5.title: "Raw &#FD6E01Copper"
	quest.49E6B0016D1E1DD1.quest_desc: ["The most basic miner spirit. It will bring back random blocks, some of which may be ore."]
	quest.49E6B0016D1E1DD1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Miner Foliot Unspecialized"
	quest.49EE141C4FD46F8F.quest_desc: ["The Thermal Springstone Pickaxe is crafted from Thermal Springstone Ingots in Eternal Starlight." "It is a mid-tier mining tool that resists heat, which suits geothermal regions."]
	quest.49EE141C4FD46F8F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thermal Springstone Pickaxe"
	quest.49FC9C6C179B4628.quest_desc: ["Craft the Neptunium Hoe from Aquaculture 2. It is made from Neptunium, a rare fishing treasure material, and has high durability. It also completes the Neptunium tool set."]
	quest.49FC9C6C179B4628.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Neptunium Hoe"
	quest.49FE61875E545B7D.quest_desc: ["The Scepter of Twilight is the strongest scepter dropped by the Twilight Lich. It fires powerful magical attacks that can overwhelm enemies quickly." "Its power is chaotic, so handle it with care."]
	quest.49FE61875E545B7D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Twilight Scepter"
	quest.49FED56FA740215E.quest_desc: ["The Omni Gearbox from Create: Dreams n' Desires is a flexible way to connect and redirect mechanical power. It helps you build more compact and versatile kinetic networks." "It was added in the 2.2a-BETA update for Minecraft 1.21 to 1.21.1."]
	quest.49FED56FA740215E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Omni Gearbox"
	quest.4A1035A5566EB4A1.quest_desc: ["This spirit takes care of farming trees for you. It even attempts to replant them!"]
	quest.4A1035A5566EB4A1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Book of Binding Bound Foliot, Smart Filter and 4x Oak Sapling. Earn the advancement: Summon Foliot Lumberjack"
	quest.4A1035A5566EB4A1.title: "Ritual: Summon Foliot Lumberjack"
	quest.4A1062A8CB38B7AE.quest_desc: ["Bring Limited Iron Barrel 4 into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.4A1062A8CB38B7AE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Limited Iron Barrel 4"
	quest.4A161F6CA84621D3.quest_desc: ["The Calculation Press is used in an Inscriber to turn Certus Quartz into a Printed Calculation Circuit. Presses are found in meteorites, and the Inscriber can duplicate one with an Iron Block."]
	quest.4A18F79E859C2F35.quest_desc: ["Bring Piglin Mask into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.4A18F79E859C2F35.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Piglin Mask"
	quest.4A1FC00E24064975.quest_desc: ["Bring Bow Celestigem into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.4A1FC00E24064975.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bow Celestigem"
	quest.4A23C16B3418A2C5.quest_desc: ["Used to cast tier 2 glyphs or lower."]
	quest.4A23C16B3418A2C5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Apprentice Spell Book"
	quest.4A4287D52B617086.quest_desc: ["This mysterious Simply Swords item can transform into unique weapons. The result depends on the conditions and blocks involved, so it is a good way to get powerful, rare weapons."]
	quest.4A4287D52B617086.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Contained Remnant"
	quest.4A45135E97DBCE0B.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Gar. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.4A45135E97DBCE0B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gar"
	quest.4A478B7E15435C9C.quest_desc: ["The Antiprotronic Nucleosynthesizer takes antimatter and turns one item into another. One recipe is turning coal into diamonds."]
	quest.4A478B7E15435C9C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Antiprotonic Nucleosynthesizer"
	quest.4A66221F79042336.quest_desc: ["Malarite is a basic material found in swamp-like biomes of Eternal Starlight." "It is used to craft early-game tools and weapons."]
	quest.4A66221F79042336.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Malarite"
	quest.4A6DF57AB87B9565.quest_desc: ["The Aethersent Bottoms is crafted from Aethersent Ingots in Eternal Starlight." "It is part of the Aethersent armor set, tied to meteors and celestial materials found in the dimension."]
	quest.4A6DF57AB87B9565.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Aethersent Bottoms"
	quest.4A767C78AE8FF637.quest_desc: ["Bring Energy Discharger Starter into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.4A767C78AE8FF637.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Discharger Starter"
	quest.4A828CCE62DFEC66.quest_desc: ["This Bank has 36 slots and holds up to 16,384 items."]
	quest.4A828CCE62DFEC66.quest_subtitle: "The fourth Bank tier"
	quest.4A87B7CF8FFE9590.quest_desc: ["The Market sells things like saplings, seeds and bone meal. Emeralds are the currency."]
	quest.4A87B7CF8FFE9590.quest_subtitle: "Buy seeds and more with emeralds"
	quest.4A89C1C145646884.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Brown Trout. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.4A89C1C145646884.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Brown Trout"
	quest.4A9D28AA281FA6F5.quest_desc: ["Arcane pedestals are used along with the enchanting apparatus to create magical items."]
	quest.4A9D28AA281FA6F5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Arcane Pedestal"
	quest.4A9EE25B961AB116.quest_desc: ["Bring Sugarbag Honeycomb into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.4A9EE25B961AB116.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sugarbag Honeycomb"
	quest.4AB7420E4AC7D9EF.quest_desc: ["The Ultimate Bin is a storage block which can hold 262,144 of a single item. It will retain its inventory when broken."]
	quest.4AB7420E4AC7D9EF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ultimate Bin"
	quest.4ABD54CF90945DB4.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Cooldown Ring. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.4ABD54CF90945DB4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cooldown Ring"
	quest.4AC0A33A52608BA9.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.4AC0A33A52608BA9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Summon Wolves"
	quest.4AD54FE570F81689.quest_desc: ["Stronger creatures and rarer resources show up as you progress in Eternal Starlight." "Two important ones are the refined Aethersent Ingot and the rare Creator Hide, both used in advanced crafting."]
	quest.4AD54FE570F81689.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Aethersent Ingot and Creteor Hide"
	quest.4AD54FE570F81689.title: "Advanced Starlight Materials"
	quest.4ADCBDEB3BC4BB7D.quest_desc: ["When used to block, you gain a small mana boost and spell damage."]
	quest.4ADCBDEB3BC4BB7D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Enchanters Shield"
	quest.4AE6FFA9F0833787.quest_desc: ["Bring Configurable Honeycomb into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.4AE6FFA9F0833787.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.4B232DF6258697A6.quest_desc: ["Ancient Knowledge Fragments can be found rarely in bookshelf loot, more commonly found in Ancient Cities or by trading with a Wandering Trader. These are used to Craft an Eldritch Manuscript which is key in unlocking Ancient Knowledge that was lost long, long ago and is now only seen used by Wardens and the few who dare to go looking for this old school of magic."]
	quest.4B232DF6258697A6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ancient Knowledge Fragment"
	quest.4B23784649F94B08.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Socotra Dragon Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.4B23784649F94B08.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Socotra Dragon Sapling"
	quest.4B415299FF7EA8B6.quest_desc: ["Stand in water while wearing Phoenix Armor to turn it into obsidian armor."]
	quest.4B415299FF7EA8B6.quest_subtitle: "Collect a full set of obsidian armor"
	quest.4B415299FF7EA8B6.title: "Ice Bucket Armor"
	quest.4B49E98292B1898F.quest_desc: ["Increases the wearer's maximum health."]
	quest.4B49E98292B1898F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Crystal Heart"
	quest.4B4D9BF973338300.quest_desc: ["Blaze Ember plus Polymorphic Fluid gives unrefined Blaze Ember fuel. Voidflame Coal plus refined Blaze Ember fuel gives unrefined Voidflame fuel, and Eclipse Ember plus refined Voidflame fuel gives unrefined Eclipse Ember fuel. An unrefined fuel plus a goo of at least the same tier gives the refined fuel."]
	quest.4B4D9BF973338300.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Refined T2 Fluid Bucket, Refined T3 Fluid Bucket and Refined T4 Fluid Bucket"
	quest.4B4D9BF973338300.title: "Fluid Fuels"
	quest.4B69081BB1747107.quest_desc: ["Faster and more fuel efficient than the lower tiers."]
	quest.4B69081BB1747107.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Diamond Furnace"
	quest.4B6D9AE6BE1844AD.quest_desc: ["Bring Bacon Sandwich into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.4B6D9AE6BE1844AD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bacon Sandwich"
	quest.4B804BC05BBA2E53.quest_desc: ["Using a Wrench, you can rotate almost any machine by right-clicking and pick up almost any pipe, fluid or not. You can shift-right-click on a machine to configure the output side. When you're holding the Wrench, you can hover over any face of the machine and you'll get a grid of sorts. Shift-rick-clicking on the middle square will set the output face to the side the grid is on. Doing so to the rectangles will place the output to the face 90 degrees relative to the corner elected to allow for configuration in hard to reach spaces. Finally the small squares in each corner will set the output to the opposite side of the grid. Remember, you cannot break the machine using the Wrench, it WILL destroy it and you will not get it back. Just use your trusty Pickaxe instead."]
	quest.4B804BC05BBA2E53.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wrench"
	quest.4B804BC05BBA2E53.title: "Wrench"
	quest.4B910D4EBC941ABC.quest_desc: ["We have a lot to cover. Cable networks have hard limitations on the amount of energy they will pull into the network depending on the tier. you can see a few stats below.. Max Transfer Rate: 256 EU/t. Material: Tin. Max Transfer Rate: 1024 EU/t. Material: Electrum. Max Transfer Rate: 8192 EU/t. Material: Aluminum. Max Transfer Rate: 65536 EU/t. Material: Annealed Copper. Now, the input and transfer rate is hard capped, but the discharge rate is infinite. This mean, for example, a LV cable network can provide more than 256 EU/t for a short amount of time. The larger the cable network, the larger the internal cable buffer. All this \"stored\" energy can be discharged almost instantaneously if given a place to go to. Do keep in mind that each tier of cable will only connect to it's respective tier electric machine. A LV cable will not connect to steam machines, MV machines, or HV machines. The method that each machine uses to process and use electricity is different depending on the strength of the power it receives. If you want to transfer more energy than the cable tier allows you to, you can either create multiple cable networks or use Transformers. Transformers allow you to step up or step down your power. This means, for example, you can take LV power and turn it into HV power and vice versa. As you'll see, an X to Y transformer will connect to Y cables on its output side and X cables on its 5 input sides. You can use your Wrench to configure which side the output is. Cables follow the same rules that fluid and item pipes follow. Using a Wrench on them will disconnect connections and shift right clicking will break them, this time losing the power in that specific section of cable network. P.S. Cables from Modern Industrialization, connected to any medium that accepts FE power, will 10x the power from EU to FE. There is an upgrade to this down the line, so look out for it!"]
	quest.4B910D4EBC941ABC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Tin Cable"
	quest.4B910D4EBC941ABC.title: "Energy Transfer"
	quest.4B9EC06C6CFC18CA.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Supremium Sword, Supremium Pickaxe, Supremium Shovel and 2 more items. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.4B9EC06C6CFC18CA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Supremium Sword, Supremium Pickaxe, Supremium Shovel and 2 more items"
	quest.4B9EC06C6CFC18CA.title: "Supremium Tools and Weaponry"
