	quest.4C66518F4C6B4965.title: "The Mace"
	quest.4C71BF1C683BE2DB.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Mahogany Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.4C71BF1C683BE2DB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mahogany Sapling"
	quest.4C7CF6CBFC0F0880.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.4C7CF6CBFC0F0880.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Compressing Factory"
	quest.4C7E231442DC94DF.quest_desc: ["The Color Applicator can be used to paint colorable blocks, which include cables, wool, terracotta, glass, concrete and anything else you can think of. Use Paintballs or Specific Dyes to paint and snowballs to clean off the paint. Use the Charger to charge the Applicator. The Color Applicator works like a Storage Cell, so to fill it, use the ME Chest. Right-Click to apply a color and Scroll-Wheel to change colors while holding shift. Test different upgrades to see if they can help your Color Applicator!"]
	quest.4C7E231442DC94DF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Color Applicator"
	quest.4C7E231442DC94DF.title: "Color Applicator"
	quest.4C873325175C838A.quest_desc: ["The Fusion Reactor is a complicated structure. In simple terms it requires at least 1, or 2, inputs for fuel, and 1 out for power. You may, also, add an output for heat that you can use elsewhere. It requires a laser matrix for the lasers to start the reaction. Aside from the casings, it, also, requires the controller on the top."]
	quest.4C873325175C838A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 61x Fusion Reactor Frame, 4x Fusion Reactor Port, Fusion Reactor Controller and 2 more items"
	quest.4C8786F3AC6EF5D7.quest_desc: ["Will make the storage pick up items within its range."]
	quest.4C8786F3AC6EF5D7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Magnet Upgrade"
	quest.4C927526150D82C2.quest_desc: ["Bring Storms Edge into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
