	quest.4D15BD9D0733647A.quest_desc: ["The Lightning Upgrade Orb is an upgrade material in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. Applied at the Arcane Anvil, it gives +5% Lightning Spell Power." "Craft it from 1 Empty Upgrade Orb and 8 Lightning Runes. Upgrade Orbs can be applied to compatible equipment to raise its magical power."]
