	quest.4D3C04FD055D64EB.quest_desc: ["To produce energy, the Solar Panel needs a matching tier Photovoltaic Cell in its inventory. By supplying Distilled Water to the Solar Panel, the Photovoltaic Cell in its slot will last 2x as long! Energy generation rates are determined by how high the sun is in the sky and if the sky is visible."]
