	quest.4DB6EC9635C51114.quest_desc: ["The Deepsilver Pickaxe is crafted from Deepsilver Ingots in Eternal Starlight." "It is an early to mid progression pickaxe for swamp and Nightfall regions, with durability between iron and diamond."]
	quest.4DB6EC9635C51114.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Deepsilver Pickaxe"
	quest.4DD06AEFB9CB1691.quest_desc: ["Craft the Knightmetal Shield from Knightmetal Ingots. It is built to withstand heavy hits and has excellent durability." "It is a dependable choice for exploring the most dangerous parts of the Twilight Forest."]
