	quest.4E76028E335C7AA1.quest_subtitle: "Get a piece of Phoenix Armor"
	quest.4E84C807543AFBA3.quest_desc: ["This substance can be processed in a Thermopneumatic Processing Plant to produce Kerosene or, by adding Redstone, Lubricant. It serves as a reasonable liquid fuel and can also be placed in a Furnace."]
