	quest.50AE358F27E83A76.quest_desc: ["Craft it from End Stone Bricks, an Ender Pearl, a bookshelf and Infused Dragon's Breath. To make the breath, infuse Dragon's Breath with at least 80 Eterna and 60% Arcana, keeping Quanta between 15% and 30%." "It gives +5 Eterna (up to 90), +5 Quanta and +5 Arcana."]
