	quest.50C73129350342EB.quest_desc: ["Twilight Gale is a crystalline Lightning spear in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks with 13 Attack Damage and 1.4 Attack Speed. It comes imbued with Volt Strike V." "You can throw it like a trident. Throwing does not use it up but puts it on a 10-second cooldown. It also accepts Sword enchantments, Loyalty and Channeling."]
