	quest.50D6DCE497E0FB14.quest_desc: ["The Amaramber Pickaxe was added in version 0.4.2 as part of the Amaramber set in Eternal Starlight." "It handles standard mining and is crafted from Amaramber materials from Torreya-related resources."]
	quest.50D6DCE497E0FB14.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Amaramber Pickaxe"
	quest.50F5BF288092DA4C.quest_desc: ["Blazebloom Goo turns Gold Blocks into Raw Blazegold. It is fed with Nether Warts or Blaze Powder."]
