	quest.50F91BB8CC3D567C.quest_desc: ["The Supercritical Phase Shapeshifter, or SPS, is a machine that allows you to make Anti-Matter with Polonium Gas. It is a very expensive machine as each casing requires about 50,000 mb of processed nuclear waste. The next step will give you a list of the cheapest machine that can be built."]
