	quest.526B004FC046694E.quest_desc: ["The Grimoire of Evokation is a unique Evocation spellbook that comes pre-inscribed with Fang Strike 6, Fang Ward 4 and Summon Vex 4. Equipped, it gives +10% Evocation Spell Power and +200 Max Mana." "It is a rare drop from Evokers and Archevokers."]
