	quest.527EB36537EAF0E1.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Ferricore Shovel. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.527EB36537EAF0E1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ferricore Shovel"
	quest.528055FF0AF18D4E.quest_desc: ["The Refinery is a multiblock in which you place the Refinery Controller on the bottom and Refineries on top of it, two to begin with. You can place up to 4 but this will not increase the speed of the Refinery, but allow it to produce other fluids from Crude Oil. With just the two Refineries on top of it you will start outputting Diesel and LPG , as you gather the resources, adding another Refinery will get you Kerosene and another, you will get Gasoline. To use the Refinery you will need heat, heat can be sourced from Torches around the machine for low efficiency, lava for mid efficiency, and produced heat from a Vortex Tube using pressure."]
	quest.528055FF0AF18D4E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Refinery, 4x Refinery Output and Liquid Hopper"
	quest.528055FF0AF18D4E.title: "Refinery"
	quest.528FA94494267B63.quest_desc: ["An Energy Cube is an advanced type of battery that is compatible with multiple energy systems. An upgraded version of the Basic Energy Cube."]
	quest.528FA94494267B63.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Energy Cube"
	quest.529CF4A2148025ED.quest_desc: ["Not every item needs to go wherever the network sends it. Restrictive and Diversion Transporters give you more control over how items move through your Logistical Transporter network. Restrictive Transporter. Acts as an overflow route. Items will only enter it when they have nowhere else to go, making it useful for handling excess items or directing unwanted materials to a backup destination. Diversion Transporter. Acts as a priority route. It encourages items to pass through it before normal transporter paths, making it useful for directing specific items toward a preferred destination. Use both together to build organized item networks that know where your resources should - and shouldn't - go."]
	quest.529CF4A2148025ED.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Restrictive Transporter and Diversion Transporter"
	quest.529CF4A2148025ED.title: "Transporters"
	quest.52B649A4C67B36B5.quest_desc: ["Achieved by enriching Obsidian in the Enrichment Chamber."]
	quest.52B649A4C67B36B5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dust Obsidian"
	quest.52CB38CAD6FC7C19.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Music Disc Ward. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.52CB38CAD6FC7C19.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Music Disc Ward"
	quest.52D99D07D61411D7.quest_desc: ["The ME Extended Drive an ME Drive with a larger cell inventory. It can hold 20 storage cells."]
	quest.52D99D07D61411D7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ex Drive"
	quest.52DD1E34E09CDDA6.quest_desc: ["A crafting component for the Rainbow Furnace and the Linker."]
	quest.52DD1E34E09CDDA6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rainbow Core"
	quest.52E14D8C193546FC.quest_desc: ["Expands the inventory of the barrel."]
	quest.52E14D8C193546FC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Diamond Barrel"
	quest.52E14D8C193546FC.title: "Diamond Barrel"
	quest.52E2B96B9F768E56.quest_desc: ["Waystones provide a way to travel between discovered destinations. Find and activate them as you explore to make future journeys easier."]
	quest.52E2B96B9F768E56.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.52E582A995B952D6.quest_desc: ["Found in the Bronze Dungeon. Time to challenge the Silver Dungeon."]
	quest.52E582A995B952D6.quest_subtitle: "Get the Valkyrie Lance"
	quest.52E73ABC3B31C9BD.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Nether Seeds. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.52E73ABC3B31C9BD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Nether Seeds"
	quest.52E87C7AF1EB20C6.quest_desc: ["Defeat 5 Urchinkin from Cataclysm, creatures that live in its oceans." "Take them out one by one."]
	quest.52E87C7AF1EB20C6.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Urchinkin"
	quest.52E87C7AF1EB20C6.title: "Urchinkin"
	quest.5303D7406990F417.quest_desc: ["Smelts 12 items."]
	quest.5303D7406990F417.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Inferium Coal"
	quest.530DC28051799876.quest_desc: ["A magical light that follows you."]
	quest.530DC28051799876.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Jar of Light"
	quest.5319081C2EC86C50.quest_desc: ["Ender Zoology adds new creatures and drops to encounter during exploration. Learn what each mob does before approaching unfamiliar threats."]
	quest.5319081C2EC86C50.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.531AA88962E0DDB5.quest_desc: ["Craft a Black Steel Hoe from Cataclysm. It is a durable tool and part of the Black Steel equipment set."]
	quest.531AA88962E0DDB5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Black Steel Hoe"
	quest.5320FC69E4A5A080.quest_desc: ["Chutes are more flexible than you might at first think. They can stack vertically, but also diagonally. A Wrench will place, or remove, windows in Chutes. Moves items up, using Encased Fans at either end to force air up. Move items down with.. nothing else. (thank you, gravity!)."]
	quest.5320FC69E4A5A080.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chute"
	quest.53263CE35A8A8B52.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Ender Cell Spirited. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.53263CE35A8A8B52.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ender Cell Spirited"
	quest.532AA97F7EA39DD6.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Energy Hopper Hardened. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.532AA97F7EA39DD6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Hopper Hardened"
	quest.53329AA1FCDDAEDB.quest_desc: ["You can have my Extendo Grip.."]
	quest.53329AA1FCDDAEDB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Extendo Grip"
	quest.5338A64F0DBEBCAD.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: Coke Oven."]
	quest.5338A64F0DBEBCAD.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Coke Oven"
	quest.533932E685A2E77A.quest_desc: ["Like the Tool Swapper Upgrade, with filtering options. It can also swap wrench-like tools for the block or entity you look at."]
	quest.533932E685A2E77A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Tool Swapper Upgrade"
	quest.533D9936392A7D45.quest_desc: ["This oven makes it possible to calcinate a variety of materials into Alchemical Salt. Place a Pyromantic Brazier below the Oven and fuel it with furnace fuel to provide heat. Fuels last twice as long as in a Furnace."]
	quest.533D9936392A7D45.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Calcination Oven and Pyromantic Brazier"
	quest.5353A2764C526C75.quest_desc: ["Increases the maximum speed of an electric recipe."]
	quest.5353A2764C526C75.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Upgrade"
	quest.5353A2764C526C75.title: "Machine Speedup"
	quest.5360FBB4DEBA2DFB.quest_desc: ["The Gem Cutting Table improves your Gems using Gem Dust and Rarity Materials."]
	quest.5360FBB4DEBA2DFB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gem Cutting Table"
	quest.5360FBB4DEBA2DFB.title: "Cut to Size"
	quest.5369221D98B15931.quest_desc: ["The first piece of the Ironwood armor set. Get the boots to unlock the chestplate and leggings."]
	quest.536C62938DD74583.quest_desc: ["Increases the experience dropped by creatures."]
	quest.536C62938DD74583.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Golden Hook"
	quest.5371AFA52B1522B8.quest_desc: ["Tier 2 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.5371AFA52B1522B8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Extract"
	quest.5388CE7578033C00.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Tertium Watering Can. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.5388CE7578033C00.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Tertium Watering Can"
	quest.538C72A1FA160C25.quest_desc: ["Craft a Cursium Chestplate from Cataclysm by upgrading a Netherite Chestplate with a Cursium Upgrade Smithing Template and a Cursium Ingot at a Smithing Table." "It belongs to the Cursium armor set and grants powerful abilities when worn."]
	quest.538C72A1FA160C25.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cursium Chestplate"
	quest.539337A980A33EB0.quest_desc: ["Bring Sweet Chestnut Sapling into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.539337A980A33EB0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sweet Chestnut Sapling"
	quest.53962F2FB02FF005.quest_desc: ["ME Crystal Fixer can repair budding certus block and turn it to the upgraded one. It needs Charged Certus Quartz Crystal and power to work. Right-click it with Charged Certus Quartz Crystal to input. However, it can't turn flawed into flawless. The max tier it can reach is flawed."]
	quest.53962F2FB02FF005.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Crystal Fixer"
	quest.539A534A7273297F.quest_desc: ["This device can be placed on any inventory. When heated by an adjacent heat source, it smelts items in the inventory, and when cooled it freezes them. Smelting only works if there is space for the result. It works faster with more heat, up to one item per second, and freezing speeds up with more cooling."]
	quest.539A534A7273297F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Heat Frame and Chest"
	quest.539E860FE450D437.quest_desc: ["A Dense Energy Cell stores more power than the standard cell. It is also a component for the Wireless Terminal."]
	quest.53A7C8397B068371.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Pomelo Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.53A7C8397B068371.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pomelo Sapling"
	quest.53BA9F2BA5C29302.quest_desc: ["This is a challenging and destructive mob, be prepared."]
	quest.53BA9F2BA5C29302.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wilden Tribute"
	quest.53C705C777BF4E64.quest_desc: ["This entity mines almost ten times as many resources as the Marid miner."]
	quest.53C705C777BF4E64.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Miner Ancient Eldritch"
	quest.53D5219AFA6C0D60.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Quantum Circuit. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.53D5219AFA6C0D60.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Quantum Circuit"
	quest.53DC59B99AF4985C.quest_desc: ["Fridges hold ingredients that your kitchen recipes can use."]
	quest.53DC59B99AF4985C.quest_subtitle: "Storage for your ingredients"
	quest.53E90A223D5B12C3.quest_desc: ["Bring Tear Popsicle into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.53E90A223D5B12C3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Tear Popsicle"
	quest.53EC902D03A8B035.quest_desc: ["The Beholder makes nearby mobs glow, and shoots lasers at your enemies."]
	quest.53EC902D03A8B035.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Familiar Beholder"
	quest.53F7C95E2F98E7FE.quest_desc: ["Any type of chest counts, not just oak. Expands the inventory of the chest."]
	quest.53F7C95E2F98E7FE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Iron Chest"
	quest.53F7C95E2F98E7FE.title: "Iron Chest"
	quest.53F85B1A9BC00739.quest_desc: ["Bring Player Transmitter Nitro into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.53F85B1A9BC00739.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Player Transmitter Nitro"
	quest.5408C3AD40037219.quest_desc: ["The Portal Gun creates portals you can travel through. Left-click makes a blue portal and right-click makes an orange one. It uses power."]
	quest.5408C3AD40037219.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Portalgun"
	quest.545436346CB1DFD6.quest_desc: ["A Middle Tier Storage Cell in normal AE2, which can contain 16,384 bytes of storage. 16,384 bytes of storage can hold 2,032 Stacks of a single item. or 1,040 Stacks,while holding 63 Different items."]
	quest.545436346CB1DFD6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Item Storage Cell 16k"
	quest.54560669033F5A82.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Harvester. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.54560669033F5A82.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Harvester"
	quest.546A1D6C611FD5B0.quest_desc: ["Used to create focus of necromancy and also provided a few benefits."]
	quest.546A1D6C611FD5B0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Summon Focus"
	quest.546A74F503A75C96.quest_desc: ["Bring Aechor Petal into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.546A74F503A75C96.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Aechor Petal"
	quest.54704F03A61485EA.quest_desc: ["DivineRPG is a large adventure and progression mod with new creatures, equipment, and worlds. Explore its content at your own pace and consult EMI for unfamiliar items."]
	quest.54704F03A61485EA.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.5470DC50F2FDF094.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Squid Seeds. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.5470DC50F2FDF094.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Squid Seeds"
	quest.5473549C9C867C22.quest_desc: ["The Decrepit Scythe is a strong weapon in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. In the main hand it gives 11 Attack Damage and 1.4 Attack Speed." "You can upgrade it into the Hellrazor with 1 Timeless Slurry and 1 Pyrium Ingot."]
	quest.5473549C9C867C22.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Decrepit Scythe"
	quest.5477AC52145920C7.quest_desc: ["Bring Dumplings into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.5477AC52145920C7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dumplings"
	quest.54828FDA9808FD99.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Plantain Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.54828FDA9808FD99.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Plantain Sapling"
	quest.5485831755DDF5D5.quest_desc: ["Bring Plum Sapling into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.5485831755DDF5D5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Plum Sapling"
	quest.548A154C22F9455E.quest_desc: ["Not just a craft component and decorative… can be slapped on Fluid Pipes, both to hold them in their orientation and prevent them from joining later adjacently placed pipes."]
	quest.548A154C22F9455E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Copper Casing"
	quest.548AB9735D138A10.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.548AB9735D138A10.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ultimate Injecting Factory"
	quest.548AE7B019E3AA7B.quest_desc: ["This machine calls for a whole 'nother level of strength. Time to put that new Titanium you've made to use. The Pressurizer allows you to pressurize Water into HP, or high pressure, water and Steam into HP Steam. It also works the other way around to depressurize the fluids. The Pressurizer also allows you to collect Liquid Air via the Air Intake, plus it's much more efficient than the Vacuum Freezer."]
	quest.548AE7B019E3AA7B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 9x Titanium Machine Casing Pipe, Pressurizer and 10x Solid Titanium Machine Casing"
	quest.548AE7B019E3AA7B.title: "Pressurizer"
	quest.548ECF7E7EA642C5.quest_desc: ["Bring Insanium Farmland into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.548ECF7E7EA642C5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Insanium Farmland"
	quest.548FAF1B465EEDD0.quest_desc: ["Bring Gold Seeds into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.548FAF1B465EEDD0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gold Seeds"
