	quest.54991AEF88B37ADD.title: "The R in RLC"
	quest.549A78E49047E439.quest_desc: ["Bring Configurable Honeycomb into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.549A78E49047E439.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.54A3C7842E902094.quest_desc: ["Make the Crystalite Chestplate with an Infusion Ritual using a Terminite Chestplate, an Amber Gem and Crystal Shards around an Infusion Pedestal." "Worn, it gives extra armor and permanent Haste I."]
	quest.54A3C7842E902094.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Crystalite Chestplate"
	quest.54A3C7842E902094.title: "Crystalite Chestplate"
	quest.54A63B9174BAF730.quest_desc: ["The Amulet of Teleportation grants Evasion for 3 seconds after you use a teleport spell." "It lets you use teleportation to dodge incoming attacks as well as to reposition."]
	quest.54A63B9174BAF730.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Teleportation Amulet"
	quest.54AD34481E98DBBF.quest_desc: ["Funnels are fairly flexible in placement: on the sides, top or bottom. The Brass Funnel is the upgraded version. Tip: when placed on a belt, hit a funnel with a Wrench to expand it to its full block width."]
	quest.54AD34481E98DBBF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Andesite Funnel"
	quest.54C4EDB7AA5A310E.quest_desc: ["Shadow-Walker Leggings are part of the Shadow-Walker Armor set in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. They give +6 Armor, +125 Max Mana, +10% Ender Spell Power and +5% Spell Power." "Craft them from 7 Arcane Cloth and 1 Ender Rune, or upgrade Wizard Leggings with 1 Ender Rune at a Smithing Table in supported versions. Runestones are used for stronger school-specific armor."]
	quest.54C4EDB7AA5A310E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Shadowwalker Leggings"
	quest.54D0D040DA21A329.quest_desc: ["Bring Sparkle Cherry Sapling into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.54D0D040DA21A329.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sparkle Cherry Sapling"
	quest.54D75D95A8447CE1.quest_desc: ["For both assembling your trains and, well, being train stations."]
	quest.54D75D95A8447CE1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Track Station"
	quest.54E617FB4EAF6D61.quest_desc: ["Use this to configure source relays and automation entities."]
	quest.54E617FB4EAF6D61.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dominion Wand"
	quest.54E97DF9649B0954.quest_desc: ["The Hoglin Trophy is a decorative block from My Nether's Delight. It works as a keepsake of your Nether adventures and your fights with its dangerous mobs."]
	quest.54E97DF9649B0954.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Hoglin Trophy"
	quest.54F40B7042EB8A98.quest_desc: ["Bring Old Fustic Sapling into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.54F40B7042EB8A98.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Old Fustic Sapling"
	quest.54FCC1E9A6303FAD.quest_desc: ["The Garden Cloche grows crops in a controlled setup. Open its screen and check EMI for the soils and plants it supports."]
	quest.54FCC1E9A6303FAD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cloche"
	quest.55018ADB9008498D.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Energy Hopper Spirited. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.55018ADB9008498D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Hopper Spirited"
	quest.550C1BAD098D97F8.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Workbench. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.550C1BAD098D97F8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Workbench"
	quest.551505F4EC862817.quest_desc: ["The Moonring Greatsword is a lunar-themed weapon that can be crafted in some versions or configurations of Eternal Starlight."]
	quest.551505F4EC862817.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Moonring Greatsword"
	quest.551505F4EC862817.title: "Moonring Greatsword"
	quest.551573CBF238C6EC.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Stars Edge. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.551573CBF238C6EC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Stars Edge"
	quest.552A7195A247DA5B.quest_desc: ["The Traveler's Wings are crafted from magical resources found in the Twilight Forest. They do not grant true flight, but let you glide over long distances, which makes exploring faster and safer." "They are handy for crossing ravines and cliffs and reaching places that are otherwise hard to get to."]
	quest.552A7195A247DA5B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Travellers Wings"
	quest.553A0826A531DECD.quest_desc: ["Ice and Fire adds formidable creatures, including dragons, along with related equipment and discoveries. Observe the dangers from a safe distance and prepare before engaging."]
	quest.553A0826A531DECD.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.553E642DBDD047ED.quest_desc: ["Bring Ghostly Mantle into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.553E642DBDD047ED.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ghostly Mantle"
