	quest.5862FD2BB97DBBEF.quest_desc: ["Bring Totem of Death Recall into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.5862FD2BB97DBBEF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Totem of Death Recall"
	quest.587BC74FBAD5C41D.quest_desc: ["Lithium dust can be created by putting gaseous Lithium in a chemical crystalliser. Lithium can be obtained by putting Brine into an Evaporation Plant."]
	quest.587BC74FBAD5C41D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dust Lithium"
	quest.587E8746261103A4.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Granny Smith Apple Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.587E8746261103A4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Granny Smith Apple Sapling"
	quest.5885BA8CA0DBFD3D.quest_desc: ["The Blazing Grips from Cataclysm are legendary gauntlets infused with the Nether's flames." "They let you unleash strong fiery attacks, and make a fitting trophy from the Nether."]
	quest.5885BA8CA0DBFD3D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blazing Grips"
	quest.589D884468EFC2E8.quest_desc: ["Bring Strider Slice into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.589D884468EFC2E8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Strider Slice"
	quest.589D9DE912C34D76.quest_desc: ["The Super Enchanting Template from Create: Enchantment Industry is made by pressing a Block of Super Experience with a Mechanical Press." "It is used for Super Enchanting to transfer or remove enchantments beyond normal limits, and must be processed in a Blaze Forger set to Super Enchanting mode."]
	quest.589D9DE912C34D76.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Super Enchanting Template"
	quest.58B2E6215EB69587.quest_desc: ["The Deepsilver Boots is crafted from Deepsilver Ingots in Eternal Starlight." "Deepsilver armor raises movement speed, attack speed and knockback resistance. The full set also grants immunity to several negative status effects."]
	quest.58B2E6215EB69587.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Deepsilver Boots"
	quest.58C45A8D5B5FE0CE.quest_desc: ["Transporter spirits, as one may expect, can transfer items between containers. That includes Dimensional Storage, and other spirits."]
	quest.58C45A8D5B5FE0CE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Book of Binding Bound Foliot, Minecart, Dispenser and Hopper. Earn the advancement: Summon Foliot Transport Items"
	quest.58C45A8D5B5FE0CE.title: "Ritual: Summon Foliot Transporter"
	quest.58D191083F0F5E27.quest_desc: ["The chestplate of the Imperium armor set. Together with the leggings, it unlocks the helmet."]
	quest.58DB0F8F3113AC3A.quest_desc: ["Bring Mold Plate, Mold Gear, Mold Rod and Mold Wire into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.58DB0F8F3113AC3A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mold Plate, Mold Gear, Mold Rod and Mold Wire"
	quest.58F3A6DAABAC505E.quest_desc: ["Use a Tome of Extraction on an enchanted item in an Anvil to move all its enchantments onto an Enchanted Book. Unlike the Scrapping tomes, the item is preserved."]
	quest.58F3A6DAABAC505E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Extraction Tome"
	quest.58F4FA7E46B1F9D2.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.58F4FA7E46B1F9D2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Bounce"
	quest.5905756CBF77C076.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Raw Osmium. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.5905756CBF77C076.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Raw Osmium"
