	quest.5925AD7C309A579B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.5925CDB7C3DED2F8.quest_desc: ["Bring Amethyst Rapier into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.5925CDB7C3DED2F8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Amethyst Rapier"
	quest.5928E1DE506333BE.quest_desc: ["Enter an End Portal to reach the End, a dimension of void and floating islands where the Ender Dragon lives." "It opens the way to Better End's new biomes and strong late-game gear."]
	quest.5928E1DE506333BE.quest_subtitle: "Travel to The End"
	quest.5928E1DE506333BE.title: "The End"
	quest.593D941609297E5A.quest_desc: ["Bring Orange Sapling into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.593D941609297E5A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Orange Sapling"
	quest.59408E596F262032.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for 8x Dielectric Rod and 8x Dielectric Rod Horizontal. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.59408E596F262032.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 8x Dielectric Rod and 8x Dielectric Rod Horizontal"
	quest.596104C336DED4D8.quest_desc: ["The Teleportation Core is a Crafting Component used in the crafting of the Portable Teleporter, the Teleporter and the Digital Miner."]
	quest.596104C336DED4D8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Teleportation Core"
	quest.596EE214DE2D3ADB.quest_desc: ["Blocks placed around the Apothic Enchanting Table can add bonuses. Candles raise Eterna, and Mob Heads and Skulls give different bonuses depending on the type, such as Quanta or Arcana. They work alongside your shelves without using up shelf slots."]
	quest.596EE214DE2D3ADB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.596EE214DE2D3ADB.title: "Enchanting Catalysts"
	quest.596FB815E5EE5183.quest_desc: ["Bring Tangerine Sapling into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.596FB815E5EE5183.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Tangerine Sapling"
	quest.59766A965BB25104.quest_desc: ["The Harbinger's Music Disc contains Self-Destruct Sequence, the theme of the fight against The Harbinger."]
	quest.59766A965BB25104.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Music Disc the Harbinger"
	quest.598BE22C08E7CEFC.quest_desc: ["Make the Resonarium Boots in a Mechanical Crafter using a Diamond Boots, Sturdy Sheets, a Resonarium Plate and a Resonarium Upgrade Template." "The template can be found in Ancient Cities, Trial Chambers and Strongholds."]
	quest.598BE22C08E7CEFC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Resonarium Boots"
	quest.599AEE2B5B814A71.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Deepslate Seeds. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.599AEE2B5B814A71.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Deepslate Seeds"
	quest.59A6A9C1DD04C53A.quest_desc: ["This machine drops Items into the world."]
	quest.59A6A9C1DD04C53A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Droppert1"
	quest.59A911D20AA336EA.quest_desc: ["Automates the furnace using items from the backpack."]
	quest.59A911D20AA336EA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Auto Smelting Upgrade"
	quest.59AB04527499B229.quest_desc: ["The chestplate of the Inferium armor set. Together with the leggings, it unlocks the helmet."]
