	quest.59C340E40A7FC0F7.quest_desc: ["Bring Creeper Seeds into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.59C340E40A7FC0F7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Creeper Seeds"
	quest.59CB785ED2B137B4.quest_desc: ["Pour the liquid into the world or chill it in an inventory with a Heat Frame to solidify it into Plastic Sheets. Using a Heat Frame may yield better results."]
