	quest.59D7A1F1F17B834D.quest_desc: ["The Twilight Lich is a major boss that lives in a large, corrupted tower full of undead magic. It commands skeletons and dark spells to defend its home." "The fight involves shields, magical projectiles and summoned minions, so come prepared."]
	quest.59D7A1F1F17B834D.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Lich"
