	quest.5B6C41D511701B5A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Flickering Sun Sapling"
	quest.5B6CDA27883802D1.quest_desc: ["The chestplate of the Neptunium armor set. Together with the leggings, it unlocks the helmet."]
	quest.5B6CFEC4F689FF3B.quest_desc: ["Defeating the Hydra drops Fiery Blood and Fiery Tears, two rare Twilight Forest materials." "Both are needed to craft powerful equipment, so they prepare you for the dangers deeper in the dimension."]
	quest.5B6CFEC4F689FF3B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fiery Blood and Fiery Tears"
	quest.5B6E54D22404B035.quest_desc: ["Multiplies the number of items that fit in each slot by 2."]
	quest.5B6E54D22404B035.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Stack Upgrade Tier 1"
	quest.5B760D87B0F7ACCF.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Prudentium Farmland. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.5B760D87B0F7ACCF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Prudentium Farmland"
	quest.5B8026F5E505444C.quest_desc: ["Bring Ray Bucket into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.5B8026F5E505444C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ray Bucket"
	quest.5B81420F5B4091BA.quest_desc: ["Resin and Amber bees can trap and encase mobs in amber. Encased mobs are immobile and can only be released when the amber is placed over a campfire. Soul campfires release them faster."]
	quest.5B81420F5B4091BA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Amber"
	quest.5B836FFF1D589FB8.quest_desc: ["Quartz Fiber separates power between connected ME networks while still allowing data to pass. It is also used in wireless components."]
	quest.5B8CD701C9465BD5.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Sandalwood Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.5B8CD701C9465BD5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sandalwood Sapling"
	quest.5B8F6BC51DC02E27.quest_desc: ["Generates source from nearby crop and tree growth."]
	quest.5B8F6BC51DC02E27.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Agronomic Sourcelink"
	quest.5B99B9F930012741.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Energetic Alloy Seeds. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.5B99B9F930012741.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energetic Alloy Seeds"
	quest.5BA0BE0EBBF0FEFA.quest_desc: ["The Underminer is a specialized mining tool from Eternal Starlight." "It is made for resource extraction and underground exploration."]
	quest.5BA0BE0EBBF0FEFA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Underminer"
	quest.5BA0BE0EBBF0FEFA.title: "Underminer"
	quest.5BA6B722B2CD05D4.quest_desc: ["Augment the ritual with an item to get a Wayfinder, which works like a compass. It points to the nearest structure from the ritual location and shows how far away it is." "Notable structures: Nether Fortress, Bastion, Ocean Monument, Ancient City, End City, Wilden Den and Arcane Library."]
	quest.5BA6B722B2CD05D4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ritual Locate Structure"
	quest.5BAB31083049E0D5.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Magmator Nitro. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.5BAB31083049E0D5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Magmator Nitro"
	quest.5BC08AC74035D855.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Catfish. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.5BC08AC74035D855.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Catfish"
	quest.5BC3092941F3CF3E.quest_desc: ["Place the Altar to see a in-world preview for the vessels and pedestal placements."]
	quest.5BC3092941F3CF3E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Awakening Altar"
	quest.5BC46158F3323CB4.quest_desc: ["This tablet is used to create daytime."]
	quest.5BC46158F3323CB4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ritual Sunrise"
	quest.5BD202341683BEAA.quest_desc: ["[ { \"text\": \"Open the NeoTech Reborn issue tracker\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"open_url\", \"value\": \"https://github.com/VaporeonScripts/NeoTech-Reborn/issues\" }, \"color\": \"aqua\" } ]"]
	quest.5BD202341683BEAA.quest_subtitle: "Found a bug or have an idea? Let the team know."
	quest.5BD202341683BEAA.title: "Report an Issue or Suggest an Idea"
	quest.5BDDED81AB054124.quest_desc: ["The Signet of the Betrayer gives +10% Eldritch Spell Power. Its passive has a 5-second cooldown and deals extra damage based on a creature's maximum mana, which makes it especially effective against strong spellcasters and mana-rich enemies."]
	quest.5BDDED81AB054124.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Betrayer Signet"
	quest.5BF1E219A0CCFB64.quest_desc: ["The Purpur Pedestal is a decorative pillar used to build the ring around an Eternal Portal." "It holds the Eternal Crystals that light the portal back to the Overworld."]
	quest.5BF1E219A0CCFB64.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 8x Purpur Pedestal"
	quest.5BF1E219A0CCFB64.title: "Purpur Pedestal"
	quest.5BFBBB1442CA38A3.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Clot of Time. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.5BFBBB1442CA38A3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Clot of Time"
	quest.5C0234DC4B2D451C.quest_desc: ["Source gems can be found in loot chests or created in a crystallizer. Source gems are required for many ars nouveau crafting recipes."]
	quest.5C0234DC4B2D451C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Source Gem"
	quest.5C05D1074390A539.quest_desc: ["Bring Eclipsealloy Boots into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.5C05D1074390A539.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Eclipsealloy Boots"
	quest.5C16B8E0C3AC4D6D.quest_desc: ["Expands the inventory and upgrade slots of the backpack."]
	quest.5C16B8E0C3AC4D6D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Diamond Backpack"
	quest.5C27BB16E2310B9F.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Fluid Cell Housing, Chemical Cell Housing and Item Cell Housing. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.5C27BB16E2310B9F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fluid Cell Housing, Chemical Cell Housing and Item Cell Housing"
	quest.5C27BB16E2310B9F.title: "ME Cell Housing"
	quest.5C294A87FDAD8206.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Disk Drive 1k. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.5C294A87FDAD8206.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Disk Drive 1k"
	quest.5C2CC9D34865D3EE.quest_desc: ["Bring Whirlisprig Shards into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.5C2CC9D34865D3EE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Whirlisprig Shards"
	quest.5C3F231ED47BDD97.quest_desc: ["Disables AI for mobs spawned by the spawner. Useful for efficient farms."]
	quest.5C3F231ED47BDD97.quest_subtitle: "Obtain No Ai Spawner Rune"
	quest.5C3F231ED47BDD97.title: "No AI Spawner Rune"
	quest.5C4798EE39DFB73A.quest_desc: ["Aquaculture 2 adds the Box, a container you can catch as fishing loot. Open it to see which valuable items it holds."]
	quest.5C4798EE39DFB73A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Box"
	quest.5C4E3F69BE5E7C86.quest_desc: ["The base item used to craft backpack upgrades."]
	quest.5C4E3F69BE5E7C86.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Upgrade Base"
	quest.5C4F3C3A59E0F533.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Ring of the Seven Deadly Sins. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.5C4F3C3A59E0F533.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ring of the Seven Deadly Sins"
	quest.5C50B14D94E8EFFC.quest_desc: ["A Flux Plug inserts energy into the network. It accepts energy from every side at the same time."]
	quest.5C50B14D94E8EFFC.quest_subtitle: "Feeds energy into the network"
	quest.5C60CB2E63AB79B6.quest_desc: ["The Skillet from Farmer's Delight is used to fry and prepare ingredients. It is handy for many dishes and makes cooking quicker and easier."]
	quest.5C60CB2E63AB79B6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Skillet"
	quest.5C744C31AC3CC5AB.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Pandanus Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.5C744C31AC3CC5AB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pandanus Sapling"
	quest.5C8327BEE271ED56.quest_desc: ["Bring Limited Netherite Barrel 4 into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.5C8327BEE271ED56.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Limited Netherite Barrel 4"
	quest.5C87FF98E1B122CF.quest_desc: ["The Malarite Hoe is an early-game farming tool in Eternal Starlight, crafted from Malarite found in swamp biomes." "It is used to create farmland."]
	quest.5C87FF98E1B122CF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Malarite Hoe"
	quest.5C92808D99179762.quest_desc: ["Bring Empty Pcb into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.5C92808D99179762.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Empty Pcb"
	quest.5C946809CA15F321.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Inferium Seeds. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.5C946809CA15F321.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Inferium Seeds"
	quest.5C9D71668407484E.quest_desc: ["Steam machines need, well, Steam! The way to get it is to make a Steam Boiler! The Steam Boiler will gradually consume almost any fuel you give it to heat up. When it's at a high enough temperature, it will begin to produce Steam so long as there is Water in its internal tank; if not, you'd be wasting fuel. Or you can put a Water Bucket into a Furnace to obtain a Steam Bucket. In this world is seems that fluid containers keep any fluid inside of them, having a persistent temperature and bound to the confined container; so don't worry about it condensing down into water or escaping. With Steam pre-boiler, you can make a Compressor to save on Bronze Plates. It might seem a bit expensive at this current moment, but remember that you can practically triple your ores using the Forge Hammer. Not to mention that in due time, when you have your first two machines, it will become more than twice less expensive than before! The Boiler will automatically begin to produce and send the Steam to adjacent machines or connected pipes, up to 8 millibuckets per tick. Bronze machines can only process recipes up to 2 energy unit per tick. You might see it as \"2 EU/t\" when using the machines. Once your Boiler is at maximum temperature, it can supply 4 machines with Steam simultaneously! Now that's hot."]
	quest.5C9D71668407484E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bronze Boiler"
	quest.5C9D71668407484E.title: "Bronze Boiler"
	quest.5C9FC7FFEF293D53.quest_desc: ["The Ancient Remnant is a huge dragon-like guardian sleeping beneath Cataclysm's Cursed Pyramid and one of the toughest desert bosses." "Use the Necklace of the Desert to wake it, and prepare well."]
	quest.5C9FC7FFEF293D53.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Ancient Remnant"
	quest.5C9FC7FFEF293D53.title: "Ancient Remnant"
	quest.5C9FD770397A56FE.quest_desc: ["Bring Invisibility Elixir into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.5C9FD770397A56FE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Invisibility Elixir"
	quest.5CAD9B88DEA90278.quest_desc: ["The Amethyst Crab Shell from Cataclysm is a rare trophy taken from the defeated Amethyst Crab."]
	quest.5CAD9B88DEA90278.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Amethyst Crab Shell"
	quest.5CBBFAE060ECF746.quest_desc: ["The Vacuum Pump is used to create a vaccum seal, used for the Vacuum Trap."]
	quest.5CBBFAE060ECF746.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Vacuum Pump"
	quest.5CC633D153C51191.quest_desc: ["Thirst Walkers wander the harsh regions of Eternal Starlight and are very aggressive when approached." "Their speed and relentless attacks can overwhelm unprepared players, so deal with them before exploring deeper."]
	quest.5CC633D153C51191.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Thirst Walker"
	quest.5CC633D153C51191.title: "Thirst Walker"
	quest.5CCA397599A0C34E.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Flaming Bracer. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.5CCA397599A0C34E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Flaming Bracer"
	quest.5CD0B044BD6C9011.quest_desc: ["Compacts items into their compressed versions. Works with 2x2 and 3x3 recipes."]
	quest.5CD0B044BD6C9011.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Compacting Upgrade"
	quest.5CDCAA4CC67FFFE0.quest_desc: ["Basic tools stop being enough as danger grows. Diamonds let you craft sturdier equipment that mines faster and fights better." "With them, gathering and defending become much easier."]
	quest.5CDCAA4CC67FFFE0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Diamond Pickaxe, Diamond Sword and Diamond Axe"
	quest.5CDCAA4CC67FFFE0.title: "Diamond Tools"
	quest.5CEE82CD02A980BF.quest_desc: ["The QIO Drive Array is the first step in creating Mekanism's mass storage. The storage is similar to AE2 and Refined Storage's system where you put drives in a drive bay to digitally hold items. The cool part about the QIO system though, is that it does not require power. It does require you to set a frequency, though."]
	quest.5CEE82CD02A980BF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Qio Drive Array"
	quest.5CFFCDBF3CE8BDBA.quest_desc: ["An upgraded Elite Control Circuit, used in many tier 4 machines and items."]
	quest.5CFFCDBF3CE8BDBA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ultimate Control Circuit"
	quest.5D043F46D43DBE4B.quest_desc: ["Not consumed when eaten."]
	quest.5D043F46D43DBE4B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Everlasting Beef"
	quest.5D1B2FB511D44AFD.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Honeycomb Powdery. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.5D1B2FB511D44AFD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Honeycomb Powdery"
	quest.5D22FAF561841E50.quest_desc: ["The chestplate of the Chainmail armor set. Together with the leggings, it unlocks the helmet."]
	quest.5D29B9D8AEE2D551.quest_desc: ["Create Crafts and Additions offers three connectors: the Small Connector, the Small Connector with Light and the Large Connector. Use them with spools to link machines and move Forge Energy around your factory." "The Small Connector supports up to four connections and the Large Connector up to eight. The lit version glows when powered."]
	quest.5D29B9D8AEE2D551.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Connector, Small Light Connector and Large Connector"
	quest.5D3B43FF72E5DBB5.quest_desc: ["Timeless Slurry is a strong crafting ingredient in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. Make it in the Alchemist Cauldron by processing a Mundane Potion with an Echo Shard." "It is required to upgrade the Decrepit Scythe into the Hellrazor and the Decrepit Flamberge into the Legionnaire Flamberge."]
	quest.5D3B43FF72E5DBB5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Timeless Slurry"
	quest.5D4103E73ABCB6B9.quest_desc: ["allows the player to fly, equippable in the chestplate slot. It uses Hydrogen gas as a fuel, of which it can store up to 24,000 mB."]
	quest.5D4103E73ABCB6B9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Jetpack"
	quest.5D5148CE0DED97BB.quest_desc: ["The scribe's table is used to craft glyphs and or a specific spell to parchment or items."]
	quest.5D5148CE0DED97BB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Scribes Table"
	quest.5D53B034F7A93D35.quest_desc: ["Bring Copper Chest into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.5D53B034F7A93D35.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Copper Chest"
	quest.5D61DE361F0F9FEA.quest_desc: ["Melee attacks have a chance to inflict Wither."]
	quest.5D61DE361F0F9FEA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Withered Bracelet"
	quest.5D6289D558C4A039.quest_desc: ["Bring Magma Cake Slice into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.5D6289D558C4A039.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Magma Cake Slice"
	quest.5D6836138CED402F.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Thread Drygmy. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.5D6836138CED402F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thread Drygmy"
	quest.5D74208E6F774487.quest_desc: ["Make the Warden Helmet in a Mechanical Crafter using a Netherite Helmet, Echo Ingots, Warden Carapace, a Reinforced Echo Shard and a Warden Upgrade Template." "Enchantments on the netherite piece are not kept, so enchant the result afterwards."]
	quest.5D74208E6F774487.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Warden Helmet"
	quest.5D766FE42709632F.quest_desc: ["Use the Terminite Anvil with a Smith Hammer to shape Terminite Ingots into Forged Plates and tool heads." "It unlocks Terminite's improved tools and armor."]
	quest.5D766FE42709632F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Terminite Anvil"
	quest.5D775DA4936B7AC2.quest_desc: ["These magical helpers harvest, collect, and grow amethyst for you."]
	quest.5D775DA4936B7AC2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Amethyst Golem Charm"
	quest.5D7CDDA1E072DCE6.quest_desc: ["Craft the Bone Reptile Helmet from Cataclysm using Ancient Metal Ingots, Koboleton Bones and a Kobolediator Skull." "It is a trophy for clearing the Cursed Pyramid."]
	quest.5D7CDDA1E072DCE6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bone Reptile Helmet"
	quest.5D91D93192325C15.quest_desc: ["Combine the Item Cell Housing and 1k Cell Component to make a 1k Item Storage Cell. Insert it into an ME Drive to store items on the network."]
	quest.5D9900CD4D01048A.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Superconductor Cable. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.5D9900CD4D01048A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Superconductor Cable"
	quest.5D9900CD4D01048A.title: "Unlimited Power (Transfer)"
	quest.5D9EDEBA88805F6D.quest_desc: ["Burning Ashes from Cataclysm are required to awaken Ignis in the Burning Arena." "Without them he stays dormant on his throne."]
	quest.5D9EDEBA88805F6D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Burning Ashes"
	quest.5DB8752414032D64.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Solar Panel Basic. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.5DB8752414032D64.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Solar Panel Basic"
	quest.5DC3E35E7523BC90.quest_desc: ["Like the Deposit Upgrade, with more filtering options."]
	quest.5DC3E35E7523BC90.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Deposit Upgrade"
	quest.5DC982042E0955E7.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Heat Exchanger. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.5DC982042E0955E7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Heat Exchanger"
	quest.5DCAC60D8B46EBA0.quest_desc: ["A blank Runestone can be infused with different types of magic. Runes are used to craft upgrades for your gear or better gear in general."]
	quest.5DCAC60D8B46EBA0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blank Rune"
	quest.5DE5BB7D23290BE7.quest_desc: ["It is found in the Aurora Palace. A hit covers the target in ice and inflicts Frosted III for 10 seconds."]
	quest.5DE5BB7D23290BE7.quest_subtitle: "Find the Ice Bow"
	quest.5DE5BB7D23290BE7.title: "The Ice Bow"
	quest.5DF5827AEDEBAEA6.quest_desc: ["The Ring of Invisibility is a joke curio in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. It does not make you invisible, since the ring itself is what is invisible."]
	quest.5DF5827AEDEBAEA6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Invisibility Ring"
	quest.5DF91C3757A70806.quest_desc: ["Upgrade a Terminite Helmet with an Aeternium Forged Plate at a Smithing Table to get the Aeternium Helmet." "It is Better End's top-tier armor and protects better than Netherite."]
	quest.5DF91C3757A70806.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Aeternium Helmet"
	quest.5E02C9683D1CA756.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Eclipsealloy Chestplate. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.5E02C9683D1CA756.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Eclipsealloy Chestplate"
	quest.5E0338759F8ED924.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.5E0338759F8ED924.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Enriching Factory"
	quest.5E0A66C2017FB163.quest_desc: ["Bring Sycamore Fig Sapling into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.5E0A66C2017FB163.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sycamore Fig Sapling"
	quest.5E0DCE90537C4595.quest_desc: ["The Oak Chest is a basic Sophisticated Storage container and works with the mod's upgrade system." "It makes a good base for a setup you can later expand with more capacity, automation and specialized upgrades."]
	quest.5E0DCE90537C4595.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chest"
	quest.5E0DF3631880979E.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Source Berry Pie. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.5E0DF3631880979E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Source Berry Pie"
	quest.5E4A7D592E592265.quest_desc: ["This machine converts Forge Energy (compatible with RF and many other mods’ energy) into compressed air. It operates with a base efficiency of 40%, meaning 100 FE generates 40 mL of compressed air. Using Speed Upgrades will slightly decrease this efficiency. Additionally, the Compressor produces heat, which needs to be managed to prevent a reduction in efficiency."]
	quest.5E4A7D592E592265.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Flux Compressor"
	quest.5E4BDB19F93334A1.quest_desc: ["You'll want this for wireless access to your ME System. You can also link some other items to your ME System other than just the Wireless Terminals, such as Building Gadgets."]
	quest.5E4BDB19F93334A1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wireless Access Point"
	quest.5E61271F6FF6C12B.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Reflective Necklace. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.5E61271F6FF6C12B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Reflective Necklace"
	quest.5E6531ACFF7B13EB.quest_desc: ["The Item Cell Housing combines with a storage component to make an item cell. Keep item storage cells distinct from fluid and spatial cells."]
	quest.5E67D21449700ED5.quest_desc: ["A Windmill needs 8 Sails to reach its maximum output."]
	quest.5E67D21449700ED5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Windmill Sail"
	quest.5E689B83C70042C1.quest_desc: ["This inscriber can run 4 jobs at the same time."]
	quest.5E689B83C70042C1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ex Inscriber"
	quest.5E6A6191BE1D38D0.quest_desc: ["The Limited Oak Barrel IV has even more capacity than the previous tiers while keeping the practical barrel design." "It is another step up as your storage system grows."]
	quest.5E6A6191BE1D38D0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Limited Barrel 4"
	quest.5E6E865CF683DF4D.quest_desc: ["Makes the backpack indestructible. It cannot despawn or fall into the void."]
	quest.5E6E865CF683DF4D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Everlasting Upgrade"
	quest.5E70E59A00E287D7.quest_desc: ["A spell turret can be used with a redstone signal to cast spells."]
	quest.5E70E59A00E287D7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Spell Turret"
	quest.5E7C31BAD6E59105.quest_desc: ["Total Uses: Unlimited!"]
	quest.5E7C31BAD6E59105.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Master Infusion Crystal"
	quest.5E80B669A8DF5773.quest_desc: ["Powah is a tech mod for generating, storing and transmitting energy. It adds several generators, from the classic coal Furnator to a self-building multiblock reactor." "All machines are tier-based. You start with Starter machines and upgrade them as you go: Starter, Basic, Hardened, Blazing, Niotic, Spirited and Nitro."]
	quest.5E80B669A8DF5773.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dielectric Paste"
	quest.5E817C2ED2304CD0.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Energizing Rod Blazing. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.5E817C2ED2304CD0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energizing Rod Blazing"
	quest.5E854D7F1348255B.quest_desc: ["Obtained by smelting Certus Quartz Dust, Silicon is used in 3 different processors you will need to proceed."]
	quest.5E854D7F1348255B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Silicon"
	quest.5E854D7F1348255B.title: "Silicon"
	quest.5EA9356560930826.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Strider Stew. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.5EA9356560930826.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Strider Stew"
	quest.5EAE572EA1BFCE46.quest_desc: ["Total Uses: 1,000."]
	quest.5EAE572EA1BFCE46.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Infusion Crystal"
	quest.5EB89B994640BB45.quest_desc: ["The Incubator is a small multiblock used to recombine Principles of matter into objects. It is composed of one of each vessel type placed on the sides - Salt, Sulfur, and Mercury - the Incubator itself, and a source of heat, in this case a Pyromantic Brazier, below."]
	quest.5EB89B994640BB45.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Incubator, Incubator Mercury Vessel, Incubator Sulfur Vessel and 2 more items"
	quest.5EBB6D61B6319A8A.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Piston Extension Pole. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.5EBB6D61B6319A8A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Piston Extension Pole"
	quest.5EC884935B631CDE.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Pollock. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.5EC884935B631CDE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pollock"
	quest.5ED01C913DDE8FCB.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.5ED01C913DDE8FCB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Delay"
	quest.5ED86ED76D2AB79D.quest_desc: ["The leggings of the Knightmetal armor set. Together with the chestplate, they unlock the helmet."]
	quest.5EED3766F9BFFB62.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Ender Gate Niotic. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.5EED3766F9BFFB62.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ender Gate Niotic"
	quest.5EEE5033B49668C3.quest_desc: ["The most unique machine in the pack. It copies an area and rewinds time in it, so you can place blocks, harvest them, rewind and harvest them again. The Guide Book is strongly recommended for this one."]
	quest.5EEE5033B49668C3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Paradoxmachine"
	quest.5F1A70A256C95E92.quest_desc: ["Rose Quartz is a crafting material in Create. Polish it with Sand Paper to get Polished Rose Quartz, which is used for Electron Tubes, Rose Quartz Lamps and decorative Rose Quartz blocks." "You can also automate the polishing with a Deployer holding Sand Paper."]
	quest.5F1A70A256C95E92.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rose Quartz"
	quest.5F1B37269D42EDF5.quest_desc: ["This miner spirit is second to none, able to get most ores. It will also occasionally yield a special item...."]
	quest.5F1B37269D42EDF5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Miner Marid Master"
	quest.5F21F743E5393EAA.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.5F21F743E5393EAA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Elite Combining Factory"
	quest.5F2AADF7E4E410A1.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Douglas Fir Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.5F2AADF7E4E410A1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Douglas Fir Sapling"
	quest.5F350D671122B35E.quest_desc: ["Bring Affinity Ring into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.5F350D671122B35E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Affinity Ring"
	quest.5F38264AC01FB036.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Blazegold Chestplate. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.5F38264AC01FB036.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blazegold Chestplate"
	quest.5F3CF8C042B1EA0F.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Blackthorn Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.5F3CF8C042B1EA0F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blackthorn Sapling"
	quest.5F3D089B84D1F005.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Egg Soup. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.5F3D089B84D1F005.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Egg Soup"
	quest.5F3D5CFDCAB77C5C.quest_desc: ["Demand-side drivers at the heart of the modern smart Create factory."]
	quest.5F3D5CFDCAB77C5C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Factory Gauge"
	quest.5F3EE79C401EB144.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Key Lime Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.5F3EE79C401EB144.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Key Lime Sapling"
	quest.5F4AB509F62FCC04.quest_desc: ["Upgrade an Infused Hellshelf with Blaze Powder and Fire Charges." "It gives +10 Eterna (up to 65) and +10 Quanta, but removes 1 Clue, so you see less of what you will get."]
	quest.5F4AB509F62FCC04.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blazing Hellshelf"
	quest.5F4CE2C211D3C196.quest_desc: ["Extended Pattern Provider holds quadruple the patterns compared to a regular. Extended Molecular Assembler does 8 crafting jobs at once at 2x the speed of a regular, totaling to a 16x increase in crafting speed."]
	quest.5F4CE2C211D3C196.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ex Pattern Provider and Ex Molecular Assembler"
	quest.5F5503976BB2D2E1.quest_desc: ["This Emitter uses Mercury Flux to generate heat that can be used in place of the Pyromantic Brazier."]
	quest.5F5503976BB2D2E1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Caloric Flux Emitter"
	quest.5F6125EF968FC2B1.quest_desc: ["Bring Honey Cookie into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.5F6125EF968FC2B1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Honey Cookie"
	quest.5F6D2504DB8572FD.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Slimy Delight Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.5F6D2504DB8572FD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Slimy Delight Sapling"
	quest.5F8A91444A82D83D.quest_desc: ["The Sink provides water for recipes, and it also works as an endless water source."]
	quest.5F8A91444A82D83D.quest_subtitle: "Water for recipes"
	quest.5FA03F32B08B10A8.quest_desc: ["An Isotopic Centrifuge is yet another machine that turns one fluid into another. This time, by pumping in Uranium HexaFluoride, you get Fissile Fuel."]
	quest.5FA03F32B08B10A8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Isotopic Centrifuge"
	quest.5FA04FD81B534CB4.quest_desc: ["The leggings of the Obsidian armor set. Together with the chestplate, they unlock the helmet."]
	quest.5FA0C345999713B1.quest_desc: ["Adds a furnace to the storage."]
	quest.5FA0C345999713B1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smelting Upgrade"
	quest.5FAD05D83FC3CA5A.quest_desc: ["Ender Pearls are not consumed but cost hunger instead, and they deal no damage."]
	quest.5FAD05D83FC3CA5A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Warp Drive"
	quest.5FB1EAE6C4CFACE6.quest_desc: ["The QIO Dashboard is your main interface with the QIO System. You just need to set the frequency and you're good to go."]
	quest.5FB1EAE6C4CFACE6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Qio Dashboard"
	quest.5FB42611559F0E41.quest_desc: ["With a Quantum Bridge Card you can access your ME System from anywhere in the world. You'll need to setup a Quantum Ring with an Entangled Singularity and another in your Wireless Terminal after placing the Quantum Bridge Card in the terminal. Make sure the Quantum Ring is chunk loaded or else it will not work."]
	quest.5FB42611559F0E41.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Quantum Bridge Card"
	quest.5FB5927BAEE09C89.quest_desc: ["Use the Thallasium Anvil with a Smith Hammer to turn Thallasium Ingots into Forged Plates and tool heads." "It is the first crafting station in Better End's equipment progression."]
	quest.5FB5927BAEE09C89.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thallasium Anvil"
	quest.5FD345FA75B8AE3F.quest_desc: ["The Cursium Upgrade Smithing Template from Cataclysm is used at a Smithing Table." "With Cursium Ingots, it upgrades Netherite equipment into Cursium equipment."]
	quest.5FD345FA75B8AE3F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cursium Upgrade Smithing Template"
	quest.5FD811D4BCBB4E6E.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Configurable Honeycomb. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.5FD811D4BCBB4E6E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.5FD928205FF68580.quest_desc: ["This Rod is pre-attuned to find a Common material."]
	quest.5FD928205FF68580.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sulfur Attuned Divination Rod Common"
	quest.5FDD0DEDD188DC2A.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Blue Mahoe Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.5FDD0DEDD188DC2A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blue Mahoe Sapling"
	quest.5FE73F232130E6A6.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Configurable Honeycomb. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.5FE73F232130E6A6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.5FE7580EFCAA5541.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Persimmon Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.5FE7580EFCAA5541.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Persimmon Sapling"
	quest.5FE974C5F1ED3A4E.quest_desc: ["Make the Resonarium Chestplate in a Mechanical Crafter using a Diamond Chestplate, Sturdy Sheets, a Resonarium Plate and a Resonarium Upgrade Template." "The template can be found in Ancient Cities, Trial Chambers and Strongholds."]
	quest.5FE974C5F1ED3A4E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Resonarium Chestplate"
	quest.5FF1D816C65069DE.quest_desc: ["The Thermal Springstone Hoe is crafted from Thermal Springstone Ingots in Eternal Starlight." "It prepares farmland in geothermal regions and belongs to the mid-tier set."]
	quest.5FF1D816C65069DE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thermal Springstone Hoe"
	quest.5FFB3B0D15EAF602.quest_desc: ["Bring Black Ember Sapling into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.5FFB3B0D15EAF602.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Black Ember Sapling"
	quest.5FFC4F9FA66E9BAA.quest_desc: ["A fishing line that can be dyed like leather armor."]
	quest.5FFC4F9FA66E9BAA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fishing Line"
	quest.5FFEE28730576AC9.quest_desc: ["The Plate Upgrade Smithing Template turns a Forged Plate into a finished piece of Better End armor at a Smithing Table." "Every Thallasium, Terminite and Aeternium armor piece needs it."]
	quest.5FFEE28730576AC9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Plate Upgrade Smithing Template"
	quest.600E2ACA57353D2A.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Configurable Honeycomb. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.600E2ACA57353D2A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.6011352BFD9D24D5.quest_desc: ["The Aluminum Drill allows you to drill for Crude Oil. It'll find pockets of oil in the ground and automatically pump it up through the drill and to the surface."]
	quest.6011352BFD9D24D5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 4x Aluminum Drill"
	quest.6011352BFD9D24D5.title: "Aluminum Drill"
	quest.6021868566F8DB3F.quest_desc: ["The Electromancer Hat is the headpiece of the Electromancer Armor set in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. It gives +3 Armor, +125 Max Mana, +10% Lightning Spell Power and +5% Spell Power." "Craft it from 5 Arcane Cloth and 1 Lightning Rune, or upgrade a Wizard Helmet with 1 Lightning Rune at a Smithing Table in supported versions."]
	quest.6021868566F8DB3F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Electromancer Helmet"
	quest.60219D7184AA733B.quest_desc: ["Bring Upgrade Netherite into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.60219D7184AA733B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Upgrade Netherite"
	quest.60246E7D64B41228.quest_desc: ["The Malarite Shovel is an early-game digging tool in Eternal Starlight, crafted from Malarite found in swamp biomes." "It is used for excavation and clearing terrain."]
	quest.60246E7D64B41228.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Malarite Shovel"
	quest.6026BE73E182679F.quest_desc: ["Bring Satsuma Sapling into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6026BE73E182679F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Satsuma Sapling"
	quest.60283FE9E80266CC.quest_desc: ["Craft Terminite Boots from Terminite Plating at a Smithing Table." "They complete the Terminite set and are the base for Better End's higher-tier armors."]
	quest.60283FE9E80266CC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Terminite Boots"
	quest.602DABCF31E4CDF8.quest_desc: ["Obtain an Analog Lever from Create. Unlike a normal lever, it can output any Redstone signal strength from 0 to 15." "Right-click to raise the strength and sneak-right-click to lower it. Wearing Engineer's Goggles shows the current strength."]
	quest.602DABCF31E4CDF8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Analog Lever"
	quest.60368BCBBFEC07E5.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Kapok Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.60368BCBBFEC07E5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Kapok Sapling"
	quest.603A53222BA33D67.quest_desc: ["Used to cast tier 3 glyphs or lower."]
	quest.603A53222BA33D67.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Archmage Spell Book"
	quest.604330BFCBF3E6E5.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Mithril Ingot. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.604330BFCBF3E6E5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mithril Ingot"
	quest.604DE6C9DB5D3375.quest_desc: ["The Fluid Gauge from Create: Dreams n' Desires monitors fluid systems, which makes large fluid setups easier to manage. The latest 2.3a-BETA update also improved its display to show boiler statistics."]
	quest.604DE6C9DB5D3375.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fluid Gauge"
	quest.60509B38B16DE593.quest_desc: ["Inserters and Extractors move items into and out of containers from the Mercurial Logistics network, respectively."]
	quest.60509B38B16DE593.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Logistics Item Inserter and Logistics Item Extractor"
	quest.60509B38B16DE593.title: "Mercurial Item Manipulation"
	quest.605831AAA7204025.quest_desc: ["The Steel Drill gives you the rest of the more commonly used ores that you'll need for further progression in your journey to total automation, but also in your journey of the world itself. Check your EMI for all the possible outputs."]
	quest.605831AAA7204025.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 4x Steel Drill"
	quest.605831AAA7204025.title: "Steel Drill"
	quest.6059837BAEAFF55B.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.6059837BAEAFF55B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Purifying Factory"
	quest.60615A1924DA628E.quest_desc: ["The Ruined Book is an Epic item found in the sculk-filled Ancient Cities. It is a key crafting component for powerful spellbooks." "Searching the ruins is the way to get one."]
	quest.60615A1924DA628E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ruined Book"
	quest.6076DF388C346FA1.quest_desc: ["Used to create spells that can be placed on the ground to affect those walking over it."]
	quest.6076DF388C346FA1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Runic Chalk"
	quest.6080BB6D642F98D6.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Solar Wafer. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6080BB6D642F98D6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Solar Wafer"
	quest.608A2E3B5C762AD7.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.608A2E3B5C762AD7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Elite Enriching Factory"
	quest.60900CE57A1160C3.quest_desc: ["Obtain a Copper Valve Handle from Create. It is a hand-powered source of rotation that gives precise control over angle and direction." "Each use turns it 45° by default, and this angle can be configured. It produces 32 RPM and 256 SU."]
	quest.60900CE57A1160C3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Copper Valve Handle"
	quest.609DB7F8B0684C8A.quest_desc: ["The Ink comes in different rarities and you will need higher tier Ink for the higher tier scrolls."]
	quest.609DB7F8B0684C8A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.609DB7F8B0684C8A.title: "Ink"
	quest.60ADB70BA2114BD3.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Rainbow Trout. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.60ADB70BA2114BD3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rainbow Trout"
	quest.60B8E8055DEBAC2A.quest_desc: ["Can be (dis)charged using a Charging Station. It's essential for crafting most pneumatically chargeable items and can also be used to charge other items. The amount of power generated depends heavily on the speed of the wind (obviously), and the speed of the wind increases the higher in the world the Wind Generator is placed."]
	quest.60B8E8055DEBAC2A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gps Tool and Air Canister"
	quest.60BC50AD613C919D.quest_desc: ["Bring Bramblethorn into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.60BC50AD613C919D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bramblethorn"
	quest.60C4E393073232E5.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Whirlisprig Petals. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.60C4E393073232E5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Whirlisprig Petals"
	quest.60CB5D832D9891C5.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Golden Delicious Apple Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.60CB5D832D9891C5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Golden Delicious Apple Sapling"
	quest.60CCE0548A624AC1.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.60CCE0548A624AC1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Launch"
	quest.60D3ACF2FD523282.quest_desc: ["Bring Nutritional Liquifier into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.60D3ACF2FD523282.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Nutritional Liquifier"
	quest.60DF8D3D225B1EC6.quest_desc: ["Bring Quantum Upgrade into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.60DF8D3D225B1EC6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Quantum Upgrade"
	quest.60DF8D3D225B1EC6.title: "Time Dilation"
	quest.60E221AB4714CED9.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Tinkering Table. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.60E221AB4714CED9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Tinkering Table"
	quest.60E4B5A700DD6DB5.quest_desc: ["Makes the wearer briefly immune to fire damage after being hurt by fire."]
	quest.60E4B5A700DD6DB5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Obsidian Skull"
	quest.60E6D85182577BD3.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Energizing Rod Nitro. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.60E6D85182577BD3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energizing Rod Nitro"
	quest.60F9DAC7A6182643.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Configurable Honeycomb. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.60F9DAC7A6182643.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.61017859BD7731C2.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Inferium Gemstone. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.61017859BD7731C2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Inferium Gemstone"
	quest.61059F7A62620351.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Ferricore Axe. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.61059F7A62620351.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ferricore Axe"
	quest.6107790F6E5B8CB0.quest_desc: ["Bring Decaying Relic into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6107790F6E5B8CB0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Decaying Relic"
	quest.610CA03AB78E0470.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Soulrender. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.610CA03AB78E0470.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Soulrender"
	quest.610F8B72053EB9C0.quest_desc: ["Removes light-level restrictions from the spawner, so you don't need a pitch-black room."]
	quest.610F8B72053EB9C0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ignore Light Spawner Rune"
	quest.610F8B72053EB9C0.title: "Ignore Light Spawner Rune"
	quest.6114372D527B5903.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: Read Lore."]
	quest.6114372D527B5903.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Read Lore"
	quest.611FF57AA7803C4A.quest_desc: ["A Neptunium Ingot is a rare material from Aquaculture 2 fishing treasures. It is used to craft Neptunium tools, armor and advanced fishing items."]
	quest.611FF57AA7803C4A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Neptunium Ingot"
	quest.61206C8A863A5203.quest_desc: ["The QIO Redstone Adapter monitors contents from the QIO System. It activates based on different filters you set."]
	quest.61206C8A863A5203.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Qio Redstone Adapter"
	quest.6125C73CE0DA081B.quest_desc: ["The machine frame of Powah, used in most machine recipes."]
	quest.6125C73CE0DA081B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dielectric Casing"
	quest.6139FDEF401AFF5B.quest_desc: ["The Terminite Sword Handle is a component for assembling a Terminite Sword at the Smithing Table." "Like other Better End handles, it is combined with a matching tool head."]
	quest.6139FDEF401AFF5B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Terminite Sword Handle"
	quest.616C40032A91B84D.quest_desc: ["This Machine can collect Fluids from the world, It's also highly configurable!"]
	quest.616C40032A91B84D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fluidcollectort1"
	quest.61713E2E40B328BD.quest_desc: ["Guardians of order in an unpredicatble world of Chains, Belts, and Boxes."]
	quest.61713E2E40B328BD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Repackager"
	quest.617193F8D9F5578D.quest_desc: ["The Deepsilver Sickle is crafted from Deepsilver Ingots in Eternal Starlight." "It gathers plants and vegetation efficiently in swamp and Nightfall regions."]
	quest.617193F8D9F5578D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Deepsilver Sickle"
	quest.61736104E96470BD.quest_desc: ["Polonium is created by putting Nuclear Waste in a Solar Neutron Activator. Then, you put the polonium into a Pressurized Reaction Chamber with water and fluorite dust."]
	quest.61736104E96470BD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pellet Polonium"
	quest.61743EF197A17A12.quest_desc: ["The Scroll Forge crafts scrolls from Paper and Ink. Different focus items give different kinds of scrolls, and higher-tier ink unlocks rarer and more powerful scrolls."]
	quest.61743EF197A17A12.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Scroll Forge"
	quest.61766197A58086E4.quest_desc: ["Get hold of 4x Prosperity Shard. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.61766197A58086E4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 4x Prosperity Shard"
	quest.61766197A58086E4.title: "Prosperity Shard"
	quest.6190C58F236DC745.quest_desc: ["The Thallasium Shovel is a digging tool forged from Thallasium Ingots, handy for excavating and clearing terrain." "It rounds out the basic Thallasium tool set."]
	quest.6190C58F236DC745.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thallasium Shovel"
	quest.619CC2A5B57E2148.quest_desc: ["Bring Steam Mining Drill into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.619CC2A5B57E2148.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Steam Mining Drill"
	quest.619CC2A5B57E2148.title: "Getting That 3x3 Going"
	quest.619E60387DC202AD.quest_desc: ["Defeat Cryomancer."]
	quest.619E60387DC202AD.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Cryomancer"
	quest.619E60387DC202AD.title: "Cryomancer"
	quest.61AEF81C114513BB.quest_desc: ["Bring Quantum Sword into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.61AEF81C114513BB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Quantum Sword"
	quest.61AEF81C114513BB.title: "Annihilation Operator"
	quest.61BC4DC8D08E44FE.quest_desc: ["The Overdrive Module will prevent the efficiency of an electric machine from going down, but force the machine to use full power all the time, even if it isn't processing anything. The effiency will reset if the recipe the machine is processing changes."]
	quest.61BC4DC8D08E44FE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Overdrive Module"
	quest.61BDFE874D356920.quest_desc: ["The Simple Reforging Table replaces an item's Affixes with a new random combination. It is a cheaper alternative to the full Reforging Table."]
	quest.61BDFE874D356920.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Simple Reforging Table"
	quest.61BDFE874D356920.title: "Simple Reforging"
	quest.61E515AF1B72B1FA.quest_desc: ["It's hover and SHIFT info says it all: \"Unidirectional powered rail with variable speed controlled by the signal strength supplied to it.\"."]
	quest.61E515AF1B72B1FA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Controller Rail"
	quest.61E727F68F8EA832.quest_desc: ["The Concurrent Press is used inside the Inscriber to craft the Concurrent Processor."]
	quest.61E727F68F8EA832.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Concurrent Processor Press"
	quest.61EA178AF98220E7.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Mv Diesel Generator. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.61EA178AF98220E7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mv Diesel Generator"
	quest.61EA178AF98220E7.title: "Fast and Furious"
	quest.61EFF94B2CBDACCF.quest_desc: ["To rotate blocks, right-click them. To toggle the corresponding side of a Pressure Tube between open and closed, right-click the tube."]
	quest.61EFF94B2CBDACCF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pneumatic Wrench"
	quest.61F3771F024D83E7.quest_desc: ["Like the Feeding Upgrade, with more control over when you get fed."]
	quest.61F3771F024D83E7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Feeding Upgrade"
	quest.620784E4A0FFDA66.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Kelp Roll. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.620784E4A0FFDA66.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Kelp Roll"
	quest.620AC078F80866B3.quest_desc: ["This special Simply Swords item turns into a random unique weapon after being kept in your inventory."]
	quest.620AC078F80866B3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Tampered Remnant"
	quest.623F27E9DA2E2993.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Prudentium Gemstone. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.623F27E9DA2E2993.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Prudentium Gemstone"
	quest.624035E8E15B72C2.quest_desc: ["Tier 2 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.624035E8E15B72C2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Cold Snap"
	quest.62439CE494A41F1C.quest_desc: ["The leggings of the Supremium armor set. Together with the chestplate, they unlock the helmet."]
	quest.62495CE3803F2B21.quest_desc: ["A Treasure Chest is fishing loot from Aquaculture 2. Catch one while fishing, then open it to claim the valuable items inside."]
	quest.62495CE3803F2B21.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Treasure Chest"
	quest.625FBA4D1405E41A.quest_desc: ["Quark adds many smaller features across building, exploration, items, and quality of life. Check its in-game descriptions and config-enabled features to discover what is active in this pack."]
	quest.625FBA4D1405E41A.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.625FF6B855DA850D.quest_desc: ["Machine Hulls contain the main electronics to allow machines to run. There are different tiers to machine hulls, each allowing you to upgrade your machines. The Basic Machine Hull is the base of every machine that takes LV power. If you want your machine to accept MV power, you must upgrade it using an Advanced Machine Hull. You can do this by right clicking the machine with the upgraded hull in your hand or by placing it in the top right slot of the machine's GUI that seems to have a small isometric cube depiction. You can do the same with higher tier hulls as they will allow for higher tier power sources."]
	quest.625FF6B855DA850D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Machine Hull"
	quest.625FF6B855DA850D.title: "Machine Hulls"
	quest.6265515BFE6B5CC2.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Cell Component 4m. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.6265515BFE6B5CC2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cell Component 4m"
	quest.626D147109725807.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Limited Netherite Barrel 1. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.626D147109725807.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Limited Netherite Barrel 1"
	quest.6274CAF76FF7FAFB.quest_desc: ["Find a Jungle Fortress, the Repurposed Structures version of a Nether Fortress."]
	quest.6274CAF76FF7FAFB.quest_subtitle: "Enter a Jungle Fortress"
	quest.627926A7677D452B.quest_desc: ["The Coral Spear is a powerful Cataclysm melee weapon that Deepling enemies can drop." "Defeat Deeplings to get this rare ocean weapon."]
	quest.627926A7677D452B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Coral Spear"
	quest.6292351BF8CBF481.quest_desc: ["The Thallasium Sword is Better End's entry-level sword, assembled from a Thallasium tool head and sword handle at a Smithing Table." "It begins the mod's weapon progression."]
	quest.6292351BF8CBF481.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thallasium Sword"
	quest.629387962F410B01.quest_desc: ["The Glacite Shield is crafted from Glacite materials in Eternal Starlight." "It is more durable than the vanilla shield and helps you survive in cold biomes where frost effects are common."]
	quest.629387962F410B01.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glacite Shield"
	quest.62A978B0A256B155.quest_desc: ["Poisonous Potatoes are used to craft Nature Scrolls."]
	quest.62A978B0A256B155.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Poisonous Potato"
	quest.62BD7379CE46897A.quest_desc: ["The Shadow-Walker Mask is the headpiece of the Shadow-Walker Armor set in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. It gives +3 Armor, +125 Max Mana, +10% Ender Spell Power and +5% Spell Power." "Craft it from 5 Arcane Cloth and 1 Ender Rune, or upgrade a Wizard Helmet with 1 Ender Rune and 1 Arcane Essence in supported versions."]
	quest.62BD7379CE46897A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Shadowwalker Helmet"
	quest.62CDE865C4D7CB2F.quest_desc: ["Applies a potion effect to the surrounding mobs, players included."]
	quest.62CDE865C4D7CB2F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Potion Diffuser"
	quest.62E86F002AD0EDD5.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Diesel Chainsaw. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.62E86F002AD0EDD5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Diesel Chainsaw"
	quest.62E86F002AD0EDD5.title: "The Texas Chain Saw Massacre"
	quest.62EEDBF406A37C3A.quest_desc: ["Wandering Magician Pants are part of the basic Wandering Magician Armor set in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. They give +5 Armor and +25 Max Mana." "Craft them from Leather Pants and Arcane Essence. They are a good early piece for extra mana with solid protection."]
	quest.62EEDBF406A37C3A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wandering Magician Leggings"
	quest.62F0AC5E95D09D6F.quest_desc: ["The Aeternium Axe is a top-tier woodcutting and combat tool made from Aeternium, which is stronger than Netherite." "It sits at the top of Better End's tool progression."]
	quest.62F0AC5E95D09D6F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Aeternium Axe"
	quest.63018989221AC000.quest_desc: ["Simply a must have for the fast factory."]
	quest.63018989221AC000.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rotation Speed Controller"
	quest.63048F22F1981561.quest_desc: ["Bring Crafting Unit into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.63048F22F1981561.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Crafting Unit"
	quest.63068E939646FE7A.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Prairie Crabapple Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.63068E939646FE7A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Prairie Crabapple Sapling"
	quest.630C7784CE9C7EAA.quest_desc: ["Use a Freezer together with Icestone on an accessory."]
	quest.630C7784CE9C7EAA.quest_subtitle: "Freeze an accessory"
	quest.6311E7A0ED0B034B.quest_desc: ["Craft it from Cracked Deepslate Tiles and books. Alone it is weak, giving only +2 Eterna (up to 30)." "Its real use is to be awakened: infuse it in the enchanting table with at least 60 Eterna, 40% Quanta and 40% Arcana to make a Deepshelf."]
	quest.6311E7A0ED0B034B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dormant Deepshelf"
	quest.632B8206B3F33C7C.quest_desc: ["Variants to find: Birch, Dark Forest, Giant Tree Taiga, Mangrove, Oak and Taiga."]
	quest.632B8206B3F33C7C.quest_subtitle: "Find all 6 Witch Hut variants"
	quest.632BD42D55D3EA8E.quest_desc: ["Bring Frostward Ring and Ice Staff into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.632BD42D55D3EA8E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Frostward Ring and Ice Staff"
	quest.632D1610BEBF4E27.quest_desc: ["The Ring of Grudged is a rare Cataclysm ring found in chests inside the Abandoned Temple structure." "When equipped, it grants +10% Critical Damage."]
	quest.632D1610BEBF4E27.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ring of Grudged"
	quest.632D1610BEBF4E27.title: "Ring Of Grudged"
	quest.6332C7EE9A88D842.quest_desc: ["This Machine can place Blocks in the world, It's highly configurable."]
	quest.6332C7EE9A88D842.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blockplacert1"
	quest.6337A88D3784E1FA.quest_desc: ["Used to bring an illager raid when used within a village."]
	quest.6337A88D3784E1FA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ritual Challenge"
	quest.634D71B683337622.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Firefly. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.634D71B683337622.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Firefly"
	quest.6351CC7A32F8CD13.quest_desc: ["The quests in this chapter only show a suggested progression. You can complete them in any order."]
	quest.6351CC7A32F8CD13.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Enter Aether"
	quest.635D2EAFF7FA5E7E.quest_desc: ["To craft Redstone Crystal throw 1 Block of Redstone, 1 Glowstone Dust, and 1 Fluix Crystal into water and watch the magic happen."]
	quest.635D2EAFF7FA5E7E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Redstone Crystal"
	quest.6381EB59F371696B.quest_desc: ["Several types of Salt exist, each used to create different resources in the end. Some Salts can be calcinated again into other kinds."]
	quest.6381EB59F371696B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Alchemical Salt Strata, Alchemical Salt Mineral, Alchemical Salt Plant and Alchemical Salt Creature"
	quest.6381EB59F371696B.title: "Alchemical Salts"
	quest.63860999421539AC.quest_desc: ["The Survival Infinity Upgrade lets you mark items in your storage as infinite. You can withdraw them without the stored amount going down." "It suits late-game players who want their key resources to never run out."]
	quest.63860999421539AC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Survival Infinity Upgrade"
	quest.6386B9D6B0829708.quest_desc: ["A pre-programmed Drone that performs logistics tasks within a 31x31x31 area centered on the position it is deployed from."]
	quest.6386B9D6B0829708.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Logistics Drone"
	quest.639BE4FC6AF750B4.quest_desc: ["Bring Capacitor into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.639BE4FC6AF750B4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Capacitor"
	quest.639BE4FC6AF750B4.title: "The C in RLC"
	quest.63BBBD09FE89D89D.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Pink Ipe Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.63BBBD09FE89D89D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pink Ipe Sapling"
	quest.63C3CA53448C57EC.quest_desc: ["A Bucket of Seed Oil holds the fluid from Create Crafts and Additions that you get by processing seeds. It can fuel compatible Create machinery, which gives common seeds a new use."]
	quest.63C3CA53448C57EC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Seed Oil Bucket"
	quest.63CB2C4A3B28C05D.quest_desc: ["The Matter Cannon uses Matter Balls and different Metal Nuggets to deal damage by shooting them at opponents. It can be charged in the Charger and refilled in an ME Chest, just as you would a Storage Drive. Test out upgrades to see if any can make your Matter Cannon better!"]
	quest.63CB2C4A3B28C05D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Matter Cannon"
	quest.63CB2C4A3B28C05D.title: "Matter Cannon"
	quest.63E4BEB3B88F6540.quest_desc: ["Thermodynamic Conductors are a way of transporting heat. Insulation: 400."]
	quest.63E4BEB3B88F6540.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Thermodynamic Conductor"
	quest.63EA98542E0BD49C.quest_desc: ["Carminite is a magical material found in the Dark Tower. It powers many of the tower's machines and mechanical creatures." "It is a rare resource needed to craft advanced devices and equipment unique to the Twilight Forest."]
	quest.63EA98542E0BD49C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Carminite"
	quest.63F5C2E3B748FFAA.quest_desc: ["Ancient structures in Eternal Starlight hide Starlight Golems." "They are hard to find, so use the Seeking Eye together with the correct off-hand item."]
	quest.63F5C2E3B748FFAA.title: "Golem Forge"
	quest.640052AE59DB4B84.quest_desc: ["This is the last CPU you'll ever need, it handles all the crafting jobs you throw at it. The more Quantum Computer Storage blocks you have in the structure, the more crafting jobs it can handle at once."]
	quest.640052AE59DB4B84.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Quantum Core, Data Entangler, Quantum Multi Threader and 3 more items"
	quest.64076EB04BF0AC2B.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Burnt Roll. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.64076EB04BF0AC2B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Burnt Roll"
	quest.64082A47876182EF.quest_desc: ["The Archevoker Coat is the chestpiece of the Archevoker Armor set in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. It gives +8 Armor, +125 Max Mana, +10% Evocation Spell Power and +5% Spell Power, and can hold 1 imbued spell." "Craft it from 8 Arcane Cloth and 1 Evocation Rune, or upgrade Wizard Robes with 1 Evocation Rune at a Smithing Table."]
	quest.64082A47876182EF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Archevoker Chestplate"
	quest.640A6C22B23AF91D.quest_desc: ["Extends the invincibility time after taking damage."]
	quest.640A6C22B23AF91D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cross Necklace"
	quest.641933EA19F2BB50.quest_desc: ["The Ice Upgrade Orb is an upgrade material in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. Applied at the Arcane Anvil, it gives +5% Ice Spell Power." "Craft it from 1 Empty Upgrade Orb and 8 Ice Runes."]
	quest.641933EA19F2BB50.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ice Upgrade Orb"
	quest.6419797CDC6482E2.quest_desc: ["Bring Configurable Honeycomb into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6419797CDC6482E2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.642644B33DEC6D7E.quest_desc: ["Bring Coal Seeds into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.642644B33DEC6D7E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Coal Seeds"
	quest.642CC869E844C762.quest_desc: ["Generates source by consuming burnables."]
	quest.642CC869E844C762.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Volcanic Sourcelink"
	quest.6430F9D2F201DA49.quest_desc: ["Tier 2 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.6430F9D2F201DA49.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Slowfall"
	quest.6445C75E5366698D.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Lapis Lazuli Seeds. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6445C75E5366698D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Lapis Lazuli Seeds"
	quest.644D11CAA593EB55.quest_desc: ["Make a Pumpkin Milkshake for a seasonal twist on your drink production. Combine pumpkin with the other ingredients to get this rich, creamy treat from Create: Dreams n' Desires."]
	quest.644D11CAA593EB55.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pumpkin Milkshake"
	quest.6461D4F6C50DEA4C.quest_desc: ["Swaps blocks and entities between paired Swappers, so you can transport blocks between worlds."]
	quest.6461D4F6C50DEA4C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blockswappert1"
	quest.646C854E999B52D2.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Limited Diamond Barrel 3. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.646C854E999B52D2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Limited Diamond Barrel 3"
	quest.6472989111B260A5.quest_desc: ["Motors take electricity and produce a rotational force. You'll use motors to create many of the machines and other components in the future. You should automate these."]
	quest.6472989111B260A5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Motor"
	quest.6472989111B260A5.title: "Motors"
	quest.64730C62AE083D95.quest_desc: ["Speeds up the growth of baby bees. Put the BaBee in a cage and insert it with some honey treats."]
	quest.64730C62AE083D95.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Incubator"
	quest.648457225C137DDD.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Magiscythe. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.648457225C137DDD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Magiscythe"
	quest.64876E4A94758E1C.quest_desc: ["Bring power, a controller, a terminal, a drive with a storage cell, and cable together to form a working ME network. Use the network as a foundation for the branches that follow."]
	quest.64876E4A94758E1C.title: "Build Your First ME Network"
	quest.64A6A68085FAFF36.quest_desc: ["Flexible, non-conductive, and strong. Rubber will be a major part of every electric machine. You can produce it by mixing Paper with either Synthetic Oil or Synthetic Rubber. Mix the Coke Dust you made with Water in a Mixer to produce Raw Synthetic Oil. Use a Steam Blast Furnace to produce these two fluids. Synthetic Rubber is more difficult to obtain, but will yield more rubber per sheet of paper. Remember that you'll need a lot of Rubber Sheets in the long run, so you'll need to make them constantly. Note that you can use Wood to grind down and turn into Wood Pulp which can then be turned into Paper with a high output yield."]
	quest.64A6A68085FAFF36.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rubber Sheet"
	quest.64A6A68085FAFF36.title: "Rubber"
	quest.64A6E404227AA12A.quest_desc: ["QIO Drives hold the items in a QIO System. They work similar to AE2 drives where it has a maximum amount of space and types it can hold."]
	quest.64A6E404227AA12A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Qio Drive Base"
	quest.64A8A849A96982CF.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Knightmetal Helmet, Knightmetal Chestplate, Knightmetal Leggings and Knightmetal Boots. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.64A8A849A96982CF.quest_subtitle: "Craft a full set of Knightmetal Armor"
	quest.64A8A849A96982CF.title: "Knightmetal Armorer"
	quest.64AEB967047B14B1.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Wenge Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.64AEB967047B14B1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wenge Sapling"
	quest.64B15654C8144611.quest_desc: ["Enriched Tin is used in the Metallurgic Infuser. Enriched Tin yields 80 units of tin in the Metallurgic Infuser, the same as 8 Tin Dust."]
	quest.64B15654C8144611.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Enriched Tin"
	quest.64C0EB318F14295F.quest_desc: ["The Advanced Fluid Tank can hold up to 28000mB of fluids which is double the amount of the Basic Fluid Tank. It can double as a bucket by switching its mode to bucket mode."]
	quest.64C0EB318F14295F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Fluid Tank"
	quest.64D31A0D53E19DE6.quest_desc: ["Deepsilver is a basic metal in Eternal Starlight that you can smelt into ingots." "It is used for tools, armor and several utility recipes. Formerly called Swamp Silver, it now generates in underground areas."]
	quest.64D31A0D53E19DE6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Deepsilver Ingot"
	quest.64D31A0D53E19DE6.title: "Deepsilver Ingot"
	quest.64EA511602416211.quest_desc: ["The Starfall Longbow is a ranged weapon from Eternal Starlight." "On hit it calls down stars that strike the target after a short delay, adding burst damage to one target or a small area."]
	quest.64EA511602416211.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Starfall Longbow"
	quest.64F322D0A5CD3973.quest_desc: ["The Golden Mixer is a kinetic machine from Create: Dreams n' Desires, crafted with a Golden Whisk. It is a specialized mixer that adds new processing options to your factory."]
	quest.64F322D0A5CD3973.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gold Mixer"
	quest.64F465D465EBF4FB.quest_desc: ["Bring Sheep Seeds into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.64F465D465EBF4FB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sheep Seeds"
	quest.64F82315C1528711.quest_desc: ["The Hellshelf of Sight adds +1 Clue, so the enchanting table shows more of your enchantments before you pay." "Craft it from Infused Hellshelves, an Eye of Ender, a Spyglass, Gold Blocks and a potion."]
	quest.64F82315C1528711.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sightshelf"
	quest.650AE6855EB4D7B6.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Armadillo Seeds. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.650AE6855EB4D7B6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Armadillo Seeds"
	quest.652564CDB1B4370B.quest_desc: ["The Belt of Beginner from Cataclysm is a simple belt that adds two Curio slots for Skulls." "It lets you equip relics such as the Unbreakable Skull."]
	quest.652564CDB1B4370B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Belt of Beginner"
	quest.652D5A92A02A8CAD.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Spawn Egg Configurable Bee. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.652D5A92A02A8CAD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Spawn Egg Configurable Bee"
	quest.652DFD0F7CBF6A51.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Configurable Honeycomb. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.652DFD0F7CBF6A51.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.654939AB7E016432.quest_desc: ["Hover Just Dire Things upgrades in EMI and hold shift for descriptions."]
	quest.654939AB7E016432.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.655C0FBF1FB00D89.quest_desc: ["Bring Cell Component 16m into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.655C0FBF1FB00D89.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cell Component 16m"
	quest.65642C5D4CCA838C.quest_desc: ["Tier 2 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.65642C5D4CCA838C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Invisibility"
	quest.656B2EB771061568.quest_desc: ["The Inverse Gearshift from Create: Dreams n' Desires reverses the direction of rotation in your mechanical setups. It allows more flexible and compact factory designs."]
	quest.656B2EB771061568.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Inverse Gearshift"
	quest.656BC7FB6923D7F9.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Limited Gold Barrel 3. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.656BC7FB6923D7F9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Limited Gold Barrel 3"
	quest.6576DB1AB024F726.quest_desc: ["Bring Configurable Honeycomb into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6576DB1AB024F726.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.657A2F7D9D62CAB9.quest_desc: ["Bring Configurable Honeycomb into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.657A2F7D9D62CAB9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.659859FDDFB43D6A.quest_desc: ["Drive them with a Threshold Switch on a Vault to get a progress bar showing how full it is."]
	quest.659859FDDFB43D6A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Nixie Tube"
	quest.659A5309A77BDDFD.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Graphite Seeds. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.659A5309A77BDDFD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Graphite Seeds"
	quest.65A3F4F22D836189.quest_desc: ["Craft an Enchanting Table to improve your tools, weapons and armor with magic. Enchantments boost effectiveness and durability, and can add special abilities." "It is worth having before tougher fights."]
	quest.65A3F4F22D836189.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Enchanting Table"
	quest.65A3F4F22D836189.title: "Enchanting Table"
	quest.65A949B3F6F8049E.quest_desc: ["Bring Programmable Controller into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.65A949B3F6F8049E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Programmable Controller"
	quest.65B8D316605D1A0B.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Blue Tenderloin Steak. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.65B8D316605D1A0B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blue Tenderloin Steak"
	quest.65C34D7FD093D83F.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Copper Barrel. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.65C34D7FD093D83F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Copper Barrel"
	quest.65CCF4B3E7A9F67D.quest_desc: ["Upgrades a Gold tier or below to a Diamond tier."]
	quest.65CCF4B3E7A9F67D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic to Diamond Tier Upgrade, Copper to Diamond Tier Upgrade, Iron to Diamond Tier Upgrade and Gold to Diamond Tier Upgrade"
	quest.65CCF4B3E7A9F67D.title: "Diamond Tier Upgrade"
	quest.65CDA8AFE4EC9F0D.quest_desc: ["Tier 2 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.65CDA8AFE4EC9F0D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Fell"
	quest.65F921DCB4A7FCE7.quest_desc: ["Simple redstone control for reversing rotational motion. Very handy when your build needs one."]
	quest.65F921DCB4A7FCE7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gearshift"
	quest.65FA4A7FE399C79D.quest_desc: ["The Advanced Bin is a storage block which can hold 8192 of a single item. It will retain its inventory when broken."]
	quest.65FA4A7FE399C79D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Bin"
	quest.6603D5F5FF9A7108.quest_desc: ["The leggings of the Inferium armor set. Together with the chestplate, they unlock the helmet."]
	quest.6608848EC38ED912.quest_desc: ["A Coral Chunk is dropped by Coralssus in Cataclysm. It is used to craft items tied to the mod's ocean content."]
	quest.6608848EC38ED912.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Coral Chunk"
	quest.66116025A09661C2.quest_desc: ["The Geode-Encased Bookshelf of Stability gives Quantic Stability, so Quanta can only make your enchantments stronger, never weaker." "Craft it from Calcite, a bookshelf and Budding Amethyst. Get the Budding Amethyst by infusing an Amethyst Block with at least 60 Eterna, 50% Arcana and between 30% and 50% Quanta."]
	quest.66116025A09661C2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Geode Shelf"
	quest.6618C74E0BA18AEA.quest_desc: ["Bring Tempest into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6618C74E0BA18AEA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Tempest"
	quest.662D3632D4E28C1C.quest_desc: ["The main block of the mod's storage system. Right-click it with Bookwyrm Charms to summon Bookwyrms, and each one raises the number of storages you can bind. Use the Dominion Wand to bind a storage to the Lectern. It needs no source."]
	quest.662D3632D4E28C1C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Storage Lectern"
	quest.663B52B7C99A8858.quest_desc: ["Bio Fuel can be used for numerous things. We are after substrate."]
	quest.663B52B7C99A8858.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bio Fuel"
	quest.663E618B3E57F6F6.quest_desc: ["Bring Imperium Sword, Imperium Pickaxe, Imperium Shovel and 2 more items into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.663E618B3E57F6F6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Imperium Sword, Imperium Pickaxe, Imperium Shovel and 2 more items"
	quest.663E618B3E57F6F6.title: "Imperium Tools and Weaponry"
	quest.665DFCA333D7FB39.quest_desc: ["The Gatling Breaker from Create: Dreams n' Desires is an advanced tool made for rapid block breaking. Its continuous mechanical force speeds up large-scale excavation and automated mining."]
	quest.665DFCA333D7FB39.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gatling Breaker"
	quest.6669FF5BE3276035.quest_desc: ["The Mechanical Grindstone from Create: Enchantment Industry brings the vanilla Grindstone into your factory. It automatically processes items, removes enchantments and extracts experience, and also offers a sanding function for compatible recipes." "Connect it to Create's rotational power to automate grinding."]
	quest.6669FF5BE3276035.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mechanical Grindstone"
	quest.666D6DE84597DA56.quest_desc: ["The chestplate of the Nano armor set. Together with the leggings, it unlocks the helmet."]
	quest.667AEEA648FABA79.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Ender Bow. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.667AEEA648FABA79.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ender Bow"
	quest.66954C678B1B21A1.quest_desc: ["EMI may not show this recipe because of a bug. In a Smithing Table, combine a Celestigem Pickaxe, Axe and Shovel, in that order."]
	quest.66954C678B1B21A1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Celestigem Paxel"
	quest.6699ADB734C1C57B.quest_desc: ["A Thermopneumatic Processing Plant is used to convert liquids into other liquids. For example, combining LPG and Coal in this machine can produce Liquid Plastic. Additionally, the TPP can perform fuel cracking, where heavier fuels are transformed into lighter ones. This means: Diesel -> Kerosene. Kerosene -> Gasoline. Gasoline -> LPG."]
	quest.6699ADB734C1C57B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thermopneumatic Processing Plant"
	quest.66A3143D5384E27D.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Glow Berry Custard. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.66A3143D5384E27D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glow Berry Custard"
	quest.66B27D8FA9533AE2.quest_desc: ["Tier 3 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.66B27D8FA9533AE2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Summon Decoy"
	quest.66B52DD6E837486C.quest_desc: ["For packing and unpacking packages."]
	quest.66B52DD6E837486C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Packager"
	quest.66BCA7F7CE25650E.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Brazil Nut Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.66BCA7F7CE25650E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Brazil Nut Sapling"
	quest.66BE62BECF412B02.quest_desc: ["Smelts quickly while using fuel sparingly."]
	quest.66BE62BECF412B02.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Obsidian Furnace"
	quest.66C2B02E47C7B363.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Energy Discharger Niotic. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.66C2B02E47C7B363.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Discharger Niotic"
	quest.66CDD772F62C21B0.quest_desc: ["This Bank has 81 slots and can hold close to unlimited items."]
	quest.66CDD772F62C21B0.quest_subtitle: "The top Bank tier"
	quest.66E1C3E8377C64C0.quest_desc: ["Bare wires shock anyone who touches them, so keep your distance or insulate them. This coil carries up to 8192 FE/t, and anything above that needs HV wire."]
	quest.66E1C3E8377C64C0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wirecoil Electrum"
	quest.66F41E7315D542E5.quest_desc: ["Crafted by the Metallurgic Infuser this is the basis from which Steel Dust can be attained by reprocessing it in the Metallurgic Infuser."]
	quest.66F41E7315D542E5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Enriched Iron"
	quest.66F68463A18E35ED.quest_desc: ["Bring Chocolate Pie into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.66F68463A18E35ED.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chocolate Pie"
	quest.66FE015C521E3067.quest_desc: ["Bring Upgrade Iron into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.66FE015C521E3067.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Upgrade Iron"
	quest.6708332772DCBEE4.quest_desc: ["Bring Crushing Wheel into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6708332772DCBEE4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Crushing Wheel"
	quest.67090FA3629FFCB9.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Aerial Pearl. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.67090FA3629FFCB9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Aerial Pearl"
	quest.67324038300F58ED.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Plate of Striderloaf. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.67324038300F58ED.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Plate of Striderloaf"
	quest.673448ADEC2A5A85.quest_desc: ["You'll finally be able to construct a Nuclear Reactor that uses different types of Fluid and Fuel Rods to produce various gaseous fuels, Steam in massive quantities, and radioactive materials. The Nuclear Reactor is not for the faint of heart. You'll need to keep watch on the gauges for thermal and neutron interaction when constructing one of four different sized reactors."]
	quest.673448ADEC2A5A85.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Nuclear Reactor, 27x Nuclear Alloy Machine Casing Pipe and 77x Nuclear Casing"
	quest.673448ADEC2A5A85.title: "Nuclear Reactor"
	quest.673526545A09C2CC.quest_desc: ["This device separates incoming air into hot and cold components, with one side becoming hot and the other cold. The amount of air used depends on the pressure. For optimal efficiency, be aware that there is a minor thermal connection between the hot and cold sides. To make the most of the heat, vent the cold side with a Heat Sink, and do the opposite if you want to maximize the cold."]
	quest.673526545A09C2CC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Vortex Tube"
	quest.675291ECEC4EAE0B.quest_desc: ["Find a city in the Nether."]
	quest.675291ECEC4EAE0B.quest_subtitle: "Enter a Nether City"
	quest.675CBEB4D18573CD.quest_desc: ["Obtain a Pulse Extender from Create. It lengthens a Redstone pulse by a configurable time so short signals can control machines and automation." "The duration ranges from 2 ticks to 60 minutes. It can also be inverted to stay powered by default and give a temporary shutdown pulse."]
	quest.675CBEB4D18573CD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pulse Extender"
	quest.67643B27D0426FFE.quest_desc: ["The Personal Chest gives you a private storage space that stays with you wherever you go. Unlike a normal chest, its contents can be accessed from any Personal Chest linked to you, making it perfect for keeping frequently used items close at hand. Use it as your personal stash for tools, building materials, or anything else you don't want cluttering your inventory."]
	quest.67643B27D0426FFE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Personal Chest"
	quest.67671BD4A0BC0AAA.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Spawn Egg Configurable Bee. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.67671BD4A0BC0AAA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Spawn Egg Configurable Bee"
	quest.676FA58F3C47E4BF.quest_desc: ["Collect various gadgets and try them out. They can make your adventures and challenges easier."]
	quest.676FA58F3C47E4BF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.676FA58F3C47E4BF.title: "Gadgets"
	quest.678BC8459EA2CB5E.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for White Willow Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.678BC8459EA2CB5E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain White Willow Sapling"
	quest.67901E9D344FFB3B.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.67901E9D344FFB3B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Sawing Factory"
	quest.67994560ECCA0934.quest_desc: ["The Alloy Kiln makes alloys such as Invar and Electrum. Click the progress arrow in its screen to browse the recipes."]
	quest.67994560ECCA0934.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 8x Alloybrick"
	quest.67994560ECCA0934.title: "Alloy Kiln"
	quest.679B5A8C6D2FF3E7.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Nickel Seeds. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.679B5A8C6D2FF3E7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Nickel Seeds"
	quest.67AA14CCD8A98355.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Dark Steel Seeds. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.67AA14CCD8A98355.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dark Steel Seeds"
	quest.67CDDDAC88A5EB7F.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Pressure Gauge. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.67CDDDAC88A5EB7F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pressure Gauge"
	quest.67CDDDAC88A5EB7F.title: "Pressure Gauge"
	quest.67EC9F15C26823FD.quest_desc: ["Upgrade a Terminite Chestplate with an Aeternium Forged Plate at a Smithing Table to craft the Aeternium Chestplate." "It belongs to Better End's strongest armor set, tougher than any vanilla armor."]
	quest.67EC9F15C26823FD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Aeternium Chestplate"
	quest.67EE4FAD164E2E9A.quest_desc: ["QIO Drives hold the items in a QIO System. They work similar to AE2 drives where it has a maximum amount of space and types it can hold."]
	quest.67EE4FAD164E2E9A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Qio Drive Supermassive"
	quest.67F2AFD711612AB1.quest_desc: ["Defeat a Sculk Snapper to get Soul Dust."]
	quest.67F2AFD711612AB1.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Sculk Snapper"
	quest.67F2AFD711612AB1.title: "Sculk Snapper"
	quest.67F7FAB96737DCE9.quest_desc: ["Found in the Silver Dungeon. The final dungeon awaits."]
	quest.67F7FAB96737DCE9.quest_subtitle: "Get a Regeneration Stone"
	quest.680EFE1327029DE7.quest_desc: ["Obtain a Sticker from Create. It temporarily attaches blocks to moving Contraptions." "With a Redstone signal it extends and attaches to the block in front of it, so that block moves with the contraption. It suits small, selective attachments where Super Glue would be too much."]
	quest.680EFE1327029DE7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sticker"
	quest.68128312E6B71D7A.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Bow Ferricore. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.68128312E6B71D7A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bow Ferricore"
	quest.6818A20457B9CE1F.quest_desc: ["Bring Spiked Cloak into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6818A20457B9CE1F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Spiked Cloak"
	quest.682BDA5E5C0D67EE.quest_desc: ["These are a cool way of lighting up your base. They can be placed on almost any surface and have the same range as a torch."]
	quest.682BDA5E5C0D67EE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain White Glow Panel"
	quest.68383D89E14C4816.quest_desc: ["Defeat Pyromancer."]
	quest.68383D89E14C4816.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Pyromancer"
	quest.6842A82A93D9E0AF.quest_desc: ["Craft Cursium Leggings from Cataclysm by upgrading Netherite Leggings with a Cursium Upgrade Smithing Template and a Cursium Ingot at a Smithing Table." "They belong to the Cursium armor set and grant Ethereal Form, which gives a chance to dodge incoming attacks."]
	quest.6842A82A93D9E0AF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cursium Leggings"
	quest.6872683F564A1953.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Imperium Essence. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.6872683F564A1953.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Imperium Essence"
	quest.6879835A5EB411D3.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.6879835A5EB411D3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Sawing Factory"
	quest.687C152255B2F039.quest_desc: ["The first piece of the Iron armor set. Get the boots to unlock the chestplate and leggings."]
	quest.68987C39EB057268.quest_desc: ["Bring Configurable Honeycomb into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.68987C39EB057268.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.6898A9BD0F6445DF.quest_desc: ["The Elevator uses pressure to move you between floors with a Controller. One Elevator Base lets you go up 6 blocks, and stacking more bases adds 6 blocks each. Adding the same number of bases beside the first widens the elevator." "Place a Controller at eye level, beside the shaft, at every floor you want to use."]
	quest.6898A9BD0F6445DF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 4x Elevator Base, 2x Elevator Caller and 16x Elevator Frame"
	quest.6898A9BD0F6445DF.title: "Elevator"
	quest.68997D3C0D3537F7.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Soulium Spawner. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.68997D3C0D3537F7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Soulium Spawner"
	quest.68B24C676649A14D.quest_desc: ["The Crescent Spear is a melee weapon from Eternal Starlight, linked to advanced progression and lunar-themed materials."]
	quest.68B24C676649A14D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Crescent Spear"
	quest.68B24C676649A14D.title: "Crescent Spear"
	quest.68B4FDA866C82343.quest_desc: ["Bring Barbecue Stick into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.68B4FDA866C82343.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Barbecue Stick"
	quest.68BE861624099976.quest_desc: ["Allows a double jump."]
	quest.68BE861624099976.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cloud in a Bottle"
	quest.68C5BB6BE173F681.quest_desc: ["Bring Item Drain into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.68C5BB6BE173F681.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Item Drain"
	quest.68C6F3B563E6F104.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Pink Ivory Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.68C6F3B563E6F104.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pink Ivory Sapling"
	quest.68F0D22512AFF15B.quest_desc: ["Raw Mithril is a Rare crafting material in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. It drops from Mithril Ore and Deepslate Mithril Ore." "Smelt it in a Blast Furnace to get Mithril Scrap, which is used for Mithril Ingots and other strong equipment."]
	quest.68F0D22512AFF15B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Raw Mithril"
	quest.68F1C04B022F5BCA.quest_desc: ["Green Fertilizer increases crop growth."]
	quest.68F1C04B022F5BCA.quest_subtitle: "A fertilizer for crops"
	quest.6920BB5C3E6FEADC.quest_desc: ["Bring Upgrade Emerald into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6920BB5C3E6FEADC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Upgrade Emerald"
	quest.6920F841AB22880C.quest_desc: ["Craft the Thallasium Forged Plate from a Thallasium Ingot at an Anvil with a Smith Hammer." "You can then use it at a Smithing Table to build a full set of Thallasium armor."]
	quest.6920F841AB22880C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thallasium Forged Plate"
	quest.693E7A746445C115.quest_desc: ["Bring Dogwood Sapling into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.693E7A746445C115.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dogwood Sapling"
	quest.694EC4445C182219.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Advanced Air Compressor. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.694EC4445C182219.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Air Compressor"
	quest.6950AB287CDFB65B.quest_desc: ["A Kinetic Dynamo produces more FE the faster its Water Wheel or Windmill spins."]
	quest.6950AB287CDFB65B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dynamo"
	quest.695217245E1FF9F5.quest_desc: ["Logistics frames handle logistics tasks in a network, using drones or pipes pressurized to at least 3 bar. A Logistics Wrench is needed to work with them." "Frames pass items in order of priority. Active provider frames push to requester, storage and default storage frames. Default storage frames push to requester and storage frames and accept from active providers. Storage frames push to requesters and accept from active providers and default frames. Passive frames only push to requesters. Requester frames accept from active provider, passive and storage frames." "Filters control what each frame pushes or accepts, and requester frames can also set a desired amount. Overlapping filters can add up. Nothing is transported if no inventory or tank in the network has room."]
	quest.695217245E1FF9F5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Logistics Frame Active Provider, Logistics Frame Default Storage, Logistics Frame Passive Provider and 2 more items"
	quest.695217245E1FF9F5.title: "Logistics Frames"
	quest.695C3AFD2AC5E607.quest_desc: ["The Mummy simply fights your enemies in hand-to-hand combat."]
	quest.695C3AFD2AC5E607.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Familiar Mummy"
	quest.6976C4C1772EAFF2.quest_desc: ["The Glacite Chestplate is crafted from Glacite materials in Eternal Starlight." "Glacite armor protects against freezing environments and slows enemies that attack you."]
	quest.6976C4C1772EAFF2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glacite Chestplate"
	quest.69788511382BAB82.quest_desc: ["Craft a Black Steel Pickaxe from Cataclysm. It offers excellent durability and mining efficiency, and belongs to the Black Steel set."]
	quest.69788511382BAB82.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Black Steel Pickaxe"
	quest.697B8CD2A3391461.quest_desc: ["Bring Charged Snowball into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.697B8CD2A3391461.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Charged Snowball"
	quest.699D1AC6EA5EDE1B.quest_desc: ["The Terminite Hoe is a farming tool forged from Terminite Ingots and prepares farmland more efficiently than Thallasium tools." "It belongs to Better End's mid-tier equipment."]
	quest.699D1AC6EA5EDE1B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Terminite Hoe"
	quest.69A8FEDB187F3F17.quest_desc: ["Bring Imperium Helmet, Imperium Chestplate, Imperium Leggings and Imperium Boots into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.69A8FEDB187F3F17.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Imperium Helmet, Imperium Chestplate, Imperium Leggings and Imperium Boots"
	quest.69A8FEDB187F3F17.title: "Imperium Armor"
	quest.69AF1379B6E79EFC.quest_desc: ["Has a chance to damage attackers."]
	quest.69AF1379B6E79EFC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thorn Pendant"
	quest.69BAA907D762FFD7.quest_desc: ["Used for modifying lots of Patterns at once."]
	quest.69BAA907D762FFD7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pattern Modifier"
	quest.69C30CDF2E40F86C.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Elderberry Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.69C30CDF2E40F86C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Elderberry Sapling"
	quest.69C69E412DC52FF7.quest_desc: ["Bring Honeycomb Milky into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.69C69E412DC52FF7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Honeycomb Milky"
	quest.69D236F98086F9F1.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Energy Hopper Blazing. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.69D236F98086F9F1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Hopper Blazing"
	quest.69FB4C1FF6EDAFCB.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Swamp Gum Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.69FB4C1FF6EDAFCB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Swamp Gum Sapling"
	quest.6A0AD1EDDED4F8F0.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: Incubate Moa."]
	quest.6A0AD1EDDED4F8F0.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Incubate Moa"
	quest.6A1526D7FF35F810.quest_desc: ["Tier 2 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.6A1526D7FF35F810.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Wind Shear"
	quest.6A187DD8BA99E2A3.quest_desc: ["Induction Provides make up the transfer rate of the battery, both input and output. Transfer Rate: 819.20 kFE/t."]
	quest.6A187DD8BA99E2A3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Induction Provider"
	quest.6A20AF7178C44C2A.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for 16x Crystal Nitro. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.6A20AF7178C44C2A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 16x Crystal Nitro"
	quest.6A20AF7178C44C2A.title: "Nitro Crystal"
	quest.6A2A241353ECD7D4.quest_desc: ["Ice Rune is a crafting ingredient in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks, used for advanced Ice crafting such as Ice Upgrade Orbs. The Ice school uses Frozen Bone as its Focus." "Combine 1 Blank Runestone with 8 Frozen Bones to make one."]
	quest.6A2A241353ECD7D4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ice Rune"
	quest.6A2F8461FEC2CB3A.quest_desc: ["A Hohlraum is the starting source for the reactor. However, you still need a reliable source of Tritium and Deuterium as the reactor requires it to run. You will need to create D-T Fuel to fill this Hohlraum."]
	quest.6A2F8461FEC2CB3A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Hohlraum"
	quest.6A30C3761E2E4ADA.quest_desc: ["Bring Ender Gate Hardened into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6A30C3761E2E4ADA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ender Gate Hardened"
	quest.6A331140E85EB0B4.quest_desc: ["Upgraded version of the Enriched Alloy which some Mekanism machines and items use. Crafted in the Metallurgic Infuser by infusing an Enriched Alloy with Diamond Dust or Compressed Diamond."]
	quest.6A331140E85EB0B4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Alloy Reinforced"
	quest.6A4F2178F4E09456.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Starfish Bucket. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6A4F2178F4E09456.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Starfish Bucket"
	quest.6A57357AFB68EB68.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.6A57357AFB68EB68.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Dispel"
	quest.6A58ADFB3B5D8BD5.quest_desc: ["Common Ink is the most basic magical ink in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. The Scroll Forge uses it to make Common-rarity spell scrolls." "You can find it in magical structures or get it from powerful magical creatures."]
	quest.6A58ADFB3B5D8BD5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Common Ink"
	quest.6A635458FD18C0E7.quest_desc: ["Upgrade an Infused Seashelf with a Heart of the Sea and Prismarine Shards." "It gives +15 Eterna (up to 60) and a large +20 Arcana, making it one of the best shelves for rare enchantments."]
	quest.6A635458FD18C0E7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Heart Seashelf"
	quest.6A6F3CDF729858F3.quest_desc: ["The Twilight Forest is a hidden dimension of endless dusk, full of dense woods, ruins and powerful creatures." "To enter it, you need to build a portal using natural materials."]
	quest.6A6F3CDF729858F3.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Root"
	quest.6A6F3CDF729858F3.title: "The Twilight Forest"
	quest.6A73814A3702AC23.quest_desc: ["The first piece of the Chainmail armor set. Get the boots to unlock the chestplate and leggings."]
	quest.6A7D91C7521BD24A.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Centrifuge. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6A7D91C7521BD24A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Centrifuge"
	quest.6A7D91C7521BD24A.title: "Actually It's The Centripetal Force"
	quest.6A8C1CAC247FA31E.quest_desc: ["Thermodynamic Conductors are a way of transporting heat. Insulation: 10."]
	quest.6A8C1CAC247FA31E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Thermodynamic Conductor"
	quest.6AA7E2DFCF420728.quest_desc: ["The Purification Chamber uses oxygen to refine Ores and shards into clumps. Each ore makes 3 clumps, whereas each shard only gives one clump."]
	quest.6AA7E2DFCF420728.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Purification Chamber"
	quest.6AC612A16BB94AFB.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Configurable Honeycomb. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.6AC612A16BB94AFB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.6ACD4EBCFC3477E4.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Core 16k. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.6ACD4EBCFC3477E4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Core 16k"
	quest.6AD21696A3A815C9.quest_desc: ["Now that you have a Concurrent Processor you can now craft some more items to help you through ExtendedAE."]
	quest.6AD21696A3A815C9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Concurrent Processor"
	quest.6ADFB35DB13126FF.quest_desc: ["This unit allows you to fly. The controls are the same compared to creative mode."]
	quest.6ADFB35DB13126FF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Module Gravitational Modulating Unit"
	quest.6B072654AF8B4EC4.quest_desc: ["Bring Finger Lime Sapling into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6B072654AF8B4EC4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Finger Lime Sapling"
	quest.6B14097C730883B0.quest_desc: ["Bring Ender Cell Blazing into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6B14097C730883B0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ender Cell Blazing"
	quest.6B176850FD69337C.quest_desc: ["The Enchanting Table of the Raven lets you set the core enchanting stats directly for precise control over your setup."]
	quest.6B176850FD69337C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Raven Enchanting Table"
	quest.6B176850FD69337C.title: "The Raven Knows"
	quest.6B1BEC79005075E8.quest_desc: ["Curios adds slots for charms and accessories next to your inventory. Item tooltips tell you which slot an item can go in."]
	quest.6B1BEC79005075E8.quest_subtitle: "Extra equipment slots."
	quest.6B1BEC79005075E8.title: "Curios Slots"
	quest.6B2E837EB9A3DB28.quest_desc: ["The Starlit Diamond Shovel is a late-game tool crafted from Starlit Diamond materials in Eternal Starlight." "It digs efficiently in advanced biomes and is the top digging tier before celestial endgame content."]
	quest.6B2E837EB9A3DB28.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Starlit Diamond Shovel"
	quest.6B32683A2B473683.quest_desc: ["The leggings of the Chainmail armor set. Together with the chestplate, they unlock the helmet."]
	quest.6B32EFC2CDA5ED29.quest_desc: ["Craft the Thallasium Chestplate from Thallasium Plating at a Smithing Table." "It is part of the first armor set Better End adds."]
	quest.6B32EFC2CDA5ED29.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thallasium Chestplate"
	quest.6B3AA1C03FFF6612.quest_desc: ["Harvested from Animals while using a Knife."]
	quest.6B3AA1C03FFF6612.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Tallow"
	quest.6B3F2C31283D4A50.quest_desc: ["The Thermal Springstone Shovel is crafted from Thermal Springstone Ingots in Eternal Starlight." "It is used for digging in geothermal regions and sits at the mid tier of the Springstone gear."]
	quest.6B3F2C31283D4A50.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thermal Springstone Shovel"
	quest.6B420B672720971F.quest_desc: ["Rage of Stars is a mid-tier star-themed weapon from Eternal Starlight." "It sits between the elemental materials and late-game celestial gear, and focuses on burst magical damage and area star effects."]
	quest.6B420B672720971F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rage of Stars"
	quest.6B45D96E96AAFB6E.quest_desc: ["The Stove is a Farmer's Delight cooking station for preparing many dishes. Place ingredients inside to turn them into meals, which makes it a core part of any kitchen."]
	quest.6B45D96E96AAFB6E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Stove"
	quest.6B4DABF4DE611839.quest_desc: ["The chestplate of the Nano Quantum armor set. Together with the leggings, it unlocks the helmet."]
	quest.6B52A4936EA6FE4F.quest_desc: ["Filters items being piped in/out with more filtering options."]
	quest.6B52A4936EA6FE4F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Filter Upgrade"
	quest.6B58916E6D785ED5.quest_desc: ["The fluid canister holds 8 Buckets of whatever fluid you like. It has a unique “fill” mode for automatically filling fluid holding items in your inventory."]
	quest.6B58916E6D785ED5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fluid Canister"
	quest.6B5DD03E0BF1D016.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Energizing Rod Spirited. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6B5DD03E0BF1D016.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energizing Rod Spirited"
	quest.6B636C89BD920956.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Harbinger. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.6B636C89BD920956.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Harbinger"
	quest.6B6AEB271F09290A.quest_desc: ["Brassy, black sided, and very stylish."]
	quest.6B6AEB271F09290A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Railway Casing"
	quest.6B7A444CF23FA973.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Upgrade Gold. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6B7A444CF23FA973.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Upgrade Gold"
	quest.6B7BBCFA9187F2E6.quest_desc: ["Create Crafts and Additions has three basic spools: Empty Spool, Copper Spool and Gold Spool. The Empty Spool is the base for the wired ones." "Copper and Gold Spools link Connectors and carry electrical energy between them. Each uses 4 wires of its metal."]
	quest.6B7BBCFA9187F2E6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Spool, Copper Spool and Gold Spool"
	quest.6B7BC9B9ECF64FFD.quest_desc: ["If Internet Protocol has ports, than Package Frogports must be part of CCP: Chain Conveyor Protocol."]
	quest.6B7BC9B9ECF64FFD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Package Frogport"
	quest.6B87EFBA4CAD37D8.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: Loreception."]
	quest.6B87EFBA4CAD37D8.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Loreception"
	quest.6B87EFBA4CAD37D8.title: "Lore-Ception!"
	quest.6B89604387EC4F3D.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Expulsion Ring. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6B89604387EC4F3D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Expulsion Ring"
	quest.6B902C0B6CE683CA.quest_desc: ["This questbook is actively being developed. Some mod guides may be incomplete, change over time, or not exist yet. Checkmarks are optional read markers; there is no required quest order or gameplay objective."]
	quest.6B902C0B6CE683CA.quest_subtitle: "The guide is a work in progress, not a finished questline."
	quest.6B902C0B6CE683CA.title: "Questbook Under Development"
	quest.6B9C2BB068B89D1A.quest_desc: ["The Scepter of Fortification drops from the Twilight Lich. It lets you create protective barriers, which helps in both combat and survival." "Its power is limited, so use it with care."]
	quest.6B9C2BB068B89D1A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fortification Scepter"
	quest.6B9E34653D582016.quest_desc: ["The Eclipse Gate Wand has Lava Repair, Air Burst up to strength 8, Void Shift up to 30 blocks and Eclipse Gate, which opens a portable hole. All blocks except tile entities vanish temporarily, and after a short time the hole collapses and the blocks return."]
	quest.6B9E34653D582016.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Eclipsegate Wand"
	quest.6BA4B719E5A64CAC.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: Mount Phyg."]
	quest.6BA4B719E5A64CAC.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Mount Phyg"
	quest.6BA4E8DA6AF6C6A0.quest_desc: ["Bring Fluix Seeds into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6BA4E8DA6AF6C6A0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fluix Seeds"
	quest.6BAFF698ACCCFE0A.quest_desc: ["Crystallized Amber can be found in the Otherside." "Each block contains something, usually an item but sometimes a Sculk Leech, so break it with care."]
	quest.6BAFF698ACCCFE0A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Crystallized Amber"
	quest.6BB594CD94381638.quest_desc: ["This machine detects a player or mob and emits a redstone signal!"]
	quest.6BB594CD94381638.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sensort1"
	quest.6BB7D2717E73C5EE.quest_desc: ["Find the Desert Site from Cataclysm, a small structure in Desert biomes full of sandstone traps, hidden loot and dangerous enemies." "Check every corner before heading deeper down."]
	quest.6BB7D2717E73C5EE.title: "Desert Site"
	quest.6BB87A8365C1C5ED.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Peridot Seeds. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6BB87A8365C1C5ED.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Peridot Seeds"
	quest.6BCC1A61CD7E90B2.quest_desc: ["Used to change the weather."]
	quest.6BCC1A61CD7E90B2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ritual Cloudshaping"
	quest.6BECEC88B39E4C3B.quest_desc: ["The Deepshelf of Arcane Treasures lets Treasure Enchantments, such as Mending, appear in the enchanting table." "Craft it from Deepshelves, Diamonds, Gold Blocks and an Emerald Block."]
	quest.6BECEC88B39E4C3B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Treasure Shelf"
	quest.6BFC8DB5E2F62F5F.quest_desc: ["Amethyst Crab Meat from Cataclysm is an unusual delicacy taken from the defeated Amethyst Crab."]
	quest.6BFC8DB5E2F62F5F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Amethyst Crab Meat"
	quest.6C142604C565F1E5.quest_desc: ["The Protection Upgrade Orb is an upgrade material in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. Applied at the Arcane Anvil, it gives +5% Spell Resistance." "Craft it from 1 Empty Upgrade Orb and 8 Protective Runes. By default, compatible equipment accepts up to 3 upgrades."]
	quest.6C142604C565F1E5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Protection Upgrade Orb"
	quest.6C45809FFDD0FBCF.quest_desc: ["Through the power of gravity, throwing 1 Gold Ingot, 1 Lapis Lazuli, and 1 Entro dust you will obtain 1 Entro Infused Ingot."]
	quest.6C45809FFDD0FBCF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Entro Ingot"
	quest.6C494F9D6CCE6111.quest_desc: ["Voidshimmer Goo turns Diamond Blocks into Celestigems. It is fed with Ender Pearls or Chorus Fruit, and it can produce the resources of lower tiers faster. Celestigem and Eclipse Alloy tools, weapons and armor need power to work."]
	quest.6C494F9D6CCE6111.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 2x Celestigem and Gooblock Tier3"
	quest.6C494F9D6CCE6111.title: "Making Celestigems"
	quest.6C4A85F9A1C02D1D.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Monkey Puzzle Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.6C4A85F9A1C02D1D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Monkey Puzzle Sapling"
	quest.6C5352B98C9BAFF4.quest_desc: ["The Thermal Springstone Axe is crafted from Thermal Springstone Ingots in Eternal Starlight." "It is a heat-resistant, mid-tier tool for chopping wood in geothermal regions."]
	quest.6C5352B98C9BAFF4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thermal Springstone Axe"
	quest.6C5729829DB3D863.title: "Ur-Ghast"
	quest.6C5889B6CFE66D67.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Energy Cell Spirited. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6C5889B6CFE66D67.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Cell Spirited"
	quest.6C5A6C92D9D3255D.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Chicken Sandwich. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.6C5A6C92D9D3255D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chicken Sandwich"
	quest.6C5D737795BF9388.quest_desc: ["The Deepsilver Axe is crafted from Deepsilver Ingots in Eternal Starlight." "It works for chopping and fighting in swamp and Nightfall areas, with more durability than iron tools."]
	quest.6C5D737795BF9388.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Deepsilver Axe"
	quest.6C9E886CC1EE3D8A.quest_desc: ["Bring Hemp Fabric into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6C9E886CC1EE3D8A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Hemp Fabric"
	quest.6CA2B05E986937CB.quest_desc: ["Polymorphic Catalyst is the key to unlock Just Dire Things' better fuels. Drop one piece of polymorphic catalyst into water, and polymorphic fluid will result."]
	quest.6CA2B05E986937CB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Polymorphic Catalyst and Polymorphic Fluid Bucket"
	quest.6CA786134D0DA32B.quest_desc: ["Pulls items to it within a configurable area. You can place the magnet field somewhere else and increase its range."]
	quest.6CA786134D0DA32B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Itemcollector"
	quest.6CCC0C85FD188EB8.quest_desc: ["Bring Grapefruit Sapling into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6CCC0C85FD188EB8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Grapefruit Sapling"
	quest.6CD536084D807B99.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Voltmeter. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6CD536084D807B99.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Voltmeter"
	quest.6CE34C7BB7E569C3.quest_desc: ["The Stack Upgrade Tier 1+ lets compatible items stack beyond their normal limit in your Sophisticated Storage containers." "That means more items fit without using extra slots, which makes every container more efficient."]
	quest.6CE34C7BB7E569C3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Stack Upgrade Tier 1 Plus"
	quest.6CEFF519AC0F4981.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Blazegold Leggings. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.6CEFF519AC0F4981.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blazegold Leggings"
	quest.6CFD8C74EEF6AAC4.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.6CFD8C74EEF6AAC4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Rune"
	quest.6D12982E206076B3.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Celestigem Hoe. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.6D12982E206076B3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Celestigem Hoe"
	quest.6D152CC9EE402249.quest_desc: ["This device is a portal to another dimension that only your spirits can enter. Supply a miner spirit and it brings back ore and other blocks, storing them in its inventory." "Redstone can disable it, and a comparator can read the lamp's durability."]
	quest.6D152CC9EE402249.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dimensional Mineshaft"
	quest.6D1D917C76B40906.quest_desc: ["The Resistive Heater converts FE into Heat, giving you a reliable way to supply heat to your Thermal Evaporation Plant. Connect it to the plant's Thermal Evaporation Valve to transfer the generated Heat directly into the tower. Use it when you need a controllable heat source for increasing the temperature and improving the evaporation process."]
	quest.6D1D917C76B40906.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Resistive Heater"
	quest.6D1D917C76B40906.title: "Resistive Heater"
	quest.6D33F52AB5E994BA.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for European Larch Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.6D33F52AB5E994BA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain European Larch Sapling"
	quest.6D39E8BD0BD78A8E.quest_desc: ["The Library of Alexandria greatly expands how many enchantments you can store. It pairs well with the Tome of Extraction for moving enchantments off existing gear into your collection."]
	quest.6D39E8BD0BD78A8E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ender Library"
	quest.6D3BF32E8DAF8F91.quest_desc: ["Janitor spirits can pick up items and deposit them into containers. They're particularly useful to gather the products of other spirits."]
	quest.6D3BF32E8DAF8F91.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Book of Binding Bound Foliot, Brush, Dispenser and Hopper. Earn the advancement: Summon Foliot Cleaner"
	quest.6D3BF32E8DAF8F91.title: "Ritual: Summon Foliot Janitor"
	quest.6D4E45392F3BDEB0.quest_desc: ["The Flowglaze Pickaxe is a mining tool from Eternal Starlight in the Flowglaze tier." "It is crafted from Flowglaze materials and fits mid-to-late game."]
	quest.6D4E45392F3BDEB0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Flowglaze Pickaxe"
	quest.6D593EE9664927ED.quest_desc: ["Used to store power, you will need to get yourself a FE Cell Housing."]
	quest.6D593EE9664927ED.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Insulating Resin"
	quest.6D66859037ADC9B0.quest_desc: ["Adds a smoker to the storage."]
	quest.6D66859037ADC9B0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smoking Upgrade"
	quest.6D68225D5481E46D.quest_desc: ["Use it to make fish fillets. The amount you get depends on the type of fish."]
	quest.6D68225D5481E46D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Diamond Fillet Knife"
	quest.6D6A8C839BA1FEBC.quest_desc: ["It is found in Aurora Palaces. It fires like a normal bow, but a hit swaps your place with the target. Be careful where that leaves you."]
	quest.6D6A8C839BA1FEBC.quest_subtitle: "Find the Ender Bow"
	quest.6D6A8C839BA1FEBC.title: "The Ender Bow"
	quest.6D6D9842CFD8C951.quest_desc: ["Bring Ice Seeds into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6D6D9842CFD8C951.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ice Seeds"
	quest.6D7235B9B9C960DD.quest_desc: ["The Gas-Burning Generator can use a plethora of flammable gases to generate electricity. Gases like Hydrogen and Ethene can be good for a large amount of power early on. Check your EMI to see which gases are truly flammable and how much power you can generate with them."]
	quest.6D7235B9B9C960DD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gas Burning Generator"
	quest.6D7235B9B9C960DD.title: "Gas-Burning Generator"
	quest.6D8991B1B64AAF0F.title: "Questing Ram"
	quest.6D8BE79061F0CC20.quest_desc: ["The Apprentice Spellbook is a better book and requires a trip to the Nether."]
	quest.6D8BE79061F0CC20.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gold Spell Book"
	quest.6D93F89EE75F5733.quest_desc: ["The Rolling Mill from Create Crafts and Additions is a kinetic machine that turns metal into Rods and Wires." "It handles Copper, Iron, Gold, Brass and Electrum, which you need for electrical parts. Power it with Create's rotational force."]
	quest.6D93F89EE75F5733.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rolling Mill"
	quest.6D96DFC86C32B8BB.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Seed Reprocessor. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6D96DFC86C32B8BB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Seed Reprocessor"
	quest.6D998327C7098C51.quest_desc: ["This spirit will bring back random ores - including deepslate ores."]
	quest.6D998327C7098C51.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Miner Afrit Deeps"
	quest.6DCD49C382DB1C9C.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Mango Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6DCD49C382DB1C9C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mango Sapling"
	quest.6DE384270098B0D5.quest_desc: ["Transmits energy from the attached source to any power consumer within an offset AOE."]
	quest.6DE384270098B0D5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energytransmitter"
	quest.6DFD4C8C70B53F69.quest_desc: ["The Glacite Shovel is crafted from Glacite Ingots in Eternal Starlight." "It digs in cold biomes and is more durable than earlier-tier tools."]
	quest.6DFD4C8C70B53F69.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glacite Shovel"
	quest.6E0AFC4F93A709DE.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Yew Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.6E0AFC4F93A709DE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Yew Sapling"
	quest.6E1B7E482248CD70.quest_desc: ["Arcane stone is used for crafting items from Ars Nouveau. You may also want to use this in your Ars Nouveau magical area."]
	quest.6E1B7E482248CD70.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 8x Sourcestone"
	quest.6E1B7E482248CD70.title: "Sourcestone"
	quest.6E1C7AD61242989D.quest_desc: ["Craft the Bone Reptile Chestplate from Cataclysm using Ancient Metal Ingots and Koboleton Bones." "It is durable, with good protection and knockback resistance."]
	quest.6E1C7AD61242989D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bone Reptile Chestplate"
	quest.6E2020218315C399.quest_desc: ["Processes resource combs into resources and honey. It holds 10 buckets of liquid and outputs fluid to any fluid storage block next to it. It also separates genetic material from bee material bottles into genes."]
	quest.6E2020218315C399.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Centrifuge"
	quest.6E3E449AF33D6E57.quest_desc: ["The Seeking Eye is an Eternal Starlight item that points you toward the dimension's bosses." "It can find threats that ordinary exploration would not turn up."]
	quest.6E3E449AF33D6E57.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Seeking Eye"
	quest.6E3E449AF33D6E57.title: "Seeking Eye"
	quest.6E3E4E3C6CE74A69.quest_desc: ["A simple generator that makes power from coal and other solid fuels."]
	quest.6E3E4E3C6CE74A69.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Generatort1"
	quest.6E43042D3CEE208D.quest_desc: ["Bring Minnow into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6E43042D3CEE208D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Minnow"
	quest.6E45DE5B628038D1.quest_desc: ["Whilst in the Nether, you must fight your way to the Hogs, and obtain Hogskin."]
	quest.6E45DE5B628038D1.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Hoglin"
	quest.6E4B1039904C224F.quest_desc: ["Feed it Forge Energy and it powers any receiver linked to it."]
	quest.6E4B1039904C224F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Heater"
	quest.6E5CD41866DE6111.quest_desc: ["A key piece of most Create builds: interchanges axis of rotational motion between one plane and another."]
	quest.6E5CD41866DE6111.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gearbox"
	quest.6E6769A01053B690.quest_desc: ["There may be other ways to make more power in modded, but it is hard to top the satisfaction of a boiler driving many Steam Engines… as many as you can setup fed with enough heat and water."]
	quest.6E6769A01053B690.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Steam Engine"
	quest.6E6A0D502DFCC952.quest_desc: ["The Sky Steel Ingot can be used to craft MEGA Item Storage cells. It is made by dropping Charged Certus Quartz, Iron, and Sky Stone into water. The Sky Osmium Ingot can be used to craft MEGA Chemical Storage cells. It is made by dropping Charged Certus Quartz, Osmium, and Sky Stone into water. The Sky Bronze Ingot can be used to craft MEGA Fluid Storage cells. It is made by dropping Charged Certus Quartz, Copper, and Sky Stone into water."]
	quest.6E6A0D502DFCC952.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sky Steel Ingot, Sky Bronze Ingot and Sky Osmium Ingot"
	quest.6E6B1DFAFF693FAA.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Capacitor Spirited. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6E6B1DFAFF693FAA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Capacitor Spirited"
	quest.6E6DE23E9CCF1E39.quest_desc: ["Bring Soul Sand Nest into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6E6DE23E9CCF1E39.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Soul Sand Nest"
	quest.6E703B6CB23A1180.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Energized Steel Seeds. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6E703B6CB23A1180.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energized Steel Seeds"
	quest.6E87762F6639137B.quest_desc: ["Try every food that is exclusive to the Twilight Forest."]
	quest.6E87762F6639137B.quest_subtitle: "Eat all the Twilight Forest foods"
	quest.6E8BC6B8B1890312.quest_desc: ["The Osmium Compressor is used to create Refined Obsidian Ingots from Refined Obsidian Dust and Glowstone Ingots from Glowstone Dust. It fuses liquid Osmium (melted down Osmium Ingots placed in the machine's bottom slot) with the originating materials to create their corresponding ingots."]
	quest.6E8BC6B8B1890312.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Osmium Compressor"
	quest.6E90FA61DB81B8BC.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Imperium Gemstone. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6E90FA61DB81B8BC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Imperium Gemstone"
	quest.6E9DEBC2D6333DFE.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Plate of Cold Striderloaf. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.6E9DEBC2D6333DFE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Plate of Cold Striderloaf"
	quest.6E9F5C14939476E4.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Ghast Seeds. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.6E9F5C14939476E4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ghast Seeds"
	quest.6E9FB509B6778926.quest_desc: ["The Copper Stool with Festive Lights is a decorative block that pairs a copper stool with festive lighting. It adds some character to a factory, workshop or living space."]
	quest.6E9FB509B6778926.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Festive Spool"
	quest.6EA2495260EAC420.quest_desc: ["Bring Minigun into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6EA2495260EAC420.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Minigun"
	quest.6EA8CCAF032487D3.quest_desc: ["The Large Steam Furnace can smelt recipes in batches of up to 8 at a 25% deduction of EU cost. Keep in mind, it will not do a mix of recipes, they must be the same type. If not, each type of recipe will be split into their batch of a max of 8."]
	quest.6EA8CCAF032487D3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Large Steam Furnace, 16x Bronze Plated Bricks, 7x Fire Clay Bricks and 2 more items"
	quest.6EABD47309F354DD.quest_desc: ["You'll want to craft a Pattern Encoding Terminal to be able to encode patterns with crafting recipes for your autocrafting system. The Pattern Access Terminal is another upgrade or the Terminal. This Terminal will allow you to make a Pattern of items you want your system to craft."]
	quest.6EABD47309F354DD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pattern Encoding Terminal and Pattern Access Terminal"
	quest.6EABD47309F354DD.title: "Pattern Encoding Terminal"
	quest.6EB4CFA725680541.quest_desc: ["Actually does nothing on it's own.. but is a key ingredient in making other desirable stuff. Also maybe the first thing you will want to build a contraption to make."]
	quest.6EB4CFA725680541.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Precision Mechanism"
	quest.6EB8725CD38955BC.quest_desc: ["Bring Neptunium Fishing Rod into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6EB8725CD38955BC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Neptunium Fishing Rod"
	quest.6EBF12BBAB828C1B.quest_desc: ["Feeds the player from food in the storage."]
	quest.6EBF12BBAB828C1B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Feeding Upgrade"
	quest.6ECAED363B693583.quest_desc: ["A Sigil of Socketing adds another socket to compatible Affix Gear, making room for one more Gem."]
	quest.6ECAED363B693583.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sigil of Socketing"
	quest.6ECAED363B693583.title: "More Room"
	quest.6ECF9993595C000E.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Supremium Helmet, Supremium Chestplate, Supremium Leggings and Supremium Boots. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.6ECF9993595C000E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Supremium Helmet, Supremium Chestplate, Supremium Leggings and Supremium Boots"
	quest.6ECF9993595C000E.title: "Supremium Armor"
	quest.6EDAA5067E208646.quest_desc: ["Steel can come from this mod or from other mods in the pack."]
	quest.6EDAA5067E208646.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ingot Steel"
	quest.6EDAA5067E208646.title: "Steel Ingot"
	quest.6EEC0078D6A23658.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Mystical Fertilizer. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.6EEC0078D6A23658.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mystical Fertilizer"
	quest.6EF2D4401AAFD366.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.6EF2D4401AAFD366.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Sensitive"
	quest.6F0773C261CCF352.quest_desc: ["The Glacite Sword is crafted from Glacite Ingots in Eternal Starlight." "It is a mid-tier weapon that slows enemies, which helps control crowds in cold biomes."]
	quest.6F0773C261CCF352.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glacite Sword"
	quest.6F0AA458CD49A86C.quest_desc: ["Filters items being piped in/out."]
	quest.6F0AA458CD49A86C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Filter Upgrade"
	quest.6F0B6FF4B75E8D66.quest_desc: ["An advanced compressor that utilizes sunlight to pressurize air. Its efficiency improves as it gets hotter, but excessive heat buildup will cause the compressor to shut down, necessitating manual repair."]
	quest.6F0B6FF4B75E8D66.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Solar Compressor"
	quest.6F0E941A3F0A6300.quest_desc: ["The Chemical Infuser combines or reacts two gases to create another gas. The gas gauges on the left and right side of its GUI are the input tanks, and correspond to correspond with the left and right sides of the machine. The gauge in the middle is for the resulting gas, which likewise is output through the front of the machine."]
	quest.6F0E941A3F0A6300.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chemical Infuser"
	quest.6F2CDCF53BDD5F0D.quest_desc: ["Make a Glowberry Milkshake to bring the taste of Glow Berries into your factory. This glowing variant adds a unique touch to the milkshakes of Create: Dreams n' Desires."]
	quest.6F2CDCF53BDD5F0D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glowberry Milkshake"
	quest.6F3E82436B6DCD42.quest_desc: ["A Bank Dock can be placed in the world and works like a chest while a Bank sits inside it."]
	quest.6F3E82436B6DCD42.quest_subtitle: "Place a Bank in a chest-like dock"
	quest.6F43A73447924D09.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Titanium Ingot. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6F43A73447924D09.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Titanium Ingot"
	quest.6F43A73447924D09.title: "Steel but Pink"
	quest.6F67CAC027801375.quest_desc: ["Give this scroll to a starbuncle, and it will help keep you further organized."]
	quest.6F67CAC027801375.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Deny Scroll"
	quest.6F68802E3CECA25D.quest_desc: ["To establish a Mercurial Logistics network, these Wires must be used to link between in- and outputs. Connection Nodes allow for multiple wires to converge to one point, if needed."]
	quest.6F68802E3CECA25D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Logistics Connector Node and Copper Wire"
	quest.6F68802E3CECA25D.title: "Mercurial Connections"
	quest.6F713004201B6207.quest_desc: ["An upgraded Basic Control Circuit, used in many tier 2 machines and items."]
	quest.6F713004201B6207.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Control Circuit"
	quest.6F810D21904F00B6.quest_desc: ["Bring Holly Sapling into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6F810D21904F00B6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Holly Sapling"
	quest.6F9082A1F400E5D3.quest_desc: ["Upgrade those Large Steam Boilers already! This advanced version can quadruple the Steam production to 1024 mb/t of steam at full temperature. It's a little taller so remember to use the Wrench to see multiblock shape and block placement."]
	quest.6F9082A1F400E5D3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Large Steam Boiler"
	quest.6F9082A1F400E5D3.title: "Advanced Large Steam Boiler"
	quest.6F9AEFBE29744AE4.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Zebrano Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6F9AEFBE29744AE4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Zebrano Sapling"
	quest.6FBFBC067DD3FD2A.quest_desc: ["Bring Pistachio Sapling into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6FBFBC067DD3FD2A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pistachio Sapling"
	quest.6FD1D4CDDE2DFD69.quest_desc: ["The Actuator's storage space is limited by default. Stabilizers strengthen its link to the storage dimension so it can store more."]
	quest.6FD1D4CDDE2DFD69.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Storage Stabilizer Tier4"
	quest.6FD8B163635D5992.quest_desc: ["Cuts down even the tallest trees, or cuts many things into.. many more things. So many recipes apply for many possible inputs to the Mechanical Saw, that you'll want to lock in the recipe by hitting the top of it with an example of the desired output."]
	quest.6FD8B163635D5992.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mechanical Saw"
	quest.6FDB74D30B768032.quest_desc: ["Bring Icestone into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6FDB74D30B768032.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Icestone"
	quest.6FDB74D30B768032.title: "Cold as Ice"
	quest.6FDEAD51DB6A6F36.quest_desc: ["Some quests reward a T3 Codex (Ancient Codex Entry). T3 Codexes do not spawn naturally."]
	quest.6FDEAD51DB6A6F36.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Split, Glyph Blink, Glyph Burst and 13 more items"
	quest.6FDEAD51DB6A6F36.title: "Tier 3 Glyphs"
	quest.6FEB8BBF4480C371.quest_desc: ["The Mana Upgrade Orb is an upgrade material in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. Applied at the Arcane Anvil, it gives +50 Max Mana." "It works on compatible equipment, and by default a piece can receive up to 3 upgrades."]
	quest.6FEB8BBF4480C371.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mana Upgrade Orb"
	quest.6FEE5D7DF1072157.quest_desc: ["Cursium Ingots from Cataclysm are rare and dropped by Maledictus in the Frosted Prison." "They are used to craft powerful Cursium equipment."]
	quest.6FEE5D7DF1072157.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cursium Ingot"
	quest.6FF0A56C73DEA914.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Rowan Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6FF0A56C73DEA914.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rowan Sapling"
	quest.6FF65DF3C9FB95AE.quest_desc: ["The Silver Ring is a simple but useful magical accessory from Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. It is a modest base for your magical gear, so consider wearing it as you build up your setup."]
	quest.6FF65DF3C9FB95AE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Silver Ring"
	quest.6FF8077A77706421.quest_desc: ["Clawdian is a Cataclysm mini-boss inside the Acropolis. It is a huge crustacean warrior with a giant claw that guards the stronghold." "Defeat it to clear one of the Acropolis' toughest guardians."]
	quest.6FF8077A77706421.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Clawdian"
	quest.6FF8077A77706421.title: "Clawdian"
	quest.700FCEDBE64F3313.quest_desc: ["MekaSuit can be upgraded with Modules that are installed with the Modification Station."]
	quest.700FCEDBE64F3313.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mekasuit Boots"
	quest.7014B2366D779AE2.quest_desc: ["The Charger turns Certus Quartz into Charged Certus Quartz and recharges tools and items that use AE power. The Crank powers it by hand, so you can use it before you have any other power."]
	quest.7014B2366D779AE2.title: "Charger"
	quest.70211D7B2E93E8DE.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Solar Panel Starter. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.70211D7B2E93E8DE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Solar Panel Starter"
	quest.702506FB0F4559A7.quest_desc: ["An Energy Cube is an advanced type of battery that is compatible with multiple energy systems."]
	quest.702506FB0F4559A7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Energy Cube"
	quest.702984EE8F429BEA.quest_desc: ["Bring Thread Gliding into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.702984EE8F429BEA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thread Gliding"
	quest.7037E44B49F9B43A.quest_desc: ["Found a sound that annoys you? Open your inventory and click the muffler button at the top right to quiet it."]
	quest.7037E44B49F9B43A.quest_subtitle: "Silence what bothers you."
	quest.7037E44B49F9B43A.title: "Muffle Noisy Sounds"
	quest.70468C1143E1CE47.quest_desc: ["The first piece of the Steeleaf armor set. Get the boots to unlock the chestplate and leggings."]
	quest.7047A0BAF1E7C171.quest_desc: ["Plain ol' Cardboard. So basic, and yet.."]
	quest.7047A0BAF1E7C171.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cardboard"
	quest.7048646BCF846E42.quest_desc: ["Pyromancer Boots are part of the Pyromancer Armor set in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. They give +3 Armor, +125 Max Mana, +10% Fire Spell Power and +5% Spell Power." "In the current version, make them from a Fire Rune, Wizard Boots and Arcane Essence."]
	quest.7048646BCF846E42.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pyromancer Boots"
	quest.704B403E2FE198AC.quest_desc: ["The Starfire Scythe is a late-game melee weapon from Eternal Starlight in the Starfire tier." "It is built for sweeping attacks and extra reach compared to standard weapons."]
	quest.704B403E2FE198AC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Starfire Scythe"
	quest.705073EFD9A5E1D1.quest_desc: ["Electrum Wire from Create Crafts and Additions carries electrical energy between compatible components. It belongs to the mod's electrical system with connectors and other wiring, and helps you build reliable links across your network."]
	quest.705073EFD9A5E1D1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Electrum Wire"
	quest.7067FBA480B8B646.quest_desc: ["The rarest of them all, Precious resources are often of exceptional value."]
	quest.7067FBA480B8B646.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Alchemical Sulfur Iesnium, Alchemical Sulfur Emerald, Alchemical Sulfur Diamond and Alchemical Sulfur Netherite"
	quest.7067FBA480B8B646.title: "Precious Sulfurs"
	quest.707123C855FC3A68.quest_desc: ["It drops from the Snow Queen and helps if your aim is poor. Enchanting it with Power V makes it as strong as the Tri-Bow."]
	quest.707123C855FC3A68.quest_subtitle: "Get the Seeker Bow"
	quest.707123C855FC3A68.title: "The Seeker Bow"
	quest.7071E4442193DCC8.quest_desc: ["A reinforced version of the Basic Pressure Tube, these can be camouflaged and have Tube Modules added to provide extra functionality."]
	quest.7071E4442193DCC8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Reinforced Pressure Tube"
	quest.707AC1502CB5CC38.quest_desc: ["Bring Awakened Supremium Helmet, Awakened Supremium Chestplate, Awakened Supremium Leggings and Awakened Supremium Boots into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.707AC1502CB5CC38.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Awakened Supremium Helmet, Awakened Supremium Chestplate, Awakened Supremium Leggings and Awakened Supremium Boots"
	quest.707AC1502CB5CC38.title: "Awakened Supremium Armor"
	quest.707E0F4AC4A3468F.quest_desc: ["A Bottle o' Lightning is obtained by Right-Clicking a bottle on a charged creeper."]
	quest.707E0F4AC4A3468F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Lightning Bottle"
	quest.7080BBF387CF1381.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Mv Steam Turbine. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7080BBF387CF1381.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mv Steam Turbine"
	quest.7080BBF387CF1381.title: "Better Than Wind Mills"
	quest.708B451E3FFBE2B9.quest_desc: ["For the Electric Chain Saw: Press Left Shift and Right Click to swap between Fortune/Looting and Silk Touch. For the Electric Mining Drill: Press Left Shift and Right Click to swap between Fortune and Silk Touch. For Both: Use Alt and Mouse Scroll to change mining speeds."]
	quest.708B451E3FFBE2B9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Electric Chainsaw and Electric Mining Drill"
	quest.708B451E3FFBE2B9.title: "Electric Accessories"
	quest.709902273BED82EB.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Prudentium Watering Can. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.709902273BED82EB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Prudentium Watering Can"
	quest.70A1B99C599C3639.quest_desc: ["Plagued Boots are part of the Plagued Armor set in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. They give +3 Armor, +125 Max Mana, +10% Nature Spell Power and +5% Spell Power." "Make them with 1 Nature Rune, 1 Wizard Boots and 1 Arcane Essence."]
	quest.70A1B99C599C3639.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Plagued Boots"
	quest.70AB7073F3E04EA6.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Configurable Honeycomb. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.70AB7073F3E04EA6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.70B98506E050EED0.quest_desc: ["Lignite is a truly abundant fuel source that can be found in the world. It's pretty much Coal, but brown. It has a lower carbon content despite burning the same amount as Coal; created the same way too. This means you can keep your real Coal for other projects or recipes, keep Lignite to fuel your Steam Mining Drill instead."]
	quest.70B98506E050EED0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 64x Lignite Coal"
	quest.70B98506E050EED0.title: "Lignite Coal"
	quest.70CEB03E6D7FD326.quest_desc: ["Bring Red Delicious Apple Sapling into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.70CEB03E6D7FD326.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Red Delicious Apple Sapling"
	quest.70D3CF50F6A50C69.quest_desc: ["Lava and water together, for example, produce 31 FE/t. Other fluid pairs work too, so it is worth experimenting."]
	quest.70D3CF50F6A50C69.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thermoelectric Generator"
	quest.70D45EF935FBEB29.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for End Seeds. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.70D45EF935FBEB29.quest_subtitle: "Obtain End Seeds"
	quest.70D80C15C1E42E9E.quest_desc: ["Bring Fluix Dust into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.70D80C15C1E42E9E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fluix Dust"
	quest.70D9DF4A9E061CEB.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Synodontis. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.70D9DF4A9E061CEB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Synodontis"
	quest.70EC5669790E2538.quest_desc: ["The Thallasium Pickaxe is a mining tool forged from Thallasium Ingots with a Smith Hammer and Anvil." "It starts Better End's tool progression, above iron but below Terminite and Aeternium."]
	quest.70EC5669790E2538.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thallasium Pickaxe"
	quest.70EF2EEA2EA17121.quest_desc: ["An utility head armor piece, used in conjunction with the Scuba Tank to breathe underwater. It can be enchanted with respiration and water breathing for extended use."]
	quest.70EF2EEA2EA17121.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Scuba Mask"
	quest.7107506BF772DD74.quest_desc: ["The Enchantment Library stores enchanted books so you can retrieve them later, without filling your storage with books."]
	quest.7107506BF772DD74.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Library"
	quest.7115C45F384550B7.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Sealed Sword. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7115C45F384550B7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sealed Sword"
	quest.712331CFE1AA1774.quest_desc: ["The Matter Condenser will allow you to make Matter Balls for the Paint Gun, and make Singularities at the cost of item entities."]
	quest.712331CFE1AA1774.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Condenser"
	quest.7127CF11ABA2F241.quest_desc: ["Trees in the Torreya Forest of Eternal Starlight drop Torreya Logs." "You can use them for crafting and building in the dimension."]
	quest.7127CF11ABA2F241.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 10x Torreya Log"
	quest.7127CF11ABA2F241.title: "Torreya Wood"
	quest.712DC413A1DABC9F.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Pomegranate Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.712DC413A1DABC9F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pomegranate Sapling"
	quest.714C8B0F3D2859AA.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Limited Iron Barrel 1. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.714C8B0F3D2859AA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Limited Iron Barrel 1"
	quest.715C6089ADFFA16B.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Energy Hopper Nitro. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.715C6089ADFFA16B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Hopper Nitro"
	quest.7195E352119B893E.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Concentration Amulet. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7195E352119B893E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Concentration Amulet"
	quest.71B13BEA19B4BCF8.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Pecan Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.71B13BEA19B4BCF8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pecan Sapling"
	quest.71BA0C3C951BE449.quest_desc: ["The Cryomancer Coat is the chestpiece of the Cryomancer Armor set in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. It gives +8 Armor, +125 Max Mana, +10% Ice Spell Power and +5% Spell Power, and can hold 1 imbued spell." "Upgrade Wizard Robes with 1 Ice Rune and 1 Arcane Essence to get it."]
	quest.71BA0C3C951BE449.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cryomancer Chestplate"
	quest.71D82A7618C07718.quest_desc: ["Collect 8 coal and 16 cobblestone, then craft a furnace. Coal works as your first fuel, and stone leads to stronger tools and blocks." "The furnace unlocks smelting, which is key for progression."]
	quest.71D82A7618C07718.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 8x Coal, 16x Cobblestone and Furnace"
	quest.71D82A7618C07718.title: "Stone Progression"
	quest.71DBE4620D736352.quest_desc: ["Slowly restores hunger while walking on grass."]
	quest.71DBE4620D736352.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rooted Boots"
	quest.71F3355F7329434D.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Horn of the Wild Hunter. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.71F3355F7329434D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Horn of the Wild Hunter"
	quest.71FB339EBF50F9A6.quest_desc: ["This helps locate budding amethyst and magical creatures within a 75 block radius."]
	quest.71FB339EBF50F9A6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dowsing Rod"
	quest.72047ED9D52B3CF4.quest_desc: ["Make the Warden Boots in a Mechanical Crafter using a Netherite Boots, Echo Ingots, Warden Carapace, a Reinforced Echo Shard and a Warden Upgrade Template." "Enchantments on the netherite piece are not kept, so enchant the result afterwards."]
	quest.72047ED9D52B3CF4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Warden Boots"
	quest.721BBDF08D8B5B61.quest_desc: ["Bring Energy Discharger Basic into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.721BBDF08D8B5B61.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Discharger Basic"
	quest.721D739DB60501AE.quest_desc: ["Bring Emberblade into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.721D739DB60501AE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Emberblade"
	quest.721EBB4B78B425A7.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: Aether Champion."]
	quest.721EBB4B78B425A7.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Aether Champion"
	quest.721EED4CFFFCC1B1.quest_desc: ["The Ender Upgrade Orb is an upgrade material in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. Applied at the Arcane Anvil, it gives +5% Ender Spell Power." "Craft it from 1 Empty Upgrade Orb and 8 Ender Runes. Ender Runes are the runestones of the Ender school."]
	quest.721EED4CFFFCC1B1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ender Upgrade Orb"
	quest.7230F1A546BEEB0B.quest_desc: ["Bring Olive Sapling into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7230F1A546BEEB0B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Olive Sapling"
	quest.7232D8F8AC59C7B6.quest_desc: ["Tier 2 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.7232D8F8AC59C7B6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Smelt"
	quest.723DF58ED0AD9ADB.quest_desc: ["The Limited Oak Barrel III offers more capacity than the earlier tiers and keeps the compact barrel shape." "Keep expanding your storage to work toward the most powerful containers."]
	quest.723DF58ED0AD9ADB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Limited Barrel 3"
	quest.723DFC38D29BBDC9.quest_desc: ["Bring Distillery into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.723DFC38D29BBDC9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Distillery"
	quest.723DFC38D29BBDC9.title: "Al Capone Approves"
	quest.724765B7DA80CECF.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Steeleaf Helmet, Steeleaf Chestplate, Steeleaf Leggings and Steeleaf Boots. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.724765B7DA80CECF.quest_subtitle: "Craft a full set of Steeleaf Armor"
	quest.724765B7DA80CECF.title: "Steeleaf Armorer"
	quest.725ABB2AEA4B1E1D.quest_desc: ["It can be a hassle to harvest Otherwood saplings - as they are unstable, you can only see and harvest them while under the Third Eye. This trade spirit fixes that little problem, by exchanging your unstable saplings with ones that need no Third Eye to interact with."]
	quest.725ABB2AEA4B1E1D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Book of Binding Bound Foliot, Oak Sapling, Birch Sapling and 2 more items. Earn the advancement: Summon Foliot Sapling Trader"
	quest.725ABB2AEA4B1E1D.title: "Ritual: Summon Otherworld Sapling Trader"
	quest.725BAACD9646C523.quest_desc: ["Iron Wire from Create Crafts and Additions is made in the Rolling Mill and used in recipes for several electrical components. You will want it alongside Copper Wire and the other metal wires as your network grows."]
	quest.725BAACD9646C523.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Iron Wire"
	quest.7269C90D724A67F6.quest_desc: ["Used in the creation of some glyphs."]
	quest.7269C90D724A67F6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Earth Essence"
	quest.72750076B9971EC5.quest_desc: ["Pumps fluid between the tank upgrade and adjacent blocks."]
	quest.72750076B9971EC5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pump Upgrade"
	quest.7278129E7775C0F9.quest_desc: ["The Energy Boomerang is a ranged weapon from Eternal Starlight." "It appears in the advanced part of the mod's progression."]
	quest.7278129E7775C0F9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Boomerang"
	quest.7278129E7775C0F9.title: "Energy Boomerang"
	quest.72805EEF37B00307.quest_desc: ["A decorative lighting choice from Ars Nouveau."]
	quest.72805EEF37B00307.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sconce"
	quest.72817769D050E08B.quest_desc: ["Obtain a Steam Whistle from Create. It is a musical block powered by steam and triggered with Redstone." "You can place it on Fluid Tanks, tune it to different notes and extend it for other pitches. It can also be installed on Trains as their signature whistle."]
	quest.72817769D050E08B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Steam Whistle"
	quest.728E96063D7A6B3E.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Thermo Generator Spirited. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.728E96063D7A6B3E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thermo Generator Spirited"
	quest.72932C84DB6B31BF.quest_desc: ["Bring Silverfish into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.72932C84DB6B31BF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Silverfish"
	quest.729846289E25C493.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Minced Strider. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.729846289E25C493.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Minced Strider"
	quest.72990A1C544789D5.quest_desc: ["The Amber Gem is most often gathered from Amber Ore in the Amber Land, though it can also be crafted or found elsewhere in Better End." "It is mainly used in Infusion Rituals, and also for Eyes of Ender and decorative Amber Blocks."]
	quest.72990A1C544789D5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Amber Gem"
	quest.72A902D3F7D49667.quest_desc: ["The Malarite Pickaxe is an early-game mining tool in Eternal Starlight, crafted from Malarite found in swamp biomes." "It uses a standard crafting table recipe."]
	quest.72A902D3F7D49667.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Malarite Pickaxe"
	quest.72B1B1FF2FB91137.quest_desc: ["Bring Imperium Watering Can into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.72B1B1FF2FB91137.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Imperium Watering Can"
	quest.72C54536C81BB476.quest_desc: ["Yellow Cake is obtained by putting Uranium Ingots in the Enrichment Chamber. Yellow Cake will be needed to make Fissile Fuel for the Fission Reactor."]
	quest.72C54536C81BB476.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Yellow Cake Uranium"
	quest.72D18B947FE41BE3.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Red Crepe Myrtle Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.72D18B947FE41BE3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Red Crepe Myrtle Sapling"
	quest.72DDA41980D35D8B.quest_desc: ["The Amaramber Sword was added in version 0.4.2 with the other Amaramber tools in Eternal Starlight." "Amaramber equipment is linked to fiery effects and to materials gathered from Torreya trees."]
	quest.72DDA41980D35D8B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Amaramber Sword"
	quest.72E0EC631DAC1513.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: Black Moa."]
	quest.72E0EC631DAC1513.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Black Moa"
	quest.72E31A9E5B6E8E20.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Configurable Honeycomb. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.72E31A9E5B6E8E20.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.72EB399A714D6B45.quest_desc: ["You know how placing one chest next to another can form a double chest? Well Vaults are like that, but up to 81 vaults can be combined together. The catch? You can't look inside them directly. Get things in and out with Chutes, Hatches, Funnels, and Packagers. Tip: see the Inventory Ticker for Create's great take on a storage terminal."]
	quest.72EB399A714D6B45.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Item Vault"
	quest.72F47E08EC9820A4.quest_desc: ["Bring Thermoelectric Plate into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.72F47E08EC9820A4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thermoelectric Plate"
	quest.72F4D17AAB9039B0.quest_desc: ["This device spawns mobs using pressure, bypassing light-level restrictions and enabling redstone control. It requires a Spawner Core to function. Be aware that a partially empty Spawner Core will result in reduced efficiency."]
	quest.72F4D17AAB9039B0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pressurized Spawner"
	quest.7308408DF2D17B69.quest_desc: ["Shelves are the foundation of an Apothic Enchanting setup. There are 32 valid shelf positions around the table, and each shelf needs an air block between it and the table to count." "Eterna sets the available enchantment level and power. Quanta changes the enchantment pool, but too much makes weaker enchantments more likely. Arcana influences the rarity and quality of enchantments. Each shelf has its own Eterna cap, and anything above it is ignored." "Try different shelf combinations to find the right balance."]
	quest.7308408DF2D17B69.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.7308408DF2D17B69.title: "Bookshelves"
	quest.7309FF5CF1382CC4.quest_desc: ["Spiritfire is a special kind of flame that can transform some objects into others. You can make some by throwing a Demon's Dream fruit on the ground, and lighting it on fire. You can throw Andesite into it to receive Otherstone, and Oak Saplings to receive Otherworld Saplings."]
	quest.7309FF5CF1382CC4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Otherstone and Otherworld Sapling Natural"
	quest.7309FF5CF1382CC4.title: "Spiritfire"
	quest.731343AE541DE305.quest_desc: ["Alternative to the Quantum Ring. Has limited range of 1000 blocks, unlike the Quantum Ring."]
	quest.731343AE541DE305.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wireless Connect and Wireless Tool"
	quest.7317D61CCCC82396.quest_desc: ["Make the Crystalite Helmet with an Infusion Ritual using a Terminite Helmet, an Amber Gem and Crystal Shards around an Infusion Pedestal." "Wearing the full set gives permanent Regeneration I."]
	quest.7317D61CCCC82396.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Crystalite Helmet"
	quest.7317D61CCCC82396.title: "Crystalite Helmet"
	quest.731919B68976F65A.quest_desc: ["Bring Fruit Salad into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.731919B68976F65A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fruit Salad"
	quest.731E63F6EF9320ED.quest_desc: ["Bring Raw Iridium into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.731E63F6EF9320ED.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Raw Iridium"
	quest.731E63F6EF9320ED.title: "Diamond 2.0: Electric Boogaloo"
	quest.7329381EB18B221C.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: All Starlight Biomes."]
	quest.7329381EB18B221C.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: All Starlight Biomes"
	quest.7329381EB18B221C.title: "Starlight Explorer"
	quest.733E17B7A8D38AF8.quest_desc: ["Bring Emerald Seeds into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.733E17B7A8D38AF8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Emerald Seeds"
	quest.733E3A8C7B5AAC69.quest_desc: ["Bring Inferium Helmet, Inferium Chestplate, Inferium Leggings and Inferium Boots into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.733E3A8C7B5AAC69.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Inferium Helmet, Inferium Chestplate, Inferium Leggings and Inferium Boots"
	quest.733E3A8C7B5AAC69.title: "Inferium Armor"
	quest.73569C57D2719DF4.quest_desc: ["The Multimeter is a tool from Create: Dreams n' Desires for the mod's electrical systems. Use it to inspect electrical components and see how much power runs through your machinery."]
	quest.73569C57D2719DF4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Multimeter"
	quest.7368C5F4DEDE02DA.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Fluorite Seeds. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7368C5F4DEDE02DA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fluorite Seeds"
	quest.737205B6431E1110.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Crystal Spirited. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.737205B6431E1110.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Crystal Spirited"
	quest.73893F32A771FD27.quest_desc: ["Variants to find: Jungle, Nether, Icy and Desert."]
	quest.73893F32A771FD27.quest_subtitle: "Find all 4 Monument variants"
	quest.738E5EDA74096D71.quest_desc: ["The Pyromancer Hat is the headpiece of the Pyromancer Armor set in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. It gives +3 Armor, +125 Max Mana, +10% Fire Spell Power and +5% Spell Power." "Craft it from 5 Arcane Cloth and 1 Fire Rune, or upgrade a Wizard Helmet with 1 Fire Rune at a Smithing Table in newer versions."]
	quest.738E5EDA74096D71.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pyromancer Helmet"
	quest.73A6C0AE8DA146CA.quest_desc: ["Craft Runed Flavolite, a variant of Flavolite gathered in the Painted Mountains and inscribed for ritual use." "You need it to build the ring of an Eternal Portal, which takes you back to the Overworld from deep in the End."]
	quest.73A6C0AE8DA146CA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Flavolite Runed"
	quest.73A6C0AE8DA146CA.title: "Runed Flavolite"
	quest.73AE558310570B1A.quest_desc: ["Craft a spyglass from copper ingots and amethyst shards. It lets you zoom in on distant places."]
	quest.73AE558310570B1A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Spyglass"
	quest.73AE558310570B1A.title: "Spyglass"
	quest.73B0D3914092EC3E.quest_desc: ["Bring Configurable Honeycomb into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.73B0D3914092EC3E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.73CC91E6472B52C5.quest_desc: ["Ice Venom Vial is a crafting material in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. Refine Icy Fangs in an Alchemist Cauldron filled with water to make it." "It is used for strong Ice equipment, including the Frostbranded Book and Boreal Blade."]
	quest.73CC91E6472B52C5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ice Venom Vial"
	quest.73D03096609B274E.quest_desc: ["Bring Eclipsealloy Leggings into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.73D03096609B274E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Eclipsealloy Leggings"
	quest.73D44417EA546403.quest_desc: ["The Logic Press is used in an Inscriber to turn Gold into a Printed Logic Circuit. Presses are found in meteorites, and the Inscriber can duplicate one with an Iron Block."]
	quest.73F1D97AF9D33D65.quest_desc: ["Rechiseled adds additional decorative block variants. Browse its crafting options to find coordinated textures for your builds."]
	quest.73F1D97AF9D33D65.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.740753C7869E8F16.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Dragon Egg Seeds. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.740753C7869E8F16.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dragon Egg Seeds"
	quest.740CA0BB081DB68C.quest_desc: ["Construction Sticks helps place repeated blocks more quickly. Explore its placement behavior for walls, floors, and other building tasks."]
	quest.740CA0BB081DB68C.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.741A2E8C7E2BC6FD.quest_desc: ["Notable rituals: Binding turns special mobs into familiars. Containment traps entities in a Jar of Containment. Challenge summons a raid when used in a village. Flight grants creative flight within about 60 blocks. Summon Wilden summons wilden mobs, including the Chimera if augmented."]
	quest.741A2E8C7E2BC6FD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ritual Challenge, Ritual Binding, Ritual Flight and 6 more items"
	quest.741A2E8C7E2BC6FD.title: "Purple Tablets"
	quest.7420A81F7BDFF713.quest_desc: ["Dry Ice gives your reactor the best cooling."]
	quest.7420A81F7BDFF713.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dry Ice"
	quest.742522CCADD8D349.quest_desc: ["The most powerful controlled spirit of all, Marid offer many benefits to master summoners."]
	quest.742522CCADD8D349.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Book of Binding Marid"
	quest.7429C528F6279261.quest_desc: ["Search the Twilight Forest for everything that comes from trees: saplings, leaves, slabs and every other wood item. Craft it, loot it, or find it."]
	quest.7429C528F6279261.quest_subtitle: "Collect everything that comes from trees"
	quest.7432202F127281C8.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Smart Filter. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7432202F127281C8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.7432202F127281C8.title: "Leggins"
	quest.743D2FBBE95AE443.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Steel Wiremill. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.743D2FBBE95AE443.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Steel Wiremill"
	quest.743D2FBBE95AE443.title: "Neither a Wire nor a Mill"
	quest.743D6326A9572107.quest_desc: ["This cell can store radioactive chemicals, unlike the regular Chemical Storage Cell. Needs to be partitioned before you can use it."]
	quest.743D6326A9572107.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Radioactive Chemical Cell"
	quest.743FB39F466AD219.quest_desc: ["The Electric Bow works like the vanilla Bow and shoots normal Arrows. The difference is, that every shot doesn't damage, but discharges the bow. If the internal energy storage is empty, the bow doesn't work and needs to be recharged e.g. on a Basic Energy Cube."]
	quest.743FB39F466AD219.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Electric Bow"
	quest.744A46E122AAB6FE.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.744A46E122AAB6FE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Harvest"
	quest.744BA04736CC3AA9.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Rose Gum Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.744BA04736CC3AA9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rose Gum Sapling"
	quest.745A895DB39AB45F.quest_desc: ["Smelts 192 items."]
	quest.745A895DB39AB45F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Insanium Coal"
	quest.745BF52B10A54F77.quest_desc: ["The Minoshroom, a mix of minotaur and mushroom, rules the underground Labyrinth of the Twilight Forest." "Reaching it means getting through the maze, its traps and its monsters. Defeating it rewards you with valuable loot and opens the way to harder challenges."]
	quest.745BF52B10A54F77.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Minoshroom"
	quest.745BF52B10A54F77.title: "Minoshroom"
	quest.745C8130B75C03F6.quest_desc: ["Can by Dyed and Trimmed! Toggle Creative Flight by pressing N."]
	quest.745C8130B75C03F6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Nano Gravichestplate"
	quest.74686F4B403A0336.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Watching Warglaive. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.74686F4B403A0336.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Watching Warglaive"
	quest.747A44CBD0D9D80F.quest_desc: ["Rare resources take more effort to find or to create, and are in some cases not found in nature."]
	quest.747A44CBD0D9D80F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Alchemical Sulfur Platinum, Alchemical Sulfur Silver, Alchemical Sulfur Uranium and 5 more items"
	quest.747A44CBD0D9D80F.title: "Rare Sulfurs"
	quest.74887E460F06E36B.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.74887E460F06E36B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Craft"
	quest.74922CD545618585.quest_desc: ["The Cooking Table is where you prepare food using ingredients from the kitchen blocks around it."]
	quest.74922CD545618585.quest_subtitle: "The heart of your kitchen"
	quest.749B136F98C186D0.quest_desc: ["Make the Warden Mage Leggings in a Mechanical Crafter using a Netherite Mage Leggings from Iron's Spells, Echo Ingots, Warden Carapace, a Reinforced Echo Shard and a Warden Upgrade Template." "Spell power and upgrades from the netherite piece are not kept."]
	quest.749B136F98C186D0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Warden Mage Leggings"
	quest.74A344692DDC46B8.quest_desc: ["This machine uses advanced technology to compress items down to atomic size, allowing it to access and manipulate a player’s inventory directly. Items can be input and output via hoppers, and they will be added to or removed from the inventory of the player who placed the machine. You can also use smarter insertion methods, such as Drones or Logistics Frames, or other mods, to automatically manage the player's inventory, like keeping it stocked with 64 torches, for instance."]
	quest.74A344692DDC46B8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Aerial Interface"
	quest.74A946BAD3F975DF.quest_desc: ["Pay attention: it might make one thing on a Depot, and another in a Basin."]
	quest.74A946BAD3F975DF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mechanical Press"
	quest.74BF5D78022B1402.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Steel Ingot. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.74BF5D78022B1402.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Steel Ingot"
	quest.74C2921884820E96.quest_desc: ["Aviar's Circle is the first pentacle you will prepare. It is for summoning Foliot. Refer to the Dictionary of Spirits for how to lay it out."]
	quest.74C2921884820E96.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chalk White, Smart Filter, Golden Sacrificial Bowl and 6x Sacrificial Bowl"
	quest.74C2921884820E96.title: "Aviar's Circle"
	quest.74C90AF76F9F39E4.quest_desc: ["Use it to fill your moat, drain a swamp, pump water or lava without limit."]
	quest.74C90AF76F9F39E4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Hose Pulley"
	quest.74CE4975DD8CAE61.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Giant Takoyaki. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.74CE4975DD8CAE61.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Giant Takoyaki"
	quest.74DC153CDFBA4270.quest_desc: ["The Steel Alloy Smelter allows you to create alloys from two different ingots without needing to mix the dusts in a Mixer first. Check your EMI to see which alloys can be made this way. You can also use any combination of equal amounts of resources to create an alloy, such as nine tiny dust + nine nuggets. What you cannot do is nine tiny dust + one ingot, as the amounts are different."]
	quest.74DC153CDFBA4270.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Steel Alloy Smelter"
	quest.74E85AA325F1FA7D.quest_desc: ["A unique axe dropped by the Minoshroom."]
	quest.74E85AA325F1FA7D.quest_subtitle: "Get the Diamond Minotaur Axe"
	quest.74EC653C3DFF15EB.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Balsam Fir Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.74EC653C3DFF15EB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Balsam Fir Sapling"
	quest.74FEE5E4E73AE4D8.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Rotten Spell Book. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.74FEE5E4E73AE4D8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rotten Spell Book"
	quest.7505D3C0A8577B60.quest_desc: ["Chemical Tanks are Mekanism's batteries for storing Gases. They can be placed as a block and do interact with Pressurized Tubes. They come in the four levels, each increasing the storage capacity and output rate."]
	quest.7505D3C0A8577B60.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ultimate Chemical Tank"
	quest.750AD0EAFD7AC8E6.quest_desc: ["Bring Pacific Halibut into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.750AD0EAFD7AC8E6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pacific Halibut"
	quest.751144D1292A6218.quest_desc: ["Crush a Gem with an Anvil in the world to turn it into Gem Dust. Once you have crushed a few, you can use the Salvaging Table instead."]
	quest.751144D1292A6218.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gem Dust and Anvil"
	quest.75128491D856EC48.quest_desc: ["Bring Baked Cod Stew into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.75128491D856EC48.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Baked Cod Stew"
	quest.751D857F2D3C4799.quest_desc: ["A step up in speed and fuel efficiency from the lower tiers."]
	quest.751D857F2D3C4799.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gold Furnace"
	quest.752D6FA1C0B8E30F.quest_desc: ["Point 2 Point (P2P) Tunnels can be overwhelmingly complex, but at the same time extremely useful. These tunnels can be used to transfer up to 32 channels from one point to the other. But it's wildly inefficient. Those 32 channels get compacted into a single channel. This means, you can theoretically wire up 1,024 channels through a single dense cable, instead of only 32. You'll have to use the Memory Card to link up the tunnels together via frequencies. Shift-Right-Clicking on the \"entrace\" tunnel will set the memory card to that frequency. Right-Clicking on the \"exit\" tunnel with set the tunnel to the frequency of the \"entrance\" one. Keep in mind, you can have multiple \"exit\" tunnels so long as the total channels used between them don't go beyond the number of channels entered into the \"entrance\" tunnel. There are also different types of Point 2 Point Tunnels. Aside from one that carries ME Channels, there are ones that transfer raw power, fluids, items, light, and even redstone! They work the same way, aside from carrying channels. It takes some practice to use, so experiment with them first. Once you get the hang of it, your ME System will be looking more than professional!"]
	quest.752D6FA1C0B8E30F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Me P2p Tunnel"
	quest.752D6FA1C0B8E30F.title: "P2P"
	quest.75389E3F80712BE4.quest_desc: ["Copper Rod, Iron Rod and Gold Rod are the basic metal rods of Create Crafts and Additions. Make them in the Rolling Mill, where one ingot gives 2 rods." "They are crafting parts for the mod's electrical items, including wires, spools and connectors."]
	quest.75389E3F80712BE4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Copper Rod, Iron Rod and Gold Rod"
	quest.7569E5A18129C681.quest_desc: ["Chemical Tanks are Mekanism's batteries for storing Gases. They can be placed as a block and do interact with Pressurized Tubes. They come in the four levels, each increasing the storage capacity and output rate."]
	quest.7569E5A18129C681.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Chemical Tank"
	quest.757395B08E2C21B5.quest_desc: ["The turbine is a multiblock added by Mekanism that can generate a load of power using steam. Steam can be created in various ways. Both reactors are a decent way, but you may, also, use the Boiler to create steam."]
	quest.757395B08E2C21B5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Turbine Casing"
	quest.7574A64692A5C7A6.quest_desc: ["Now you can make a large tank! This is a tank multi-block that can store 64,000mb per block within the total volume the tank takes up, air blocks and solid. When you place down a Large Tank, open its GUI and check out the top left. It'll let you choose which size you want. Once you've chosen, hold out your trusty wrench and a hologram will show you where to place blocks. Use a Large Tank Hatch too. It works just like other hatches, aside from it only being a point of access to the tank. It'll input and output from any hatches you put on it."]
	quest.7574A64692A5C7A6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Large Tank and Large Tank Hatch"
	quest.7591056997C2F9D1.quest_desc: ["The Ur-Ghast waits atop the Dark Tower, which is filled with machines, traps and servants." "It stays out of reach, circling above the arena and firing explosive fireballs. Patience and good timing help, since you need to lure it into range before attacking. Beating it is a major step in the Twilight Forest."]
	quest.7591056997C2F9D1.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Ur Ghast"
	quest.7591056997C2F9D1.title: "UrGhast"
	quest.75AE6FD1F735AFA7.quest_desc: ["An Ancient Temple lies hidden deep in the Otherside." "Inside you will find haunted pots and a secret chest with rare loot."]
	quest.75AE6FD1F735AFA7.title: "Ancient Temple"
	quest.75D770DAAB018140.quest_desc: ["Reduces the probability of taking any damage by 25% for each piece of the Quantum Armor Set."]
	quest.75D770DAAB018140.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Quantum Chestplate"
	quest.75D770DAAB018140.title: "Quantum Immortality"
	quest.75E71375DDC9767B.quest_desc: ["The Pyromancer Robe is the chestpiece of the Pyromancer Armor set in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. It gives +8 Armor, +125 Max Mana, +10% Fire Spell Power and +5% Spell Power, and can hold 1 imbued spell." "Craft it from 8 Arcane Cloth and 1 Fire Rune, or upgrade Wizard Robes with 1 Fire Rune at a Smithing Table."]
	quest.75E71375DDC9767B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pyromancer Chestplate"
	quest.75ED69E18231F41C.quest_desc: ["The Stainless Steel Drill is a new drill that can be used in both the Quarry and the Oil Drilling Rig. For the quarry, you'll obtain some new rare resources that will be extremely beneficial for the future. In the drilling rig, you'll be able to pump out Shale Oil which can be distilled into Helium, Sulfuric Crude Oil, and Sulfuric Naphtha."]
	quest.75ED69E18231F41C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 4x Stainless Steel Drill"
	quest.75ED69E18231F41C.title: "Stainless Steel Drill"
	quest.76038E770204018C.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Brimstone Claymore. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.76038E770204018C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Brimstone Claymore"
	quest.760BA24623B42810.quest_desc: ["A shield is essential for defense. It blocks many attacks, including arrows and melee damage." "Craft one to get through dangerous fights."]
	quest.760BA24623B42810.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Shield"
	quest.7615DDC3B658B31C.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Configurable Honeycomb. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7615DDC3B658B31C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.76189167938C3130.quest_desc: ["Burns honey to produce power. Honey can be piped in, or honey bottles, blocks and buckets can be added in the GUI. It accepts two upgrades: Productivity lowers honey consumption, and Speed raises the output speed."]
	quest.76189167938C3130.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Honey Generator"
	quest.761C32656BB95304.quest_desc: ["An Induction battery is a large, long-term, multiblock battery that, depending on what's inside it, can store a massive amount of power."]
	quest.761C32656BB95304.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 32x Induction Casing, 2x Induction Port and Structural Glass"
	quest.7627C14240D3C503.quest_desc: ["The Ender Library is the upgraded Enchantment Library, with a much higher level limit. Stored enchantments are kept when you upgrade." "Infuse a Library with 100 Eterna, 100% Arcana and Quanta between 45% and 50%. It is the true endgame of enchanting."]
	quest.7627C14240D3C503.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ender Library"
	quest.762E163EFBE44BBF.quest_desc: ["Bring Ferricore Leggings into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.762E163EFBE44BBF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ferricore Leggings"
	quest.763A2390A719BA47.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Upgrade Silver. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.763A2390A719BA47.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Upgrade Silver"
	quest.763D64561B2BA06B.quest_desc: ["Used for crafting wands, rituals and decoration. Archwood trees generate randomly in the world, and Archwood Saplings can also be bought at the Market from Farming for Blockheads."]
	quest.763D64561B2BA06B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blue Archwood Log, Purple Archwood Log, Green Archwood Log and Red Archwood Log"
	quest.763EA2539F967175.quest_desc: ["The Productivity upgrade will increase the number of combs a bee produces per trip."]
	quest.763EA2539F967175.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Upgrade Productivity 2"
	quest.763F16245FAEF950.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Item Storage Cell 256m. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.763F16245FAEF950.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Item Storage Cell 256m"
	quest.763FC9996A56D0AC.quest_desc: ["Make a smooth Vanilla Milkshake as another classic drink for your factory. Combine the ingredients and let Create: Dreams n' Desires handle the mixing."]
	quest.763FC9996A56D0AC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Vanilla Milkshake"
	quest.764476D35A55D9C6.quest_desc: ["Now that you're producing energy in the medium voltage tier, you'll need to make sure your machines can accept that new found power. Normally, cables will not even connect to machines if they aren't of the same tier. But, by placing an Advanced Machine Hull (or higher tier) into the slot in the top right of the machine, you'll have upgraded the machine to the tier of power it associates with it. By default, electric machines are already at the Basic Machine Hull tier and there is no need to put Basic Machine Hulls into the slot. Make sure you check for which machines actually need the upgrades so you aren't wasting resources on machines that don't really need the extra boost."]
	quest.764476D35A55D9C6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Machine Hull"
	quest.764476D35A55D9C6.title: "Hull Upgrades"
	quest.764EA020E2F6DF14.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Vegetable Soup. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.764EA020E2F6DF14.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Vegetable Soup"
	quest.765420594DC733D1.quest_desc: ["Bring Solar Panel Nitro into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.765420594DC733D1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Solar Panel Nitro"
	quest.76591A558118A7F9.quest_desc: ["The Aethersent Cape is crafted from Aethersent Ingots in Eternal Starlight." "It is part of the Aethersent armor set, tied to meteors and celestial materials found in the dimension."]
	quest.76591A558118A7F9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Aethersent Cape"
	quest.765F1F306BC7545D.quest_desc: ["Lets the wearer move freely in water."]
	quest.765F1F306BC7545D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Charm of Sinking"
	quest.7666ACA6FB7791F7.quest_desc: ["Bring Capacitor Niotic into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7666ACA6FB7791F7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Capacitor Niotic"
	quest.766ADA1FCA0604EC.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Celestigem Pickaxe. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.766ADA1FCA0604EC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Celestigem Pickaxe"
	quest.7677C5A5173195DE.quest_desc: ["Steeleaf is found in Labyrinth, Hollow Hill and Dark Tower chests. As a tool or armor it is as strong as diamond but less durable than iron."]
	quest.7677C5A5173195DE.quest_subtitle: "Get some Steeleaf"
	quest.768A0ADC0567A5CA.quest_desc: ["Expands the inventory of the shulker box."]
	quest.768A0ADC0567A5CA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gold Shulker Box"
	quest.769A0CE4777F8826.quest_desc: ["Simple version: breaks blocks, using a tool if you give it one, with speed and orientation controls and optional redstone sensitivity. Advanced version: adds filtering and offset AOE, and needs power."]
	quest.769A0CE4777F8826.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.76C6A4FE76850ADA.quest_desc: ["Obtain a Zinc Ingot from Create by smelting Zinc Ore or Crushed Zinc Ore." "Combined with Copper, Zinc makes Brass, a key material for more advanced Create machinery and logistics."]
	quest.76C6A4FE76850ADA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Zinc Ingot"
	quest.76D07EE5DAFEA90D.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Honeycomb Ghostly. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.76D07EE5DAFEA90D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Honeycomb Ghostly"
	quest.76D2482C90266C3D.quest_desc: ["Adds a blast furnace to the backpack."]
	quest.76D2482C90266C3D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blasting Upgrade"
	quest.76E4F68C80148028.quest_desc: ["Obtain a Turntable from Create. When it has rotational power, it spins entities standing on it, including players and armor stands." "It is crafted from a Shaft and a Wooden Slab."]
	quest.76E4F68C80148028.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Turntable"
	quest.76E9C42F3D4011D0.quest_desc: ["Bring Configurable Honeycomb into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.76E9C42F3D4011D0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.76F76B9C1EE6DB62.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.76F76B9C1EE6DB62.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Ignite"
	quest.76FE0ED2B314DE22.quest_desc: ["Nuclear Waste can be processed in an Isotropic Centrifuge to make Plutonium. The Plutonium can be used to make a pellet. The pellet is used to make casing for another machine, or, reprocessed into more fuel."]
	quest.76FE0ED2B314DE22.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pellet Plutonium"
	quest.76FE4D9FF7B2DEC9.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Rabbit Seeds. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.76FE4D9FF7B2DEC9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rabbit Seeds"
	quest.771E4279E4352BC1.quest_desc: ["Bring Player Transmitter Niotic into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.771E4279E4352BC1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Player Transmitter Niotic"
	quest.77299101A3B86FAD.quest_desc: ["Scylla can drop the rare Music Disc Scylla after her defeat." "It plays “Scylla” by Rotch Gwylt, the music from the Storm Empress fight."]
	quest.77299101A3B86FAD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Music Disc Scylla"
	quest.772AD8376DD7E3DE.quest_desc: ["An upgrade already? Trying to take your house with you? Good idea! Tents tend to hurt backs."]
	quest.772AD8376DD7E3DE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Spatial Cell Component 16"
	quest.772AD8376DD7E3DE.title: "Medium Spatial Component"
	quest.7737C72546226B32.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.7737C72546226B32.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Injecting Factory"
	quest.7746747CC50E3F1B.quest_desc: ["Bring Ring of Thrift into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7746747CC50E3F1B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ring of Thrift"
	quest.7752170CD763C9D9.quest_desc: ["Defeat Apothecarist."]
	quest.7752170CD763C9D9.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Apothecarist"
	quest.775B1ED6F9A4EC5A.quest_desc: ["Ignites its target. Be cautious, it can also set fire to the surrounding environment!"]
	quest.775B1ED6F9A4EC5A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gun Ammo Incendiary"
	quest.776090CBC143782E.quest_desc: ["Obtain a Wand of Symmetry from Create. It mirrors blocks you place or break across a chosen axis or pattern." "It offers Mirror Once, Rectangular and Octagonal modes, which suit symmetrical builds and large structures. Its default range is 50 blocks."]
	quest.776090CBC143782E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wand of Symmetry"
	quest.776290E451C33C1A.quest_desc: ["Bring Kinetic Belt into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.776290E451C33C1A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Kinetic Belt"
	quest.777D3B19A9CC26E9.quest_desc: ["Craft a Black Steel Targe from Cataclysm. This sturdy shield gives reliable protection against strong enemies and belongs to the Black Steel set."]
	quest.777D3B19A9CC26E9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Black Steel Targe"
	quest.7780ED6483FC9986.quest_desc: ["Time for that beautifully shining Orange Ingot? You'll need to grab some of the Copper and Tin dust you get from the Forge Hammer to make it. It's a simple mixture of 3:1 Copper to Tin in your crafting grid. Once you progress, you'll find a way to produce this mixture more efficiently since you're spilling some dust making it on hand. Remember that Steam Machines will accept inputs from any side, be it items, steam or another fluid. You can lock their slots by clicking on the padlock looking button in the interface. Locked slots will make sure the machine only accepts one type of item or fluid per slot. Every machine has an output side as well, and you can enable auto-output from inside the interface. Using your trusty Wrench you can adjust the output side with ease! If you don't want so many items in the slots at a time, use that Scroll Wheel of yours to adjust the maximum number of items stored at a time. P.S. Right clicking on a steam machine with gunpowder will double it's speed and steam consumption. Keep that in mind when looking at recipes. That gunpowder may just save you a trip to hell."]
	quest.7780ED6483FC9986.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 16x Bronze Ingot"
	quest.7780ED6483FC9986.title: "Your First Bronze"
	quest.7781942B1A14BD68.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Configurable Honeycomb. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7781942B1A14BD68.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.778ABC2270839133.quest_desc: ["The chestplate of the Fiery armor set. Together with the leggings, it unlocks the helmet."]
	quest.778D8C6EA2C66267.quest_desc: ["Screw a house, take your entire lair with you! But be warned, it won't be cheap!"]
	quest.778D8C6EA2C66267.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Spatial Cell Component 128"
	quest.778D8C6EA2C66267.title: "Large Spatial Component"
	quest.779AE73897718D2F.quest_desc: ["Bring Celestigem Chestplate into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.779AE73897718D2F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Celestigem Chestplate"
	quest.77A9AB166FA8A789.quest_desc: ["The boiler needs an input and output for the water and steam. Depending on how you're using the boiler, you may, also, need 2 more valves for coolant exchange. Begin with a 3x3 layer of casings. Then place the heating element in the center. Surround that in casings or reactor glass. The edges must be casings. Build another layer of casings with the pressure disperser on top of the heating element. Then cover it all up to with more casings. Mekanism has a decent Wiki if you have trouble with the structure."]
	quest.77A9AB166FA8A789.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 2x Boiler Valve, 32x Boiler Casing, 2x Reactor Glass and 2 more items"
	quest.77C87D1B3D283583.quest_desc: ["Bring Brown Amber Sapling into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.77C87D1B3D283583.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Brown Amber Sapling"
	quest.77F510BC1BD66741.quest_desc: ["The VoidShift Wand has Air Burst up to strength 4 and Void Shift, which teleports you up to 15 blocks."]
	quest.77F510BC1BD66741.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Voidshift Wand"
	quest.77F5E3CBD8F6CC37.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Horse Feed. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.77F5E3CBD8F6CC37.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Horse Feed"
	quest.77FDFD4FD5C46D39.quest_desc: ["Honey Treats calm angry bees and make baby bees grow up faster. They can also be combined with genes to transfer genetics from one bee to another."]
	quest.77FDFD4FD5C46D39.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Honey Treat"
	quest.780CD81B1FCC5D06.quest_desc: ["Make a Strawberry Milkshake, a refreshing fruit drink for your production line. Mix the required ingredients to get this sweet creation from Create: Dreams n' Desires."]
	quest.780CD81B1FCC5D06.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Strawberry Milkshake"
	quest.780EF8B9FD6437F4.quest_desc: ["You also need 2 unique legendary fish and 2 unique golden fish for the Gold Trophy."]
	quest.780EF8B9FD6437F4.quest_subtitle: "Catch 100 fish in total"
	quest.7817F46D48C398E2.quest_desc: ["Simple version: works in pairs and swaps blocks, air included. Entities teleport on their own. Has redstone sensitivity options. Advanced version: adds filtering and offset AOE, and needs power."]
	quest.7817F46D48C398E2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.78259DA399CD3333.quest_desc: ["Forge the Terminite Ingot in an End Stone Smeltery by combining a Thallasium Ingot (or Iron Ingot) with End Dust." "You can also rarely find it in Better End structures. It is used for stronger tools, armor and anvils."]
	quest.78259DA399CD3333.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Terminite Ingot"
	quest.782883242EF18A65.quest_desc: ["Tier 3 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.782883242EF18A65.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Glide"
	quest.782E726D920AB09C.quest_desc: ["(but really, with this you can transfer fluids to or from mobile contraptions and trains)."]
	quest.782E726D920AB09C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Portable Fluid Interface"
	quest.78335834458025F1.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Inductor. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.78335834458025F1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Inductor"
	quest.78335834458025F1.title: "The L in RLC"
	quest.78350B4B6E39910E.quest_desc: ["Bring Roast Chicken Block into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.78350B4B6E39910E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Roast Chicken Block"
	quest.78399D60F97240DC.quest_desc: ["Bring Configurable Honeycomb into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.78399D60F97240DC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.784334FD0614CDF0.quest_desc: ["This is standard Minigun Ammo with no special properties. However, it can be crafted with a Potion to imbue the Ammo with the potion's effects."]
	quest.784334FD0614CDF0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gun Ammo"
	quest.784E88D88936B5FF.quest_desc: ["Assemble the Terminite Sword from a Terminite tool head and sword handle at a Smithing Table. It improves on the Thallasium sword." "It leads toward Better End's stronger Aeternium sword."]
	quest.784E88D88936B5FF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Terminite Sword"
	quest.7867CF2DB8DC10A5.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Almond Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7867CF2DB8DC10A5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Almond Sapling"
	quest.786D1CD2CAA19D15.quest_desc: ["The Logic Processor is made in an Inscriber from a Printed Logic Circuit, Printed Silicon and Redstone. It is used for buses, terminals and more."]
	quest.787A726BEEC0BB74.quest_desc: ["Craft any Rune that goes best with the magic armor or upgrade orb that you want."]
	quest.787A726BEEC0BB74.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.788432F711B73CB5.quest_desc: ["Shadow-Walker Boots are part of the Shadow-Walker Armor set in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. They give +3 Armor, +125 Max Mana, +10% Ender Spell Power and +5% Spell Power." "Craft them from 4 Arcane Cloth and 1 Ender Rune, or upgrade Wizard Boots with 1 Ender Rune at a Smithing Table in supported versions."]
	quest.788432F711B73CB5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Shadowwalker Boots"
	quest.78940B88116D45F4.quest_desc: ["Bring Ceylon Ebony Sapling into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.78940B88116D45F4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ceylon Ebony Sapling"
	quest.7897E36F8F23152C.quest_desc: ["Create has trains. You need Sturdy Sheets to get started with them."]
	quest.7897E36F8F23152C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sturdy Sheet"
	quest.789A10860CF32379.quest_desc: ["Find an Elytra on an End Ship. These wings let you glide, which makes crossing the End's scattered islands much easier." "It is also the base for Better End's Armored and Crystalite elytra."]
	quest.789A10860CF32379.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Elytra"
	quest.789A10860CF32379.title: "Elytra"
	quest.78A0AC192B39D776.quest_desc: ["Simple version: places blocks, with speed and orientation controls and optional redstone sensitivity. Advanced version: adds filtering and offset AOE, and needs power."]
	quest.78A0AC192B39D776.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.78B0C026C3A8AAEA.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Configurable Honeycomb. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.78B0C026C3A8AAEA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.78C2C746DCFC3174.quest_desc: ["The Experience Lantern from Create: Enchantment Industry absorbs experience from players and nearby XP orbs." "It can also act as an actor on Create contraptions, so you can automate XP collection and feed it into your processing setup."]
	quest.78C2C746DCFC3174.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Experience Lantern"
	quest.78C4FC782DA6BB39.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Polarizer. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.78C4FC782DA6BB39.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Polarizer"
	quest.78C4FC782DA6BB39.title: "One Recipe (+2) To Rule Them All"
	quest.78C5BB7457C5BAE4.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Archmage Glove. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.78C5BB7457C5BAE4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Archmage Glove"
	quest.78CBBFEB45DC3232.quest_desc: ["Provides an occasional positive potion effect that last a little bit."]
	quest.78CBBFEB45DC3232.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Belt of Unstable Gifts"
	quest.78DB487D39F4F5E4.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Mechanical Piston. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.78DB487D39F4F5E4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mechanical Piston"
	quest.78E93EEB139A2DCF.quest_desc: ["Lets redstone control the spawner. Useful for switches, timers and farm control."]
	quest.78E93EEB139A2DCF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Redstone Control Spawner Rune"
	quest.78E93EEB139A2DCF.title: "Redstone Control Spawner Rune"
	quest.78EE71687E06BB0D.quest_desc: ["Once you have mastered the basics, you can move on to working with Djinn, intermediate-level spirits."]
	quest.78EE71687E06BB0D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Book of Binding Djinni"
	quest.78F90F3D296FE242.quest_desc: ["The Meat Shredder from Cataclysm is a powerful weapon tied to The Harbinger." "It ignores the normal damage invulnerability time of enemies, which makes it especially effective against Cataclysm bosses."]
	quest.78F90F3D296FE242.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Meat Shredder"
	quest.78F90F3D296FE242.title: "Meat Shredder"
	quest.78FEBD362F77ED53.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Bronze Mixer. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.78FEBD362F77ED53.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bronze Mixer"
	quest.7908B7140D3968AC.quest_desc: ["Pressurized Tubes are a way of transporting types of gas, such as steam, hydrogen, and oxygen. Transfer Rate: 2,000 mb/t."]
	quest.7908B7140D3968AC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Pressurized Tube"
	quest.791FBB3174C61904.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Assembler. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.791FBB3174C61904.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Assembler"
	quest.791FBB3174C61904.title: "Avengers, Assemble!"
	quest.792702F585B4AC44.quest_desc: ["Primogel Goo turns Iron Blocks into Raw Ferricore. Place the Iron Blocks on either side of the goo and feed it by right-clicking it with Rotten Flesh or Sugar. The item a goo block accepts is shown on any side of the block."]
	quest.792702F585B4AC44.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Iron Block, 2x Raw Ferricore and 2x Ferricore Ingot"
	quest.792702F585B4AC44.title: "Making Ferricore"
	quest.7928F7C6539606C1.quest_desc: ["Bring Tertium Gemstone into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7928F7C6539606C1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Tertium Gemstone"
	quest.7944DB1550E8A68B.quest_desc: ["Free Runners are an item that allows players to ascend 1-block inclines automatically (like the Horse), as well as preventing fall damage as long as they are charged. A fall will reduce the item's charge, depending on how far the fall was."]
	quest.7944DB1550E8A68B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Free Runners"
	quest.794841B00C233CDE.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Whitebeam Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.794841B00C233CDE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Whitebeam Sapling"
	quest.7949F86C9FF11AE1.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Jackfruit Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7949F86C9FF11AE1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Jackfruit Sapling"
	quest.794C2D0B1870C833.quest_desc: ["Bring Soulpyre into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.794C2D0B1870C833.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Soulpyre"
	quest.794E82A9D10A4F25.quest_desc: ["Lets the wearer breathe underwater."]
	quest.794E82A9D10A4F25.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Snorkel"
	quest.79765BEC0A6FD693.quest_desc: ["Tier 2 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.79765BEC0A6FD693.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Pierce"
	quest.798931F2FBCE7245.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Implosion Compressor. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.798931F2FBCE7245.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Implosion Compressor"
	quest.798931F2FBCE7245.title: "Automated Creeper"
	quest.7994E33730AB8D3D.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Smart Filter. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7994E33730AB8D3D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.79AA4BDCE68B2106.quest_desc: ["Bring Energy Cell Starter into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.79AA4BDCE68B2106.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Cell Starter"
	quest.79C02189B9A6C0AB.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Upgrade Crystal. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.79C02189B9A6C0AB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Upgrade Crystal"
	quest.79C48188CA2E69E5.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Nuclear Reactor. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.79C48188CA2E69E5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Nuclear Reactor"
	quest.79C48188CA2E69E5.title: "3.6 Roentgen"
	quest.79DBC6A0539ADA92.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Charged Redstone. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.79DBC6A0539ADA92.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Charged Redstone"
	quest.79E0A15A0FBCD2CC.quest_desc: ["The Liquefaction Cauldron soaks resources in solvent to produce Sulfur from them. Heat is required for the reaction. Note that some resources, like ores, produce more than one sulfur."]
	quest.79E0A15A0FBCD2CC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Liquefaction Cauldron"
	quest.7A0B0655724B1A23.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Chompolotl. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7A0B0655724B1A23.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chompolotl"
	quest.7A11E6F38D301E68.quest_desc: ["Sophisticated Storage offers a Shulker Box that is compact and portable, which makes carrying large amounts of items easy." "It supports Sophisticated Storage upgrades, so you can tailor it to your needs."]
	quest.7A11E6F38D301E68.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Shulker Box"
	quest.7A23CAFFDF33BEA7.quest_desc: ["The Charging Station transfers energy at 4000 FE/t."]
	quest.7A23CAFFDF33BEA7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Charging Station"
	quest.7A2423E7722019B9.quest_desc: ["The Chemical Injection Chamber uses Hydrogen Chloride gas to turn ores into 4 Shards. It is the start of x4 ore processing and requires a steady supply of Hydrogen Chloride, which in turn requires the player to have a Thermal Evaporation Plant running. It can also turn Water Vapor and Dirt into Clay. Like most Mekanism machines, the Chemical Injection Chamber has a Factory block of itself."]
	quest.7A2423E7722019B9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chemical Injection Chamber"
	quest.7A26B9373A0083F6.quest_desc: ["Craft the Ignitium Boots from Cataclysm using Ignitium." "They give excellent protection for the Nether and belong to the Ignitium armor set."]
	quest.7A26B9373A0083F6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ignitium Boots"
	quest.7A3E635BE3DB601B.quest_desc: ["Generates power from coal at 200 FE/t."]
	quest.7A3E635BE3DB601B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Furnator Hardened"
	quest.7A454EFA49F742A9.quest_desc: ["Bring Pigment Extractor into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7A454EFA49F742A9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pigment Extractor"
	quest.7A4B0862BC8E8B44.quest_desc: ["This module emits a redstone signal with strength proportional to the pressure within the tubes. When equipped with a Module Expansion Card, you can precisely adjust the threshold through the GUI."]
	quest.7A4B0862BC8E8B44.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pressure Gauge Module"
	quest.7A610F5F4F61052F.quest_desc: ["Bring Battery Nitro into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7A610F5F4F61052F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Battery Nitro"
	quest.7A65EC2241F7D9A4.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: Hill2."]
	quest.7A65EC2241F7D9A4.quest_subtitle: "Defeat a Redcap Sapper in a medium Hollow Hill"
	quest.7A815B50256D0495.quest_desc: ["Digs 4 surrounding holes to bedrock."]
	quest.7A815B50256D0495.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ritual Burrowing"
	quest.7A827B8762AEDD2A.quest_desc: ["Bring Dirt Seeds into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7A827B8762AEDD2A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dirt Seeds"
	quest.7A8384D46BAE8FF5.quest_desc: ["Epic Ink is the fourth tier of magical ink in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. It is used in the Scroll Forge to make Epic-rarity spell scrolls and to upgrade spells that require Epic Ink." "It can be found in magic structures or obtained from powerful magical creatures."]
	quest.7A8384D46BAE8FF5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Epic Ink"
	quest.7A8384D46BAE8FF5.title: "Epic Ink"
	quest.7A8CAC086FAA7CE5.quest_desc: ["The Leather Handle Attachment Smithing Template attaches a leather-wrapped stick to a tool head at the Smithing Table." "It is a cheaper, early way to assemble Better End tools before better handles are available."]
	quest.7A8CAC086FAA7CE5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Leather Handle Attachment Smithing Template"
	quest.7A93861BF8725930.quest_desc: ["For the Ultimate Laser Drill: It can be dyed! Press Left Shift + Right Button to swap between Fortune/Looting and Silk Touch. Use Alt + Mouse Scroll to change mining speed. Press Y while held or Right Button while hovered to toggle 3x3 mining."]
	quest.7A93861BF8725930.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ultimate Laser Drill"
	quest.7AA203EE4AC1BDC6.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Drone. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7AA203EE4AC1BDC6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Drone"
	quest.7AA4B0C6C47F4EE6.quest_desc: ["Craft Thallasium Boots from Thallasium Plating at a Smithing Table." "They finish the first full set of Better End armor."]
	quest.7AA4B0C6C47F4EE6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thallasium Boots"
	quest.7AB6C567359CD276.quest_desc: ["Bring Hotdog With Nether Salad into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7AB6C567359CD276.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Hotdog With Nether Salad"
	quest.7ABBA78E7A372CF3.quest_desc: ["Thermodynamic Conductors are a way of transporting heat. Insulation: 100,000."]
	quest.7ABBA78E7A372CF3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ultimate Thermodynamic Conductor"
	quest.7ACCA47E786F55A8.quest_desc: ["The Boreal Blade is a powerful Ice greatsword in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. It holds 1 imbued spell and comes with Frostbite III. In the main hand it gives 16 Attack Damage and 0.9 Attack Speed." "Frostbite III deals 8 Shatter Damage, lasts 30 seconds, costs 100 Mana and has a 30-second cooldown. It is crafted from Mithril and Ice Venom, so expect it later in the game."]
	quest.7ACCA47E786F55A8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Boreal Blade"
	quest.7AD2B13E09B38A37.quest_desc: ["Plagued Leggings are part of the Plagued Armor set in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. They give +6 Armor, +125 Max Mana, +10% Nature Spell Power and +5% Spell Power." "Upgrade Wizard Leggings with 1 Nature Rune and 1 Arcane Essence to make them."]
	quest.7AD2B13E09B38A37.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Plagued Leggings"
	quest.7ADC323CDD2E4AE9.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Pulsar Mantle. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7ADC323CDD2E4AE9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pulsar Mantle"
	quest.7AF77CA6AE4007D7.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.7AF77CA6AE4007D7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Purifying Factory"
	quest.7AF9291C0B6298A8.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Machinesettingscopier. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7AF9291C0B6298A8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Machinesettingscopier"
	quest.7AFB788840FB6C5E.quest_desc: ["Link 7 furnaces and keep them all smelting at once to generate power. It produces 50,000 RF/t while active."]
	quest.7AFB788840FB6C5E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Million Furnace"
	quest.7AFB788840FB6C5E.title: "Rainbow Furnace"
	quest.7AFDBDA8E91A6750.quest_desc: ["Increases attack speed."]
	quest.7AFDBDA8E91A6750.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Feral Claws"
	quest.7B05CE60CD513FB2.quest_desc: ["Upgrade a Soul-Touched Deepshelf with a Warden Tendril, a Sculk Catalyst and Sculk." "It gives +10 Eterna (up to 80), +15 Quanta, +10 Arcana and +1 Clue."]
	quest.7B05CE60CD513FB2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Soul Touched Sculkshelf"
	quest.7B18E086CE93DFC2.quest_desc: ["Light Gray Chalk serves as an improved foundational chalk above White, stabilizing pentacles made with it more."]
	quest.7B18E086CE93DFC2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chalk Light Gray Impure"
	quest.7B1ED0C9D4271B85.quest_desc: ["Goggles allow you to see more information about placed Create components."]
	quest.7B1ED0C9D4271B85.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Goggles"
	quest.7B2175164FA89265.quest_desc: ["Make the Sonorous Staff in a Mechanical Crafter using Sculk Bones, Soul Crystals, an Echo Ingot and the Heart of the Deep." "It fires the Warden's sonic boom."]
	quest.7B2175164FA89265.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sonorous Staff"
	quest.7B225E82C291C495.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Sour Cherry Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7B225E82C291C495.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sour Cherry Sapling"
	quest.7B29A14775280AF9.quest_desc: ["Variants to find: the End Stronghold and the Nether Stronghold."]
	quest.7B29A14775280AF9.quest_subtitle: "Find both Stronghold variants"
	quest.7B2FDB2133E9252D.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Diamond Seeds. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7B2FDB2133E9252D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Diamond Seeds"
	quest.7B34CEE8E6AE719E.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Limited Gold Barrel 2. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7B34CEE8E6AE719E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Limited Gold Barrel 2"
	quest.7B395003600EFF43.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Bread Loaf. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7B395003600EFF43.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bread Loaf"
	quest.7B486B782E261467.quest_desc: ["QIO Drives hold the items in a QIO System. They work similar to AE2 drives where it has a maximum amount of space and types it can hold."]
	quest.7B486B782E261467.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Qio Drive Hyper Dense"
	quest.7B4950940EE127E2.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Roast Stuffed Hoglin. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7B4950940EE127E2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Roast Stuffed Hoglin"
	quest.7B53ABE816807459.quest_desc: ["The Thermal Springstone Chestplate is crafted from Thermal Springstone Ingots in Eternal Starlight." "This armor ignites attackers and offers strong fire protection, making it useful in hazardous hot areas."]
	quest.7B53ABE816807459.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thermal Springstone Chestplate"
	quest.7B55A604A781A81D.quest_desc: ["The Thallasium Sword Handle is a component for assembling a Thallasium Sword at the Smithing Table." "Combine it with a Thallasium tool head using the Tool Assembly Smithing Template."]
	quest.7B55A604A781A81D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thallasium Sword Handle"
	quest.7B5F67022FD04EF1.quest_desc: ["Ignis is a Cataclysm boss awakened in the Burning Arena who controls the Nether's flames." "Expect relentless attacks and plenty of fire. He is one of the mod's toughest bosses."]
	quest.7B5F67022FD04EF1.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Ignis"
	quest.7B5F67022FD04EF1.title: "Ignis"
	quest.7B62B380000F160A.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Distillation Tower. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7B62B380000F160A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Distillation Tower"
	quest.7B62B380000F160A.title: "TOTAL Distillation"
	quest.7B75C398B88D5EC1.quest_desc: ["This is the Copper Drill. This will give you stones and dirts, mostly used as building materials. Check the outputs in EMI and make sure you know that the drill has a chance of breaking, so don't just make one."]
	quest.7B75C398B88D5EC1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Copper Drill"
	quest.7B75C398B88D5EC1.title: "Copper Drill"
	quest.7B793700836BA897.quest_desc: ["Bring White Poplar Sapling into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7B793700836BA897.quest_subtitle: "Obtain White Poplar Sapling"
	quest.7B7E50CCE5104A9D.quest_desc: ["Glacite Shards drop from Glacite ore underground in frozen regions. They are mainly used for Glacite equipment and smithing trim colors." "Thioquartz Shards come from Thioquartz clusters inside crystal geodes and are used for basic armor and trim colors." "Neither is vital for progression, but both are handy early resources."]
	quest.7B7E50CCE5104A9D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thioquartz Shard and Glacite Shard"
	quest.7B7E50CCE5104A9D.title: "Frozen and Sulfur Crystals"
	quest.7B8CBE1F84888E6F.quest_desc: ["Bring Transistor into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7B8CBE1F84888E6F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Transistor"
	quest.7B91CDC8202CB41F.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: Transform Poison."]
	quest.7B91CDC8202CB41F.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Transform Poison"
	quest.7B92826F31BC4FB5.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Stuffed Pepper. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7B92826F31BC4FB5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Stuffed Pepper"
	quest.7B9913E754E714B7.quest_desc: ["Electric Pumps are a simple machine that, once put over a pool of liquid, gathers it at the cost of power. One example of early power generation is to put the pump in the Nether over lava and you virtually have an infinite lava source for heat generators."]
	quest.7B9913E754E714B7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Electric Pump"
	quest.7BAB96EC8F18DE53.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.7BAB96EC8F18DE53.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Summon Steed"
	quest.7BB09D3C9385785C.quest_desc: ["A unique axe dropped by the Minoshroom."]
	quest.7BB09D3C9385785C.quest_subtitle: "Get the Golden Minotaur Axe"
	quest.7BBBA6FAFE679818.quest_desc: ["Bring Diesel Jetpack into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7BBBA6FAFE679818.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Diesel Jetpack"
	quest.7BBBA6FAFE679818.title: "Ely... We Meant Jetpack!"
	quest.7BC7CD1E1D7D2A99.quest_desc: ["Bring Pink Salmon into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7BC7CD1E1D7D2A99.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pink Salmon"
	quest.7BD0154228BD107D.quest_desc: ["The Starlit Diamond Helmet is crafted from Starlit Diamonds in Eternal Starlight." "Starlit Diamond armor gives protection comparable to Netherite, with higher armor toughness and knockback resistance."]
	quest.7BD0154228BD107D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Starlit Diamond Helmet"
	quest.7BD87511BE7D8DE8.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Brown Toolbox from Create. It is a portable storage block with 8 slots, each holding up to 4 stacks of items." "Once placed, nearby players can open it remotely with the toolbox keybind. Brown is the default toolbox color."]
	quest.7BD87511BE7D8DE8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Brown Toolbox"
	quest.7BD9469601DF1EB8.quest_desc: ["The first piece of the Yeti armor set. Get the boots to unlock the chestplate and leggings."]
	quest.7BDE1A49BE2173AC.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Furnator Spirited. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7BDE1A49BE2173AC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Furnator Spirited"
	quest.7BDEB441C166397A.quest_desc: ["Bring Limited Netherite Barrel 3 into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7BDEB441C166397A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Limited Netherite Barrel 3"
	quest.7BE91B78520F564B.quest_desc: ["This is an advanced version of the Liquid Compressor. It offers a much faster generation rate of 50 mL/tick but also produces heat. As the temperature rises, efficiency decreases. The bottom arrow on the temperature gauge shows where efficiency will begin to decline, while the top arrow indicates the point of 0% efficiency. Contrary to expectations, this machine will not explode even if the temperature becomes excessively high."]
	quest.7BE91B78520F564B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Liquid Compressor"
	quest.7BED617A7B733C23.quest_desc: ["Blocks of voidflame coal can be transformed into raw eclipse ember. 3–4 eclipse embers will drop from it. Burns 81x more items than coal."]
	quest.7BED617A7B733C23.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Coal T4"
	quest.7BF5087C34F404B5.quest_desc: ["Captured blazes enjoy eggs, like their distant forbear, Calcifer."]
	quest.7BF5087C34F404B5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blaze Burner"
	quest.7BFD40F887AEABA1.quest_desc: ["Increases luck."]
	quest.7BFD40F887AEABA1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gold Hook"
	quest.7C0184A29B8530EB.quest_desc: ["Used to create ME Storage Cells."]
	quest.7C0184A29B8530EB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cell Component 1k"
	quest.7C032CF2D6A818A5.quest_desc: ["The Deepsilver Sword is crafted from Deepsilver Ingots in Eternal Starlight." "It is an early to mid progression weapon for swamp and dark biomes, a step above basic materials like Amaramber."]
	quest.7C032CF2D6A818A5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Deepsilver Sword"
	quest.7C07BB3BBB3FDF77.quest_desc: ["A Steel Ingot can be created by smelting Steel Dust in any type of furnace."]
	quest.7C07BB3BBB3FDF77.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ingot Steel"
	quest.7C07BB3BBB3FDF77.title: "Steel Ingot"
	quest.7C09410A1FD486BD.quest_desc: ["With the help of spirits, it's possible to create a link to another dimension where you can store all of those items you've amassed - truly, your collection is a marvel. You'll need the Storage Actuator to do this. Think of it as a really big chest."]
	quest.7C09410A1FD486BD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Storage Controller"
	quest.7C0A1B83C10124DA.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Citron Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7C0A1B83C10124DA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Citron Sapling"
	quest.7C23C05B8F70779F.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Fluid Valve. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7C23C05B8F70779F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fluid Valve"
	quest.7C27AA86443ED0F9.quest_desc: ["Sneak and right-click with the rod to open its screen and equip hooks, bobbers and baits."]
	quest.7C27AA86443ED0F9.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Starcatcher Rod"
	quest.7C341563D8014FB6.quest_desc: ["Chemical Tanks are Mekanism's batteries for storing Gases. They can be placed as a block and do interact with Pressurized Tubes. They come in the four levels, each increasing the storage capacity and output rate."]
	quest.7C341563D8014FB6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Chemical Tank"
	quest.7C3C26679DDAC466.quest_desc: ["This is the base ring to create other magical rings."]
	quest.7C3C26679DDAC466.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ring of Potential"
	quest.7C4787163949EC8E.quest_desc: ["With Brass Funnels, you can even filter a Mechanical Arm's targets."]
	quest.7C4787163949EC8E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mechanical Arm"
	quest.7C484AA252A54063.quest_desc: ["Glowstone Ingots are made by putting Glowstone in a powered Osmium Compressor with Glowstone in the top and Osmium Ingots in the bottom. Glowstone Ingots can be used for making Glowstone Armor, Refined Glowstone blocks and Teleporter Frames."]
	quest.7C484AA252A54063.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ingot Refined Glowstone"
	quest.7C4FC1375920D2AA.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for 4x Wirecoil Copper Ins. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7C4FC1375920D2AA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 4x Wirecoil Copper Ins"
	quest.7C5B17F127E7784B.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Cocobolo Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7C5B17F127E7784B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cocobolo Sapling"
	quest.7C60BC4F89255E20.quest_desc: ["Warden Carapace drops from the Warden and also turns up in Ancient City chests." "It is the main ingredient of the Reinforced Echo Shard."]
	quest.7C60BC4F89255E20.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Warden Carapace"
	quest.7C6DF17082075063.quest_desc: ["The Roll Table from Create: Dreams n' Desires is a mechanical processing machine. Feed it rotational power to roll materials into new forms and widen your factory's manufacturing options."]
	quest.7C6DF17082075063.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Roll Table"
	quest.7C6F64CCAC58F0BF.quest_desc: ["Travel to Overworld."]
	quest.7C6F64CCAC58F0BF.quest_subtitle: "Travel to Overworld"
	quest.7C6F64CCAC58F0BF.title: "New World"
	quest.7C6FF2A1C1753EBB.quest_desc: ["Universal Cables are Mekanism's way to transfer power. Capacity: 409.60 kFE/t."]
	quest.7C6FF2A1C1753EBB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Elite Universal Cable"
	quest.7C6FF2A1C1753EBB.title: "Elite Universal Cable"
	quest.7C728225DD7116CB.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Stormscale. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7C728225DD7116CB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Stormscale"
	quest.7C74D653429D7DE9.quest_desc: ["Craft the Ignitium Helmet from Cataclysm using Ignitium, the metal left by Ignis." "It is one piece of the Ignitium Armor Set."]
	quest.7C74D653429D7DE9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ignitium Helmet"
	quest.7C77202B82BD425C.quest_desc: ["Reprocssed Fissile Fragments can be processed in an Injection Chamber with Hdyrogen Chloride to make Fissile Fuel."]
	quest.7C77202B82BD425C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Reprocessed Fissile Fragment"
	quest.7C7C882001DA2B9F.quest_desc: ["Attracts nearby items."]
	quest.7C7C882001DA2B9F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Universal Attractor"
	quest.7C80C8D1FCBB98AB.quest_desc: ["Emeralds can be found while mining, exploring, or trading with villagers and is used to craft the Evocation Scrolls."]
	quest.7C80C8D1FCBB98AB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Emerald"
	quest.7C850BA1B451D57C.quest_desc: ["Simple version: places fluids, with speed and orientation controls and optional redstone sensitivity. Advanced version: adds filtering and offset AOE, and needs power."]
	quest.7C850BA1B451D57C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.7C9A1D06EC6F7BD4.quest_desc: ["Lets the wearer see in the dark."]
	quest.7C9A1D06EC6F7BD4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Night Vision Goggles"
	quest.7C9FEE11E99162DD.quest_desc: ["Make a Chocolate Milkshake with the processing machines of Create: Dreams n' Desires. It is a simple, sweet recipe that adds a tasty product to your factory."]
	quest.7C9FEE11E99162DD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chocolate Milkshake"
	quest.7CA2C6F551629CE1.quest_desc: ["Bookshelves do more than decorate. They strengthen your Enchanting Table." "Gather enough to surround your enchanting setup and get the best results."]
	quest.7CA2C6F551629CE1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 16x Bookshelf"
	quest.7CA2C6F551629CE1.title: "Knowledge is Power"
	quest.7CAB3134D2EE78C5.quest_desc: ["Used to summon several forms of wilden including the Wilden Chimera."]
	quest.7CAB3134D2EE78C5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ritual Wilden Summon"
	quest.7CB53630F548B2E8.quest_desc: ["Bring Fish Seeds into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7CB53630F548B2E8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fish Seeds"
	quest.7CC01EDFDD7DB9A7.quest_desc: ["The Flowglaze Sword is a weapon from Eternal Starlight in the Flowglaze equipment tier." "It is crafted from Flowglaze materials and fits mid-to-late game."]
	quest.7CC01EDFDD7DB9A7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Flowglaze Sword"
	quest.7CD904A99A98F388.quest_desc: ["Bring Magmator Starter into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7CD904A99A98F388.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Magmator Starter"
	quest.7CDC197CBB934198.quest_desc: ["Bring Hunting Belt into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7CDC197CBB934198.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Hunting Belt"
	quest.7CDF5893EB316BD7.quest_desc: ["Find the Acropolis from Cataclysm, a large structure that generates in the deep ocean and is the domain of Scylla, the Storm Empress." "Use the Eye of Storm to locate it."]
	quest.7CDF5893EB316BD7.title: "Acropolis"
	quest.7CE204A61C02366E.quest_desc: ["The Scarecrow Coat is part of the Scarecrow Armor set in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. It gives +8 Armor and +75 Max Mana." "It is crafted from Hay Bales and Leather."]
	quest.7CE204A61C02366E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pumpkin Chestplate"
	quest.7CE7C25AA40B8412.quest_desc: ["Wizard Robes belong to the basic Wizard Armor set in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. They are crafted from Arcane Cloth and boost your mana and spell power."]
	quest.7CE7C25AA40B8412.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wizard Chestplate"
	quest.7CF90701257EA202.quest_desc: ["Pyromancer Leggings are part of the Pyromancer Armor set in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. They give +6 Armor, +125 Max Mana, +10% Fire Spell Power and +5% Spell Power." "Craft them from 7 Arcane Cloth and 1 Fire Rune, or upgrade Wizard Leggings with 1 Fire Rune at a Smithing Table."]
	quest.7CF90701257EA202.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pyromancer Leggings"
	quest.7D027650D0554AE8.quest_desc: ["Swaps the item in your hand for the one that works best on the block or entity you left-click."]
	quest.7D027650D0554AE8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Tool Swapper Upgrade"
	quest.7D074CDAA4B03FAE.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Supremium Watering Can. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7D074CDAA4B03FAE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Supremium Watering Can"
	quest.7D0C5977BAFE0157.quest_desc: ["Certus Quartz is found as ore underground and inside meteorites. Its crystals are the base of most AE2 materials."]
	quest.7D2B001784338170.quest_desc: ["Insert enchanted books into the Seashelf of Aquatic Filtration to stop those enchantments from appearing in the table." "The more books you insert, the more Eterna and Arcana it gives. Craft it from Infused Seashelves and Prismarine."]
	quest.7D2B001784338170.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Filtering Shelf"
	quest.7D313F28BBB47A6F.quest_desc: ["Like the Magnet Upgrade, with more filtering options."]
	quest.7D313F28BBB47A6F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Magnet Upgrade"
	quest.7D3F97C5832AF3B7.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Blank Thread. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7D3F97C5832AF3B7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blank Thread"
	quest.7D5135449D0544A8.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.7D5135449D0544A8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Infusing Factory"
	quest.7D56164DCB068383.quest_desc: ["Obtain an Empty Blaze Burner from Create. It is the first step toward a working Blaze Burner, a key heat source for advanced machinery." "Right-click a Blaze or Blaze Spawner with it to fill it. Once filled, it provides heat for heated and superheated recipes, including Brass production."]
	quest.7D56164DCB068383.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Empty Blaze Burner"
	quest.7D5AB924D152BDB8.quest_desc: ["Bring Enchanted Gravitite into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7D5AB924D152BDB8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Enchanted Gravitite"
	quest.7D5AB924D152BDB8.title: "Pink is the New Blue"
	quest.7D5BE375773C489E.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Mechanical Bearing. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7D5BE375773C489E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mechanical Bearing"
	quest.7D659D5269823682.quest_desc: ["Breaks blocks without solid colision boxes.. like tracks, levers, buttons, etc."]
	quest.7D659D5269823682.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mechanical Plough"
	quest.7D6F8AF3728BEA44.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Source Gem Block. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7D6F8AF3728BEA44.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Source Gem Block"
	quest.7D72B278D68E7B8C.quest_desc: ["Lets the wearer walk on powder snow and makes ice less slippery."]
	quest.7D72B278D68E7B8C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Snowshoes"
	quest.7D73F7A74981606A.quest_desc: ["Bring Smart Filter into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7D73F7A74981606A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.7D73F7A74981606A.title: "Alchemical Niter"
	quest.7D76213346646EAD.quest_desc: ["Get hold of 8x Treated Wood Horizontal. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7D76213346646EAD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 8x Treated Wood Horizontal"
	quest.7D76213346646EAD.title: "Treated Wood Planks"
	quest.7D80ADA71E6B6C65.quest_desc: ["A collection point for feeding bees that holds 3 item blocks. When Lumber or Quarry bees feed from it, it produces a random item. It can be honeylogged, which gives the bees regeneration."]
	quest.7D80ADA71E6B6C65.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Feeder"
	quest.7D891AD3479B3A0D.quest_desc: ["Nature Rune is a crafting ingredient in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks, used for advanced Nature crafting such as Nature Upgrade Orbs. The Nature school uses Poisonous Potato as its Focus." "Combine a Blank Runestone with 8 Poisonous Potatoes to make one."]
	quest.7D891AD3479B3A0D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Nature Rune"
	quest.7D8C5B734E277429.quest_desc: ["The Deepsilver Helmet is crafted from Deepsilver Ingots in Eternal Starlight." "Deepsilver armor raises movement speed, attack speed and knockback resistance. The full set also grants immunity to several negative status effects."]
	quest.7D8C5B734E277429.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Deepsilver Helmet"
	quest.7D92ED988DF486ED.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Cedar Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7D92ED988DF486ED.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cedar Sapling"
	quest.7D9C263C62F23F27.quest_desc: ["This Rod is pre-attuned to find Budding Amethyst. Amethyst is used rather a lot in alchemy, and is needed for better Divining Rods."]
	quest.7D9C263C62F23F27.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Amethyst Divination Rod"
	quest.7D9CEC4EB58A7E23.quest_desc: ["Bring Assembly Program Drill Laser into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7D9CEC4EB58A7E23.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Assembly Program Drill Laser"
	quest.7D9DFEFD0C30F42B.quest_desc: ["The Glacite Hoe is crafted from Glacite Ingots in Eternal Starlight." "It prepares farmland in cold biomes and lasts longer than earlier materials."]
	quest.7D9DFEFD0C30F42B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glacite Hoe"
	quest.7DA0B06B988E21FA.quest_desc: ["You can find a Warden Upgrade Smithing Template in Ancient City chests. Every piece of Warden gear needs one." "Duplicate it with diamonds and sculk so you never run short."]
	quest.7DA0B06B988E21FA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Warden Upgrade Smithing Template"
	quest.7DB2F0894066E0B3.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Emblem of Defense. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7DB2F0894066E0B3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Emblem of Defense"
	quest.7DB66A8913111410.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Walnut Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7DB66A8913111410.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Walnut Sapling"
	quest.7DBF313D54FA739C.quest_desc: ["The first tier of spawner upgrades. It improves the basic spawning stats of a spawner beyond vanilla limits."]
	quest.7DBF313D54FA739C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Frontier Spawner Upgrade Rune"
	quest.7DBF313D54FA739C.title: "Frontier Spawner Upgrade Rune"
	quest.7DC1316C6B453F2F.quest_desc: ["The Autoloader Crossbow is a unique ranged weapon in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. It automatically loads the next projectile from your inventory, including arrows and fireworks. Crouch-click to cancel the auto-loading." "You can find it as a rare reward in Ominous Vaults. It has 465 durability and accepts normal Crossbow enchantments."]
	quest.7DC1316C6B453F2F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Autoloader Crossbow"
	quest.7DC30C7C1E0B6563.quest_desc: ["Used to craft upgrades for storage."]
	quest.7DC30C7C1E0B6563.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Upgrade Base"
	quest.7DCD8D983E05F9E4.quest_desc: ["Spider Overhaul adds new spider variants and behaviors. Watch where you travel, especially in dark or enclosed areas, and learn how the variants differ."]
	quest.7DCD8D983E05F9E4.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.7DD43DC45BC21620.quest_desc: ["The Cultist Hood is the helmet of the Cultist Armor set in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks. It gives +3 Armor, +125 Max Mana, +10% Blood Spell Power and +5% Spell Power." "Craft it from 5 Arcane Cloth and 1 Blood Rune, or upgrade a Wizard Hood with a Blood Rune at a Smithing Table on current versions."]
	quest.7DD43DC45BC21620.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cultist Helmet"
	quest.7DD6256662D787D8.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Nether Quartz Seeds. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7DD6256662D787D8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Nether Quartz Seeds"
	quest.7DDDD110D976BF09.quest_desc: ["Lunaris Cacti grow in the desert regions of Eternal Starlight and are used in crafting and refinement." "Harvest them carefully, since their sharp nature can still hurt unprepared players."]
	quest.7DDDD110D976BF09.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Lunaris Cactus"
	quest.7DEB14F944374E25.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Awakened Supremium Essence. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7DEB14F944374E25.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Awakened Supremium Essence"
	quest.7DFA508A9DB05D63.quest_desc: ["Grab Bars help you climb aboard and move around your train, and their materials let you match your build." "They come in Andesite, Brass and Copper, so consider collecting all three."]
	quest.7DFA508A9DB05D63.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Andesite Grab Rails, Brass Grab Rails and Copper Grab Rails"
	quest.7E12929804B4E696.quest_desc: ["Orange Chalk is perfect for calling upon Afrit, though it does not offer control over them."]
	quest.7E12929804B4E696.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chalk Orange Impure"
	quest.7E16C414F4B39363.quest_desc: ["Used for 1 time teleportation."]
	quest.7E16C414F4B39363.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Warp Scroll"
	quest.7E1CC8A6310C2424.quest_desc: ["Bring Disk Drive 4k into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7E1CC8A6310C2424.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Disk Drive 4k"
	quest.7E1D10F283E8AF6A.quest_desc: ["Mechanical Pistons use rotational power to extend and retract Piston Extension Poles and push Create contraptions." "The extension distance depends on how many Extension Poles are attached. Adding a Slimeball makes it a Sticky Mechanical Piston, which pulls blocks back when retracting."]
	quest.7E1D10F283E8AF6A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sticky Mechanical Piston and Mechanical Piston"
	quest.7E1D10F283E8AF6A.title: "Mechanical Piston and Sticky Mechanical Piston"
	quest.7E2522100BFBA8CB.quest_desc: ["WannaBees can extract mob loot from mobs encased in amber."]
	quest.7E2522100BFBA8CB.quest_subtitle: "Get a WannaBee spawn egg"
	quest.7E2522100BFBA8CB.title: "WannaBee"
	quest.7E2A26EC8946F384.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Cave Dweller Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7E2A26EC8946F384.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cave Dweller Sapling"
	quest.7E40CBEA95B9F0D8.quest_desc: ["The Mechanical Crossbow is an advanced ranged weapon from Eternal Starlight." "It is crafted from refined dimensional materials and is a stronger alternative to standard ranged weapons for players who have beaten the mod's bosses."]
	quest.7E40CBEA95B9F0D8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mechanical Crossbow"
	quest.7E40CBEA95B9F0D8.title: "Mechanical Crossbow"
	quest.7E4824F8FCC84D0E.quest_desc: ["The Warden drops the Heart of the Deep. Use it on the portal frame at the center of an Ancient City to open the way to the Otherside." "You will also need it for the Sonorous Staff."]
	quest.7E4824F8FCC84D0E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Heart of the Deep"
	quest.7E4BC32E8DCAA415.quest_desc: ["Bring Plate of Stuffed Hoglin Ham into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7E4BC32E8DCAA415.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Plate of Stuffed Hoglin Ham"
	quest.7E4D92A6BD9831D4.quest_desc: ["Sourceberry bushes grow in taiga and archwood biomes. The berries are used for Source Berry Rolls and Pies and for mana regeneration potions."]
	quest.7E4D92A6BD9831D4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 2x Sourceberry Bush"
	quest.7E4D92A6BD9831D4.title: "Sourceberries"
	quest.7E4EC4681E63F0F9.quest_desc: ["Ah, the humble but reliable Millstone. The Crushing Wheels may be faster, but the millstone fits better in many builds.. and you don't fit in it, so there's that."]
	quest.7E4EC4681E63F0F9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Millstone"
	quest.7E5248111AE003B3.quest_desc: ["The Oven gives your kitchen smelting abilities."]
	quest.7E5248111AE003B3.quest_subtitle: "Adds smelting to your kitchen"
	quest.7E578D628F1DEBCB.quest_desc: ["Chemical Tanks are Mekanism's batteries for storing Gases. They can be placed as a block and do interact with Pressurized Tubes. They come in the four levels, each increasing the storage capacity and output rate."]
	quest.7E578D628F1DEBCB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Elite Chemical Tank"
	quest.7E66A8EEB887105F.quest_desc: ["Can run recipes of any single block electric crafting machine provided to it in batches. Batch size is determined by the amount of machines provided to it. Insert electric crafting machines to run in parallel."]
	quest.7E66A8EEB887105F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Processing Array, 16x Clean Stainless Steel Machine Casing, 2x Stainless Steel Machine Casing Pipe and 2x Glass"
	quest.7E74EE5E4399496A.quest_desc: ["Any animal in the Twilight Forest counts."]
	quest.7E74EE5E4399496A.quest_subtitle: "Hunt some local wildlife"
	quest.7E7DBC9818076878.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Ring of Elusiveness. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7E7DBC9818076878.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ring of Elusiveness"
	quest.7E812125B36A93F2.quest_desc: ["Make the Warden Mage Helmet in a Mechanical Crafter using a Netherite Mage Helmet from Iron's Spells, Echo Ingots, Warden Carapace, a Reinforced Echo Shard and a Warden Upgrade Template." "Spell power and upgrades from the netherite piece are not kept."]
	quest.7E812125B36A93F2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Warden Mage Helmet"
	quest.7E93E0940C97B0E7.quest_desc: ["Smelts faster and burns fuel more efficiently than the vanilla Furnace."]
	quest.7E93E0940C97B0E7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Copper Furnace"
	quest.7E95240CA9FDB47B.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Player Transmitter Blazing. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7E95240CA9FDB47B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Player Transmitter Blazing"
	quest.7E995ED1725E1A80.quest_desc: ["Smelts 24 items."]
	quest.7E995ED1725E1A80.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Prudentium Coal"
	quest.7EC392D4AD679DB5.quest_desc: ["Find a city in the Overworld."]
	quest.7EC392D4AD679DB5.quest_subtitle: "Enter an Overworld City"
	quest.7ED0B67E2B028C18.quest_desc: ["The Grindstone repairs gear and removes enchantments from it. Collect one so your weapons stay ready for any fight."]
	quest.7ED0B67E2B028C18.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Grindstone"
	quest.7ED0B67E2B028C18.title: "Sharpen Your Skills"
	quest.7ED18CACCE793DC9.quest_desc: ["Assemble the Aeternium Sword from an Aeternium tool head and sword handle at a Smithing Table." "It is Better End's strongest sword and outclasses Netherite swords."]
	quest.7ED18CACCE793DC9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Aeternium Sword"
	quest.7ED1EA0C9E87DD59.quest_desc: ["Allows you to make patterns that need to be inserted specific direction to tell it through the pattern what side of the machine its importing/exporting."]
	quest.7ED1EA0C9E87DD59.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Adv Pattern Encoder"
	quest.7ED6205FC8C28915.quest_desc: ["The leggings of the Yeti armor set. Together with the chestplate, they unlock the helmet."]
	quest.7EECE4B9127EB096.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Juniper Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7EECE4B9127EB096.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Juniper Sapling"
	quest.7EF6D60AF9198383.quest_desc: ["Bring Quantum Bubble into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7EF6D60AF9198383.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Quantum Bubble"
	quest.7EF729C49781FC32.quest_desc: ["Expands the inventory of the shulker box."]
	quest.7EF729C49781FC32.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Netherite Shulker Box"
	quest.7EF7A2E8EEEA8535.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Knightmetal Seeds. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7EF7A2E8EEEA8535.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Knightmetal Seeds"
	quest.7EF96B9BB78AF4CF.quest_desc: ["Assemble this multiblock with the Engineer's Hammer. It presses ingots into plates, gears and rods using molds."]
	quest.7EF96B9BB78AF4CF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 2x Steel Scaffolding Standard, Rs Engineering, Piston and 2 more items"
	quest.7EF96B9BB78AF4CF.title: "Metal Press Multiblock"
	quest.7EFD9AEF5DA3A64B.quest_desc: ["Enchanter's tools can be given a spell at the Scribe's Table. The Mirror casts a self spell on you at a discount with extra duration on its glyphs, and it does not need a Form glyph like the other tools."]
	quest.7EFD9AEF5DA3A64B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wand, Enchanters Sword, Enchanters Shield and 2 more items"
	quest.7EFD9AEF5DA3A64B.title: "Enchanter's Tools"
	quest.7F0187ACE5E5B240.quest_desc: ["Tier 2 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.7F0187ACE5E5B240.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Explosion"
	quest.7F0399FABD72F56D.quest_desc: ["Many keys from mods are not bound by default. Open Options, then Controls, and assign keys for the mods you use. The search bar helps you find an action fast."]
	quest.7F0399FABD72F56D.quest_subtitle: "Many modded keys start unbound."
	quest.7F0399FABD72F56D.title: "Bind Your Keys"
	quest.7F0C39C1BE98DA73.quest_desc: ["This device converts compressed air into Forge Energy (compatible with RF and many other mods’ energy). It has a base efficiency of 40%, meaning 100 mL of air generates 40 FE. Speed Upgrades will slightly reduce this efficiency. The Dynamo also produces heat, which needs to be managed to prevent a loss in efficiency."]
	quest.7F0C39C1BE98DA73.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pneumatic Dynamo"
	quest.7F167264C32900F9.quest_desc: ["Bring Purple Spiral Sapling into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7F167264C32900F9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Purple Spiral Sapling"
	quest.7F17DEB90BDCB5D3.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.7F17DEB90BDCB5D3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Self"
	quest.7F2E9B7E0F5AAFC8.quest_desc: ["The Rotary Condensentrator (pronounced \"con-DEN-sen-traitor\") is used for converting substances between liquid and gaseous forms at a rate of 1:1. It has two modes: Decondensentrating, which turns Liquids into Gases, and Condensentrating, which turns Gases into Liquids."]
	quest.7F2E9B7E0F5AAFC8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rotary Condensentrator"
	quest.7F4F05267ACB5A78.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Supremium Ingot. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7F4F05267ACB5A78.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Supremium Ingot"
	quest.7F50B5CF478E4BEB.quest_desc: ["Bring Strider Egg into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7F50B5CF478E4BEB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Strider Egg"
	quest.7F5FABDF60582A19.quest_desc: ["Holy Rune is a crafting ingredient in Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks, used for advanced Holy crafting such as Holy Upgrade Orbs and Holy equipment." "Surround a Blank Runestone with 8 Divine Pearls to make one. Divine Pearl is the Holy Focus."]
	quest.7F5FABDF60582A19.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Holy Rune"
	quest.7F6887517E63F6BE.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Configurable Honeycomb. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7F6887517E63F6BE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.7F6BEA087FCC880D.quest_desc: ["The Chemical Dissolution Chamber is the first machine in the x5 ore processing setup."]
	quest.7F6BEA087FCC880D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chemical Dissolution Chamber"
	quest.7F80CAF056A68482.quest_desc: ["Powered Crystal Growth Accelerators speed up the growth of adjacent budding quartz. Must be powered via the top or bottom, and consumes a steady 8 ae/t while plugged in."]
	quest.7F80CAF056A68482.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Growth Accelerator"
	quest.7F8EC51B1C57FBAA.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.7F8EC51B1C57FBAA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ultimate Purifying Factory"
	quest.7F99FFAD3129599F.quest_desc: ["The Capacitor from Create Crafts and Additions stores Forge Energy (FE) for later, which helps steady your factory's electrical network. In version 1.6.0 for NeoForge 1.21.1, it can also be charged directly with FE."]
	quest.7F99FFAD3129599F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Capacitor"
	quest.7FA15C398E515DBC.quest_desc: ["Bring Springy Boot into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7FA15C398E515DBC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Springy Boot"
	quest.7FAC2F1EF914698C.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Configurable Honeycomb. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7FAC2F1EF914698C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.7FB9EE5CFA3688A6.quest_desc: ["Iron gear will not protect you forever. Craft a full set of Diamond Armor." "Diamond is one of the strongest Overworld materials and prepares you for tougher enemies and deeper exploration."]
	quest.7FB9EE5CFA3688A6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Diamond Helmet, Diamond Chestplate, Diamond Leggings and Diamond Boots"
	quest.7FB9EE5CFA3688A6.title: "Diamond Armor"
	quest.7FCA2AA5096B3346.quest_desc: ["The first piece of the Nano armor set. Get the boots to unlock the chestplate and leggings."]
	quest.7FCE81F4EB5DB0C6.quest_desc: ["Defeat Priest."]
	quest.7FCE81F4EB5DB0C6.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Priest"
	quest.7FD2757B52219527.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Portal Frame. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7FD2757B52219527.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Portal Frame"
	quest.7FE51DF3CB943492.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Energy Cable Nitro. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7FE51DF3CB943492.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Cable Nitro"
	quest.7FE84DDB0ADF827F.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Assembly Platform, Assembly Laser, Assembly Io Unit Import and 3 more items. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7FE84DDB0ADF827F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Assembly Platform, Assembly Laser, Assembly Io Unit Import and 3 more items"
	quest.7FF560F3DCCC23BE.quest_desc: ["The Engineering Press is used in an Inscriber to turn Diamond into a Printed Engineering Circuit. Presses are found in meteorites, and the Inscriber can duplicate one with an Iron Block."]
	quest.7FFB1CDFDA24C2EA.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.7FFB1CDFDA24C2EA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ultimate Smelting Factory"
	quest.811B5DBA9C3B6C69.quest_desc: ["Quantum Ring blocks create the frame around a Quantum Link Chamber. Their recipe requires Logic and Engineering Processors, an Energy Cell, iron, and Smart Dense Cable."]
	quest.811B5DBA9C3B6C69.title: "Craft Quantum Ring Blocks"
	quest.8DE444535D7AD8C7.quest_desc: ["NeoTech Reborn is designed to look great while running smoothly. Complementary Unbound and BSL shaders are included, alongside pre-applied resource packs and datapacks for a cohesive experience. 14 GB or more of RAM is recommended; 10–12 GB is the minimum."]
	quest.8DE444535D7AD8C7.quest_subtitle: "Visual polish, shaders, and practical performance guidance."
	quest.8DE444535D7AD8C7.title: "Visuals and Performance"
	quest.8FFFDAD81B77E91B.quest_desc: ["The Wireless Terminal gives wireless access to your ME network when linked to a powered Wireless Access Point. It requires a Receiver, Terminal, and Dense Energy Cell."]
	quest.8FFFDAD81B77E91B.title: "Access Items from Anywhere Nearby"
	quest.9153ACA88F3D86A4.quest_desc: ["Formation Cores are used by export and crafting components. Their recipe combines Certus Quartz, Fluix Dust, and a Logic Processor."]
	quest.9153ACA88F3D86A4.title: "Craft Formation Cores"
	quest.916DD681DFE4FCE2.quest_desc: ["Quartz Fiber separates power between connected ME networks while still allowing data to pass. It is also used in wireless components."]
	quest.916DD681DFE4FCE2.title: "Make Quartz Fiber"
	quest.94885582FF7946C6.quest_desc: ["A Fluix Pearl is made from Fluix, Fluix Dust, and an Ender Pearl. It is required for AE2 wireless components and the Quantum Link Chamber."]
	quest.94885582FF7946C6.title: "Create a Fluix Pearl"
	quest.9EAF8522B35926AD.quest_desc: ["Combine the Item Cell Housing and 1k Cell Component to make a 1k Item Storage Cell. Insert it into an ME Drive to store items on the network."]
	quest.9EAF8522B35926AD.title: "Assemble a 1k Item Storage Cell"
	quest.A13CE3F55A19E03C.quest_desc: ["The Matter Condenser consumes items from an ME network and turns accumulated matter into Singularities. Connect it to a powered network and give it items to process."]
	quest.A13CE3F55A19E03C.title: "Build a Matter Condenser"
	quest.B6DA5F849F19EF81.quest_desc: ["Crafting Units form the foundation of an ME Crafting CPU. Add crafting storage and other CPU components to expand the size and speed of crafting jobs."]
	quest.B6DA5F849F19EF81.title: "Build a Crafting Unit"
	quest.C24830A27A12C286.quest_desc: ["A Pattern Provider supplies encoded patterns to adjacent inventories or machines. It is a key part of connecting external processing to ME autocrafting."]
	quest.C24830A27A12C286.title: "Provide Patterns to Machines"
	quest.CA090624224EA826.quest_desc: ["An Export Bus pushes selected items from your network into an attached inventory. Use it to supply machines or keep blocks stocked."]
	quest.CA090624224EA826.title: "Automate Item Output"
	quest.D45DB55E7E3CA223.quest_desc: ["Annihilation Cores are used by import and crafting components. Their recipe combines Nether Quartz, Fluix Dust, and a Logic Processor."]
	quest.D45DB55E7E3CA223.title: "Craft Annihilation Cores"
	quest.DC9215C9F5C006B1.quest_desc: ["The Item Cell Housing combines with a storage component to make an item cell. Keep item storage cells distinct from fluid and spatial cells."]
	quest.DC9215C9F5C006B1.title: "Prepare an Item Cell Housing"
	quest.EAE1FEA40BF08A63.quest_desc: ["The Pattern Encoding Terminal lets you encode patterns for crafting and processing. It is made by upgrading a Crafting Terminal with an Engineering Processor."]
	quest.EAE1FEA40BF08A63.title: "Encode Processing Patterns"
	quest.EBD12705DAA31418.quest_desc: ["The ME Drive holds storage cells and connects them to your ME network. Add storage cells to the drive, then connect it with Fluix Glass Cable."]
	quest.EBD12705DAA31418.title: "Build an ME Drive"
	quest.ED18447EBCE105C3.quest_desc: ["A Dense Energy Cell stores more power than the standard cell. It is also a component for the Wireless Terminal."]
	quest.ED18447EBCE105C3.title: "Upgrade to a Dense Energy Cell"
	quest.EEB89581C16837DA.quest_desc: ["There is no single way to play. Follow a tech or magic system, explore dungeons and dimensions, build, farm, collect gear, or simply discover what the pack has to offer."]
	quest.EEB89581C16837DA.quest_subtitle: "Pick a direction, or follow several."
	quest.EEB89581C16837DA.title: "Choose Your Adventure"
	quest.F330DEDCCD874A5D.quest_desc: ["An autocrafting setup combines an ME Crafting CPU, Molecular Assemblers, Pattern Providers, and encoded patterns. Connect the components to your network and configure a recipe in the Pattern Encoding Terminal."]
	quest.F330DEDCCD874A5D.title: "Set Up ME Autocrafting"
	quest.F94DE7233A4DA87E.quest_desc: ["The Wireless Access Point connects wireless terminals to a nearby ME network. Attach it to the network and provide power before using a terminal."]
	quest.F94DE7233A4DA87E.title: "Extend the Network Wirelessly"
	quest.FA862D49ECF37798.quest_desc: ["The Molecular Assembler crafts recipes automatically when supplied with ingredients by an ME network. It uses both core types and a crafting table."]
	quest.FA862D49ECF37798.title: "Craft with a Molecular Assembler"
	quest.FBEAA2C4C096AA5E.quest_desc: ["The ME Controller is the central block of a channel-based ME network. Its recipe uses Fluix and an Engineering Processor; connect it to your powered cable network."]
	quest.FBEAA2C4C096AA5E.title: "Build an ME Controller"
